#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:63
msgid ""
"OVAL metadata is used in CVE auditing for only a subset of clients, namely, "
"clients that use openSUSE Leap, SUSE enterprise products, RHEL, Debian or "
"Ubuntu. This is due to the absence of OVAL vulnerability definitions "
"metadata for the other products."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ OVAL ແມ່ນໃຊ້ໃນການກວດສອບ CVE ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍບາງກຸ່ມເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຄືລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ openSUSE Leap, ຜະລິດຕະພັນ SUSE enterprise, RHEL, Debian ຫຼື Ubuntu. ນີ້ກໍຍ້ອນວ່າບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາການລະບຸຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ OVAL ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "CVE Status"
msgstr "ສະຖານະ CVE"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:65
msgid ""
"The CVE status of clients is usually either ``affected``, ``not affected``, "
"or ``patched``.  These statuses are based only on the information that is "
"available to {productname}."
msgstr "ສະຖານະ CVE ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະເປັນ ``affected`` (ມີຜົນກະທົບ), ``not affected`` (ບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບ), ຫຼື ``patched`` (ໄດ້ຮັບແພັດແລ້ວ). ສະຖານະເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນອີງໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:66
msgid "Within {productname}, these definitions apply:"
msgstr "ພາຍໃນ {productname}, ຈະໃຊ້ຄຳນິຍາມເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "System affected by a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຈາກຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:68
msgid ""
"A system which has an installed package with version lower than the version "
"of the same package in a relevant patch marked for the vulnerability."
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ມີການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດເວີຊັນທີ່ຕໍ່າກວ່າເວີຊັນຂອງແພັກເກດດຽວກັນໃນແພັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເຊິ່ງຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "System not affected by a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຈາກຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:70
msgid ""
"A system which has no installed package that is also in a relevant patch "
"marked for the vulnerability."
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ມີຊຸດຊອບແວຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ ເຊິ່ງຢູ່ໃນແພັດ (patch) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງທີ່ລະບຸວ່າເປັນຊ່ອງໂຫວ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "System patched for a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການແພັດ (patched) ສຳລັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:72
msgid ""
"A system which has an installed package with version equal to or greater "
"than the version of the same package in a relevant patch marked for the "
"vulnerability."
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ມີຊຸດຊອບແວຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ ເຊິ່ງມີເວີຊັນເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າເວີຊັນຂອງຊຸດຊອບແວດຽວກັນໃນແພັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງທີ່ລະບຸວ່າເປັນຊ່ອງໂຫວ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "Relevant patch"
msgstr "ແພັດ (patch) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:74
msgid "A patch known by {productname} in a relevant channel."
msgstr "ແພັດທີ່ {productname} ຮູ້ຈັກໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "Relevant channel"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:76
msgid ""
"A channel managed by {productname}, which is either assigned to the system, "
"the original of a cloned channel which is assigned to the system, a channel "
"linked to a product which is installed on the system or a past or future "
"service pack channel for the system."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍ {productname}, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບ, ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ (cloned) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບ, ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບ ຫຼື ຊ່ອງທາງ service pack ໃນອະດີດ ຫຼື ອະນາຄົດສຳລັບລະບົບ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:77
msgid ""
"Because of the definitions used within {productname}, CVE audit results "
"might be incorrect in some circumstances.  For example, unmanaged channels, "
"unmanaged packages, or non-compliant systems might report incorrectly."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກຄຳນິຍາມທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ {productname}, ຜົນການກວດສອບ CVE ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນບາງກໍລະນີ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດການ, ຊຸດຊອບແວທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດການ ຫຼື ລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ອາດຈະລາຍງານຜົນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication With PAM"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ PAM"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports network-based authentication systems using pluggable "
"authentication modules (PAM) using SSSD.  PAM is a suite of libraries that "
"allows you to integrate {productname} with a centralized authentication "
"mechanism, eliminating the need to remember multiple passwords.  "
"{productname} supports LDAP, Kerberos, and other network-based "
"authentication protocols."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບລະບົບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ ໂດຍໃຊ້ pluggable authentication modules (PAM) ຜ່ານ SSSD. PAM ແມ່ນຊຸດຂອງໄລບຣາຣີ (libraries) ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດລວມ {productname} ເຂົ້າກັບກົນໄກການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບສູນກາງ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຈື່ລະຫັດຜ່ານຫຼາຍອັນ. {productname} ຮອງຮັບ LDAP, Kerberos ແລະ ໂປຣໂຕຄໍການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSSD Configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSSD"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring SSSD"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSSD"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Users[Create User] and enable "
"a new or existing user to authenticate with PAM."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Users[Create User] ແລະ ເປີດນຳໃຊ້ໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ ຫຼື ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວສາມາດຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ PAM."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In usernames, additionally to alphanumeric characters, [literal]``-``, "
"[literal]``_``, [literal]``.``, and [literal]``@`` are allowed."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ນອກຈາກຕົວອັກສອນ ແລະ ຕົວເລກແລ້ວ, ຍັງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [literal]``-``, [literal]``_``, [literal]``.``, ແລະ [literal]``@`` ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:7
msgid "Check the [guimenu]``Pluggable Authentication Modules (PAM)`` checkbox."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Pluggable Authentication Modules (PAM)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Configure SSSD in the server container.  At the command prompt of the "
"{productname} container host, as root, enter the server container:"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSSD ໃນ server container. ຢູ່ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງຂອງ host container {productname}, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ server container:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:9
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:6
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl term\n"
msgstr "mgrctl term\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:10
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:7
msgid "Inside the container, execute the following steps:"
msgstr "ພາຍໃນ container, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Edit [path]``/etc/sssd/sssd.conf`` according to your configuration.  For an "
"example, see "
"xref:administration:auth-methods-pam.adoc#auth-methods-pam-ad[]."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ [path]``/etc/sssd/sssd.conf`` ຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ. ເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:auth-methods-pam.adoc#auth-methods-pam-ad[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:12
msgid "When done, exit the container:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ອອກຈາກ container:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "exit\n"
msgstr "exit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:14
msgid "Restart {productname} using:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ {productname} ໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:15
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:43
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:9
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:28
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:18
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:30
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:44
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:39
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:32
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm restart\n"
msgstr "mgradm restart\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Changing the password in the {productname} {webui} changes only the local "
"password on the {productname} Server.  If PAM is enabled for that user, the "
"local password might not be used at all.  In the above example, for "
"instance, the Kerberos password is not changed.  Use the password change "
"mechanism of your network service to change the password for these users."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານໃນ {productname} {webui} ຈະປ່ຽນແຕ່ລະຫັດຜ່ານພາຍໃນ (local password) ຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Server ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າ PAM ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ນັ້ນ, ລະຫັດຜ່ານພາຍໃນອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເລີຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ, ລະຫັດຜ່ານ Kerberos ຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ກົນໄກການປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງບໍລິການເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information about PAM configuration, see the {sles} Security "
"Guide. The Security Guide contains a generic example that also works for "
"other network-based authentication methods.  It also describes how to "
"configure an Active Directory (AD) service.  For more information, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/part-auth.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ PAM, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຄູ່ມືຄວາມປອດໄພ {sles} Security Guide. ຄູ່ມືຄວາມປອດໄພມີຕົວຢ່າງທົ່ວໄປທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍອື່ນໆ. ມັນຍັງອະທິບາຍວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍລິການ Active Directory (AD). ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ {sles-base-os-documentation}/part-auth.html."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "LDAP Integration with Active Directory Example"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ LDAP ກັບ Active Directory"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For LDAP integration with Active Directory, you can use the following "
"example."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ LDAP ກັບ Active Directory, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the code snippet, change the following placeholders according to your "
"environment:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນຂອງໂຄ້ດ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຕົວແປ (placeholders) ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "[literal]``$domain``"
msgstr "[literal]``$domain``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:22
msgid "Your domain name"
msgstr "ຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງທ່ານ"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "[literal]``$ad_server``"
msgstr "[literal]``$ad_server``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:24
msgid ""
"FQDN of the AD server if it is not auto-detected from the "
"[literal]``$domain`` [literal]``$uyuni-hostname``: The name of the machine "
"this AD client is supposed to be known.  If not set, it will be "
"[literal]``uyuni-server.mgr.internal``."
msgstr "FQDN ຂອງ AD server ຖ້າມັນບໍ່ຖືກກວດພົບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກ [literal]``$domain`` [literal]``$uyuni-hostname``: ຊື່ຂອງເຄື່ອງທີ່ AD client ນີ້ຄວນຈະເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໄວ້, ມັນຈະເປັນ [literal]``uyuni-server.mgr.internal``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:25
msgid "Example snippet for [path]``/etc/sssd/sssd.conf``:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງສ່ວນໂຄ້ດສຳລັບ [path]``/etc/sssd/sssd.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[sssd]\n"
"config_file_version = 2\n"
"services = nss, pam\n"
"domains = $domain\n"
msgstr ""
"[sssd]\n"
"config_file_version = 2\n"
"services = nss, pam\n"
"domains = $domain\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "[nss]\n"
msgstr "[nss]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "[pam]\n"
msgstr "[pam]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[domain/$domain]\n"
"id_provider = ad\n"
"chpass_provider = ad\n"
"access_provider = ad\n"
"auth_provider = ad\n"
msgstr ""
"[domain/$domain]\n"
"id_provider = ad\n"
"chpass_provider = ad\n"
"access_provider = ad\n"
"auth_provider = ad\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ad_domain = $domain\n"
"ad_server = $ad_server\n"
"ad_hostname = $uyuni-hostname\n"
msgstr ""
"ad_domain = $domain\n"
"ad_server = $ad_server\n"
"ad_hostname = $uyuni-hostname\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "ad_gpo_map_network = +susemanager\n"
msgstr "ad_gpo_map_network = +susemanager\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"krb5_keytab = FILE:/etc/rhn/krb5.conf.d/krb5.keytab\n"
"krb5_ccname_template = FILE:/tmp/krb5cc_%{uid}\n"
msgstr ""
"krb5_keytab = FILE:/etc/rhn/krb5.conf.d/krb5.keytab\n"
"krb5_ccname_template = FILE:/tmp/krb5cc_%{uid}\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example SSO Implementation"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການນຳໃຊ້ SSO"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In this example, SSO is implemented by exposing three endpoints with "
"{productname}, and using Keycloak 21.0.1 or later as the identity service "
"provider (IdP)."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, SSO ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍການເປີດ endpoint ສາມອັນດ້ວຍ {productname}, ແລະ ໃຊ້ Keycloak 21.0.1 ຫຼື ເວີຊັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າເປັນຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (IdP)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Start by installing the Keycloak IdP, then setting up the {productname} "
"Server.  Then you can add the endpoints as Keycloak clients, and create "
"users."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak IdP, ຈາກນັ້ນຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ endpoint ເປັນ Keycloak clients ແລະ ສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This example is provided for illustrative purposes only.  {suse} does not "
"recommend or support third-party identity service providers, and is not "
"affiliated with Keycloak.  For Keycloak support, see "
"https://www.keycloak.org/."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອເປັນຕົວຢ່າງປະກອບເທົ່ານັ້ນ. {suse} ບໍ່ໄດ້ແນະນຳ ຫຼື ຮອງຮັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຈາກພາຍນອກ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີສ່ວນກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ Keycloak. ສຳລັບການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອດ້ານ Keycloak, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://www.keycloak.org/."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can install Keycloak directly on your machine, or run it in a "
"container.  In this example, we run Keycloak in a Podman container.  For "
"more information about installing Keycloak, see the Keycloak documentation "
"at https://www.keycloak.org/guides#getting-started."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak ໂດຍກົງໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານ ຫຼື ຣັນມັນໃນ container. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຣັນ Keycloak ໃນ Podman container. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak, ເບິ່ງຄູ່ມືຂອງ Keycloak ທີ່ https://www.keycloak.org/guides#getting-started."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting Up the Identity Service Provider"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (IdP)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Install Keycloak in a Podman container, according to the Keycloak "
"documentation."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak ໃນ Podman container ຕາມຄູ່ມືຂອງ Keycloak."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Run the container using the ``-td`` argument to ensure the process remains "
"running:"
msgstr "ຣັນ container ໂດຍໃຊ້ argument ``-td`` ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າໂປຣເຊສຈະເຮັດວຽກຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"podman run -td --name keycloak -p 8080:8080 -e KEYCLOAK_USER=admin -e "
"KEYCLOAK_PASSWORD=admin quay.io/keycloak/keycloak:21.0.1\n"
msgstr "podman run -td --name keycloak -p 8080:8080 -e KEYCLOAK_USER=admin -e KEYCLOAK_PASSWORD=admin quay.io/keycloak/keycloak:21.0.1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Sign in the Keycloak {webui} as the ``admin`` user, and create an "
"authentication realm using these details:"
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ Keycloak {webui} ໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``admin``, ແລະ ສ້າງ authentication realm ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:11
msgid "In the ``Name`` field, enter a name for the realm."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ ``Name``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ສຳລັບ realm."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:12
msgid "For example, ``MLM``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``MLM``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the ``Endpoints`` field, click the ``SAML 2.0 Identity Provider "
"Metadata`` link."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ ``Endpoints``, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ລິ້ງ ``SAML 2.0 Identity Provider Metadata``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:14
msgid ""
"This will lead you to a page where you will see the endpoints and "
"certificate to copy into the {productname} configuration file."
msgstr "ນີ້ຈະນຳທ່ານໄປຫາໜ້າທີ່ທ່ານຈະເຫັນ endpoints ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (certificate) ເພື່ອຄັດລອກໄປໃສ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:15
msgid ""
"When you have installed Keycloak and created the realm, you can prepare the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak ແລະ ສ້າງ realm ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດກຽມ {productname} Server ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting Up the {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:17
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, open the [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"configuration file and edit these parameters."
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂພາຣາມີເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Replace ``<FQDN_MLM>`` with the fully qualified domain name of your "
"{productname} installation:"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ ``<FQDN_MLM>`` ດ້ວຍ fully qualified domain name ຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid                       = "
"https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url      = "
"https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"
msgstr ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid                       = https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url      = https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the configuration file, replace ``<FQDN_IDP>`` with the fully qualified "
"domain name of your Keycloak server."
msgstr "ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ ``<FQDN_IDP>`` ດ້ວຍ fully qualified domain name ຂອງ Keycloak server ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:21
msgid "Replace ``<REALM>`` with your authentication realm, for example ``MLM``:"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ ``<REALM>`` ດ້ວຍ authentication realm ຂອງທ່ານ, ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``MLM``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid                   = "
"http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_sign_on_service.url = "
"http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_logout_service.url  = "
"http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"
msgstr ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid                   = http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_sign_on_service.url = http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_logout_service.url  = http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:23
msgid "In the IdP metadata, locate the public x509 certificate."
msgstr "ໃນ IdP metadata, ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາ public x509 certificate."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:24
msgid ""
"It uses this format: "
"``http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml/descriptor``.  In the "
"configuration file, specify the public x509 certificate of the IdP:"
msgstr "ມັນໃຊ້ຮູບແບບນີ້: ``http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml/descriptor``. ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸ public x509 certificate ຂອງ IdP:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.x509cert = -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE----- "
"<CERTIFICATE>  -----END CERTIFICATE-----\n"
msgstr "java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.x509cert = -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE----- <CERTIFICATE>  -----END CERTIFICATE-----\n"

#. +
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Here is an example of [path]``rhn.conf`` on {productname} after enabling "
"SSO:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ [path]``rhn.conf`` ໃນ {productname} ຫຼັງຈາກເປີດໃຊ້ SSO:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:27
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.sso = true\n"
msgstr "java.sso = true\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# This is the configuration file for Single Sign-On (SSO) via SAMLv2 "
"protocol\n"
"# To enable SSO, set java.sso = true in /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"#\n"
"# Mandatory changes: search this file for:\n"
"# - YOUR-PRODUCT\n"
"# - YOUR-IDP-ENTITY\n"
"#\n"
"# See product documentation and the comments inline in this file for more\n"
"# information about every parameter.\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"# If 'strict' is True, then the Java Toolkit will reject unsigned\n"
"# or unencrypted messages if it expects them signed or encrypted\n"
"# Also will reject the messages if not strictly follow the SAML\n"
"#\n"
"# WARNING: In production, this parameter setting parameter MUST be set as "
"\"true\".\n"
"# Otherwise your environment is not secure and will be exposed to attacks.\n"
"# Enable debug mode (to print errors)\n"
"# Identifier of the SP entity (must be a URI)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid = "
"https://MLMserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"
msgstr ""
"# ນີ້ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ Single Sign-On (SSO) ຜ່ານໂປຣໂຕຄໍ SAMLv2\n"
"# ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ SSO, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ java.sso = true ໃນ /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"#\n"
"# ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຈຳເປັນ: ຄົ້ນຫາໃນໄຟລ໌ນີ້ສຳລັບ:\n"
"# - YOUR-PRODUCT\n"
"# - YOUR-IDP-ENTITY\n"
"#\n"
"# ເບິ່ງຄູ່ມືຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ຄຳອະທິບາຍພາຍໃນໄຟລ໌ນີ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແຕ່ລະພາຣາມີເຕີ.\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"# ຖ້າ 'strict' ເປັນ True, Java Toolkit ຈະປະຕິເສດຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ມີການເຊັນຊື່\n"
"# ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ ຖ້າມັນຄາດຫວັງໃຫ້ມີການເຊັນຊື່ ຫຼື ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ\n"
"# ແລະ ຈະປະຕິເສດຂໍ້ຄວາມຖ້າບໍ່ເປັນໄປຕາມມາດຕະຖານ SAML ຢ່າງເຄັ່ງຄັດ\n"
"#\n"
"# ຄຳເຕືອນ: ໃນການໃຊ້ງານຈິງ, ພາຣາມີເຕີນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດເປັນ \"true\".\n"
"# ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານຈະບໍ່ປອດໄພ ແລະ ອາດຖືກໂຈມຕີໄດ້.\n"
"# ເປີດໂໝດ debug (ເພື່ອສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ)\n"
"# ຕົວລະບຸຂອງ SP entity (ຕ້ອງເປັນ URI)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid = https://MLMserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Specifies info about where and how the <AuthnResponse> message MUST be\n"
"# returned to the requester, in this case our SP.\n"
"# URL Location where the <Response> from the IdP will be returned\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://MLMserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
msgstr ""
"# ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບບ່ອນໃດ ແລະ ແນວໃດທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ <AuthnResponse> ຕ້ອງຖືກສົ່ງກັບຄືນຫາຜູ້ຮ້ອງຂໍ, ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ແມ່ນ SP ຂອງພວກເຮົາ.\n"
"# ທີ່ຕັ້ງ URL ບ່ອນທີ່ <Response> ຈາກ IdP ຈະຖືກສົ່ງກັບຄືນມາ\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://MLMserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Specifies info about where and how the <Logout Response> message MUST be\n"
"# returned to the requester, in this case our SP.\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url = "
"https://MLMserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"
msgstr ""
"# ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບບ່ອນໃດ ແລະ ແນວໃດທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ <Logout Response> ຕ້ອງຖືກສົ່ງກັບຄືນຫາຜູ້ຮ້ອງຂໍ, ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ແມ່ນ SP ຂອງພວກເຮົາ.\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url = https://MLMserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Identifier of the IdP entity (must be a URI)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid = "
"http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/MLM\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຕົວລະບຸຂອງ IdP entity (ຕ້ອງເປັນ URI)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid = http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/MLM\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# SSO endpoint info of the IdP. (Authentication Request protocol)\n"
"# URL Target of the IdP where the SP will send the Authentication Request "
"Message\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_sign_on_service.url = "
"http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/MLM/protocol/saml\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຂໍ້ມູນ SSO endpoint ຂອງ IdP. (Authentication Request protocol)\n"
"# URL ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງ IdP ບ່ອນທີ່ SP ຈະສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມ Authentication Request\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_sign_on_service.url = http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/MLM/protocol/saml\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# SLO endpoint info of the IdP.\n"
"# URL Location of the IdP where the SP will send the SLO Request\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_logout_service.url = "
"http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/MLM/protocol/saml\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຂໍ້ມູນ SLO endpoint ຂອງ IdP.\n"
"# ທີ່ຕັ້ງ URL ຂອງ IdP ບ່ອນທີ່ SP ຈະສົ່ງ SLO Request\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_logout_service.url = http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/MLM/protocol/saml\n"

#. type: delimited block -
