#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:37
msgid ""
"You can add the {productname} endpoints to Keycloak.  Keycloak refers to "
"endpoints as clients."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ {productname} endpoints ໃສ່ Keycloak. Keycloak ເອີ້ນ endpoints ວ່າ clients."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Endpoints as Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມ Endpoints ເປັນ Clients"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:39
msgid "In the Keycloak {webui}, create a new client using these details:"
msgstr "ໃນ Keycloak {webui}, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ client ໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:40
msgid "In the ``Client type`` field, select ``SAML``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ ``Client type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``SAML``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:41
msgid ""
"In the ``Client ID`` field, enter the endpoint specified in the server "
"configuration file as ``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ ``Client ID``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ endpoint ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ server ເປັນ ``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:42
msgid "For example, ``https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:43
msgid "In the ``Settings`` tab, fine-tune the client using these details:"
msgstr "ໃນແທັບ ``Settings``, ໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງ client ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:44
msgid "Toggle the ``Sign assertions`` switch to ``On``."
msgstr "ເປີດສະວິດ ``Sign assertions`` ເປັນ ``On``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:45
msgid "In the ``Signature algorithm`` field, select ``RSA_SHA1``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ ``Signature algorithm``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``RSA_SHA1``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:46
msgid "In the ``SAML Signature Key Name`` field, select ``Key ID``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ ``SAML Signature Key Name``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``Key ID``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:47
msgid "In the ``Keys`` tab:"
msgstr "ໃນແທັບ ``Keys``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:48
msgid "Set ``Client signature required`` to ``Off``."
msgstr "ກຳນົດ ``Client signature required`` ເປັນ ``Off``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:49
msgid ""
"In the ``Advanced`` tab, in the ``Fine Grain SAML Endpoint Configuration`` "
"section, add the two endpoints using these details:"
msgstr "ໃນແທັບ ``Advanced``, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ ``Fine Grain SAML Endpoint Configuration``, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມສອງ endpoints ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In both the ``Assertion Consumer Service`` fields, enter the endpoint "
"specified in the server configuration file as "
"``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url``."
msgstr "ໃນທັງສອງຫ້ອງ ``Assertion Consumer Service``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ endpoint ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ server ເປັນ ``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:51
msgid "For example, ``https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/acs``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/acs``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:52
msgid ""
"In both the ``Logout Service`` fields, enter the endpoint specified in the "
"server configuration file as "
"``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url``."
msgstr "ໃນທັງສອງຫ້ອງ ``Logout Service``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ endpoint ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ server ເປັນ ``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:53
msgid "For example, ``https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/sls``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/sls``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:54
msgid ""
"When you have added the endpoints as clients, you can configure the client "
"scope, and map the users between Keycloak and {productname}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເພີ່ມ endpoints ເປັນ clients ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ client scope ແລະ ຈັບຄູ່ (map) ຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະຫວ່າງ Keycloak ແລະ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Client Scope and Mappers"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Client Scope ແລະ Mappers"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the Keycloak {webui}, navigate to the menu:Clients[Client scopes] tab and "
"assign ``role_list`` as the default client scope."
msgstr "ໃນ Keycloak {webui}, ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Clients[Client scopes] ແລະ ກຳນົດ ``role_list`` ເປັນ default client scope."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Client_scopes[Mappers] tab and add a mapper for user "
"attribute ``uid``, using the default values."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Client_scopes[Mappers] ແລະ ເພີ່ມ mapper ສຳລັບຄຸນລັກສະນະຜູ້ໃຊ້ (user attribute) ``uid`` ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:58
msgid "This SAML attribute is expected by {productname}."
msgstr "ຄຸນລັກສະນະ SAML ນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ {productname} ຄາດຫວັງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Client_scopes[Mappers] and click on ``role_list`` "
"mapper. Set ``Single Role Attribute`` to ``On``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Client_scopes[Mappers] ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ mapper ``role_list``. ກຳນົດ ``Single Role Attribute`` ເປັນ ``On``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:60
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Users[Admin] section and create an administrative user."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Users[Admin] ແລະ ສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ (administrative user)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:61
msgid "This user does not need to match the {productname} administrative user."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕົງກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Users[Role mappings] tab, add an attribute named "
"``uid`` with a value that matches the username of the {productname} "
"administrative user."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Users[Role mappings], ເພີ່ມ attribute ທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ ``uid`` ພ້ອມກັບຄ່າທີ່ຕົງກັບຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (username) ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Users[Credentials] tab, and set the same password as "
"used by the {productname} administrative user."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Users[Credentials], ແລະ ກຳນົດລະຫັດຜ່ານດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid " Save your changes."
msgstr " ບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:65
msgid ""
"When you have completed the configuration, you can test that the "
"installation is working as expected.  Restart the {productname} Server to "
"pick up your changes, and navigate to the {productname} {webui}.  If your "
"installation is working correctly, you are redirected to the Keycloak SSO "
"page, where you can authenticate successfully."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດທົດສອບວ່າການຕິດຕັ້ງເຮັດວຽກຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ {productname} Server ໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ {productname} {webui}. ຖ້າການຕິດຕັ້ງເຮັດວຽກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ທ່ານຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໜ້າ Keycloak SSO, ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໄດ້ຢ່າງສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication With Single Sign-On (SSO)"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ Single Sign-On (SSO)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports single sign-on (SSO) by implementing the Security "
"Assertion Markup Language (SAML){nbsp}2 protocol."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບ single sign-on (SSO) ໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ Security Assertion Markup Language (SAML){nbsp}2."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Single sign-on is an authentication process that allows a user to access "
"multiple applications with one set of credentials.  SAML is an XML-based "
"standard for exchanging authentication and authorization data.  A SAML "
"identity service provider (IdP) provides authentication and authorization "
"services to service providers (SP), such as {productname}.  {productname} "
"exposes three endpoints which must be enabled for single sign-on."
msgstr "Single sign-on ແມ່ນຂະບວນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຫຼາຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບຊຸດດຽວ. SAML ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານທີ່ອີງໃສ່ XML ສຳລັບການແລກປ່ຽນຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ແລະ ການອະນຸຍາດສິດ. SAML identity service provider (IdP) ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດສິດແກ່ service providers (SP), ເຊັ່ນ {productname}. {productname} ເປີດ endpoint ສາມອັນເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເປີດໃຊ້ສຳລັບ single sign-on."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:4
msgid "SSO in {productname} supports:"
msgstr "SSO ໃນ {productname} ຮອງຮັບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:5
msgid "Log in with SSO."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍ SSO."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Log out with service provider-initiated single logout (SLO), and Identity "
"service provider single logout service (SLS)."
msgstr "ອອກຈາກລະບົບດ້ວຍ service provider-initiated single logout (SLO), ແລະ Identity service provider single logout service (SLS)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:7
msgid "Assertion and nameId encryption."
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ Assertion ແລະ nameId."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:8
msgid "Assertion signatures."
msgstr "ລາຍເຊັນ Assertion."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:9
msgid "Message signatures with AuthNRequest, LogoutRequest, and LogoutResponses."
msgstr "ລາຍເຊັນຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍ AuthNRequest, LogoutRequest, ແລະ LogoutResponses."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:10
msgid "Enable an Assertion consumer service endpoint."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ Assertion consumer service endpoint."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:11
msgid "Enable a single logout service endpoint."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ single logout service endpoint."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:12
msgid "Publish the SP metadata (which can be signed)."
msgstr "ເຜີຍແຜ່ SP metadata (ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຊັນຊື່ໄດ້)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:13
msgid "SSO in {productname} does not support:"
msgstr "SSO ໃນ {productname} ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:14
msgid "Product choosing and implementation for the identity service provider (IdP)."
msgstr "ການເລືອກຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ການນຳໃຊ້ສຳລັບ identity service provider (IdP)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:15
msgid ""
"SAML support for other products (check with the respective product "
"documentation)."
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບ SAML ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນອື່ນໆ (ກວດສອບກັບຄູ່ມືຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນໆ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For an example implementation of SSO, see "
"xref:administration:auth-methods-sso-example.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງການນຳໃຊ້ SSO, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:auth-methods-sso-example.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:17
msgid ""
"If you change from the default authentication method to single sign-on, the "
"new SSO credentials apply only to the {webui}.  Client tools such as "
"``mgr-sync`` or ``spacecmd`` continue to work with the default "
"authentication method only."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານປ່ຽນຈາກວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄປເປັນ single sign-on, ຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບ SSO ໃໝ່ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບ {webui} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເຄື່ອງມືຝັ່ງ client ເຊັ່ນ ``mgr-sync`` ຫຼື ``spacecmd`` ຈະຍັງຄົງເຮັດວຽກກັບວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:18
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "ສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you need to have configured an external identity service "
"provider with these parameters.  Check your IdP documentation for "
"instructions."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ external identity service provider ດ້ວຍພາຣາມີເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້. ກວດສອບຄູ່ມື IdP ຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The mapping between the IdP user and the {productname} user is specified in "
"a SAML:Attribute.  The SAML:Attribute must be configured in the IdP and must "
"be passed to {productname} in the SAML authentication.  The attribute must "
"be named ``uid`` and must contain the {productname} user mapped to it after "
"login.  The {productname} must be created before you activate single "
"sign-on."
msgstr "ການຈັບຄູ່ລະຫວ່າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ IdP ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ {productname} ແມ່ນຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ SAML:Attribute. SAML:Attribute ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ IdP ແລະ ຕ້ອງຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາ {productname} ໃນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SAML. attribute ຕ້ອງມີຊື່ວ່າ ``uid`` ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີຜູ້ໃຊ້ {productname} ທີ່ຖືກຈັບຄູ່ກັບມັນຫຼັງຈາກເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ {productname} ຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເປີດໃຊ້ single sign-on."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:21
msgid "You need these endpoints:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ endpoints ເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Assertion consumer service (or ACS): an endpoint to accept SAML messages to "
"establish a session into the Service Provider."
msgstr "Assertion consumer service (ຫຼື ACS): endpoint ສຳລັບຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ SAML ເພື່ອສ້າງ session ເຂົ້າໃນ Service Provider."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The endpoint for ACS in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/acs"
msgstr "endpoint ສຳລັບ ACS ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/acs"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Single logout service (or SLS): an endpoint to initiate a logout request "
"from the IdP."
msgstr "Single logout service (ຫຼື SLS): endpoint ສຳລັບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຮ້ອງຂໍອອກຈາກລະບົບຈາກ IdP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The endpoint for SLS in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/sls"
msgstr "endpoint ສຳລັບ SLS ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/sls"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:26
msgid "Metadata: an endpoint to retrieve {productname} metadata for SAML."
msgstr "Metadata: endpoint ສຳລັບດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ metadata ຂອງ {productname} ສຳລັບ SAML."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The endpoint for metadata in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/metadata"
msgstr "endpoint ສຳລັບ metadata ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/metadata"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:28
msgid ""
"After the authentication with the IdP using the user ``orgadmin`` is "
"successful, you are logged in to {productname} as the ``orgadmin`` user, "
"provided that the ``orgadmin`` user exists in {productname}."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບ IdP ໂດຍໃຊ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``orgadmin`` ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {productname} ໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``orgadmin``, ໂດຍມີເງື່ອນໄຂວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``orgadmin`` ຕ້ອງມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname} ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable SSO"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ SSO"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Using SSO is mutually exclusive with other types of authentication: it is "
"either enabled or disabled.  SSO is disabled by default."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ SSO ຈະແຍກອອກຈາກການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນປະເພດອື່ນໆ: ມັນຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ຢ່າງໃດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງ. SSO ຈະຖືກປິດໄວ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:31
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:4
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-delclients.adoc:2
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Use [literal]``mgrctl term`` before running steps inside the server "
"container."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ [literal]``mgrctl term`` ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນຂັ້ນຕອນຕ່າງໆພາຍໃນ server container."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling SSO"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ SSO"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:33
msgid "If your users do not yet exist in {productname}, create them first."
msgstr "ຖ້າຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname}, ໃຫ້ສ້າງພວກເຂົາກ່ອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:34
msgid "Edit [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` and add this line at the end of the file:"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມແຖວນີ້ໃສ່ທ້າຍໄຟລ໌:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Find the parameters you want to customize in "
"[path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf``."
msgstr "ຊອກຫາພາຣາມີເຕີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປັບແຕ່ງໃນ [path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Insert the parameters you want to customize into [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"and prefix them with [literal]``java.sso``.  For example, in "
"[path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf`` find:"
msgstr "ໃສ່ພາຣາມີເຕີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປັບແຕ່ງລົງໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ຕື່ມໜ້າດ້ວຍ [literal]``java.sso``. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໃນ [path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf`` ຊອກຫາ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
msgstr "onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:39
msgid ""
"To customize it, create the corresponding option in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` by prefixing the option name with ``java.sso.``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງມັນ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງຕົວເລືອກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ໂດຍການຕື່ມໜ້າຊື່ຕົວເລືອກດ້ວຍ ``java.sso.``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
msgstr "java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:41
msgid ""
"To find all the occurrences you need to change, search in the file for the "
"placeholders [literal]``YOUR-PRODUCT`` and [literal]``YOUR-IDP-ENTITY``.  "
"Every parameter comes with a brief explanation of what it is meant for."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຊອກຫາຈຸດທັງໝົດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງປ່ຽນ, ໃຫ້ຄົ້ນຫາໃນໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບຕົວແປ [literal]``YOUR-PRODUCT`` ແລະ [literal]``YOUR-IDP-ENTITY``. ທຸກໆພາຣາມີເຕີຈະມາພ້ອມກັບຄຳອະທິບາຍສັ້ນໆກ່ຽວກັບຈຸດປະສົງຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:42
msgid "Restart the spacewalk service to pick up the changes:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການບໍລິການ spacewalk ໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:44
msgid ""
"When you visit the {productname} URL, you are redirected to the IdP for SSO "
"where you are requested to authenticate.  Upon successful authentication, "
"you are redirected to the {productname} {webui}, logged in as the "
"authenticated user.  If you encounter problems with logging in using SSO, "
"check the {productname} logs for more information."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງ {productname}, ທ່ານຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ IdP ສຳລັບ SSO ເຊິ່ງທ່ານຈະຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ. ເມື່ອການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳເລັດ, ທ່ານຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງກັບຄືນໄປຫາ {productname} {webui} ແລະ ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນ. ຫາກທ່ານພົບກັບບັນຫາໃນການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໂດຍໃຊ້ SSO, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບ logs ຂອງ {productname} ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication Methods"
msgstr "ວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports several different authentication methods.  This "
"section discusses pluggable authentication modules (PAM) and single sign-on "
"(SSO)."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍວິທີ. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຈະສົນທະນາກ່ຽວກັບ pluggable authentication modules (PAM) ແລະ single sign-on (SSO)."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Database Backup Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide describes how to manage online database backups for the "
"{productname} server using [command]``mgradm``.  The backup system is based "
"on {postgresql} continuous archiving Write-Ahead Logging (WAL)."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີການຈັດການການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນແບບອອນລາຍສຳລັບ {productname} server ໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``mgradm``. ລະບົບການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແມ່ນອີງໃສ່ {postgresql} continuous archiving Write-Ahead Logging (WAL)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To ensure the system can be fully recovered, perform regular backups of both "
"the database and other system volumes."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າລະບົບສາມາດກູ້ຄືນໄດ້ຢ່າງເຕັມຮູບແບບ, ໃຫ້ເຮັດການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທັງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ system volumes ອື່ນໆຢ່າງສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Regularly copy your backup volumes and WAL files to an external storage "
"device or an off-site location for disaster recovery."
msgstr "ຄັດລອກ backup volumes ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ WAL ຂອງທ່ານໄປໄວ້ໃນອຸປະກອນຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກ ຫຼື ສະຖານທີ່ອື່ນເປັນປະຈຳເພື່ອການກູ້ຄືນຈາກໄພພິບັດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Continuous archiving reduces the risk of data loss by constantly backing up "
"the transaction logs (WAL) to a dedicated volume."
msgstr "Continuous archiving ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມສ່ຽງຂອງການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ transaction logs (WAL) ໄປຍັງ volume ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໂດຍສະເພາະຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The backup system utilizes a dedicated Podman volume named "
"[literal]``var-pgsql-walbackup`` to store:"
msgstr "ລະບົບສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໃຊ້ Podman volume ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໂດຍສະເພາະທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ [literal]``var-pgsql-walbackup`` ເພື່ອຈັດເກັບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:8
msgid "A base backup (a full snapshot of the database)."
msgstr "Base backup (snapshot ຖານຂໍ້ມູນແບບເຕັມ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:9
msgid "WAL segments (incremental changes since the last base backup)."
msgstr "WAL segments (ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ base backup ຄັ້ງຫຼ້າສຸດ)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Point-in-time recovery is currently not supported by [command]``mgradm`` and "
"requires a manual workflow."
msgstr "ການກູ້ຄືນແບບ Point-in-time ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໂດຍ [command]``mgradm`` ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Only full recovery is supported by [command]``mgradm`` tool.  The restore "
"procedure will restore everything from the backup location."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະການກູ້ຄືນແບບເຕັມຮູບແບບໂດຍເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgradm``. ຂັ້ນຕອນການກູ້ຄືນຈະກູ້ຄືນທຸກຢ່າງຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:13
msgid "[command]``mgradm`` tool installed on the host."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgradm`` ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນ host."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:14
msgid "{productname} server running in a Podman environment."
msgstr "{productname} server ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ Podman."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enabling backups"
msgstr "ການເປີດໃຊ້ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:16
msgid "To enable continuous archiving, run the following command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ continuous archiving, ໃຫ້ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db enable\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db enable\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:18
msgid "This command:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:19
msgid "Verifies that the backup is not already enabled."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Configures {postgresql} ([path]``postgresql.conf``) to enable "
"[option]``archive_mode`` and sets the [option]``archive_command``."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {postgresql} ([path]``postgresql.conf``) ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ [option]``archive_mode`` ແລະ ກຳນົດ [option]``archive_command``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Configures the [literal]``var-pgsql-walbackup`` volume for the database "
"service."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [literal]``var-pgsql-walbackup`` volume ສຳລັບບໍລິການຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:22
msgid "Restarts the database service to apply changes."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍລິການຖານຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:23
msgid "Performs an initial base backup inside the container."
msgstr "ເຮັດ base backup ຄັ້ງທຳອິດພາຍໃນ container."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:24
msgid ""
"If the backup is already configured but you need to re-initialize it, use "
"the [option]``--force`` flag."
msgstr "ຫາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ແລ້ວ ແຕ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ flag [option]``--force``."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checking backup status"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບສະຖານະການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:26
msgid "You can verify the current state of the database backup system at any time:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງລະບົບສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db status\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db status\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:28
msgid "The command will report one of the following statuses:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງຈະລາຍງານສະຖານະໜຶ່ງໃນດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "*enabled*: Backup is correctly configured and active.\n"
msgstr "*enabled*: ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "*disabled*: Continuous archiving is explicitly turned off.\n"
msgstr "*disabled*: Continuous archiving ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*misconfigured*: There is a discrepancy between the configuration and the "
"runtime state (for example, missing volume, incorrect archive command).\n"
msgstr "*misconfigured*: ມີຄວາມບໍ່ສອດຄ່ອງລະຫວ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ສະຖານະການເຮັດວຽກ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: volume ຫາຍໄປ, ຄຳສັ່ງ archive ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ).\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maintaining backups (rebasing)"
msgstr "ການບຳລຸງຮັກສາການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ (rebasing)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Over time, the number of WAL segments can grow significantly, consuming disk "
"space and increasing restoration time.  It is recommended to periodically "
"\"rebase\" the backup by creating a new base backup and starting a new WAL "
"chain."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເວລາຜ່ານໄປ, ຈຳນວນຂອງ WAL segments ສາມາດເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເປືອງພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ ແລະ ເພີ່ມເວລາໃນການກູ້ຄືນ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຮັດການ \"rebase\" ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນເປັນໄລຍະໂດຍການສ້າງ base backup ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ WAL chain ໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db rebase\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db rebase\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:35
msgid ""
"This command creates a fresh full snapshot of the database without requiring "
"a service restart."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ສ້າງ snapshot ຖານຂໍ້ມູນແບບເຕັມອັນໃໝ່ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍລິການໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Regularly rebase your database backups using command [command]``mgradm "
"backup db rebase`` to minimize the time required for restore operations."
msgstr "ເຮັດການ rebase ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານເປັນປະຈຳໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup db rebase`` ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນເວລາທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການກູ້ຄືນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restoring from backup"
msgstr "ການກູ້ຄືນຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Restoring from a backup is a *destructive operation* that replaces the "
"current database data with the content of the backup."
msgstr "ການກູ້ຄືນຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແມ່ນ *ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ມີຜົນກະທົບ* ເຊິ່ງຈະແທນທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນປັດຈຸບັນດ້ວຍເນື້ອຫາຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db restore\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db restore\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:40
msgid "The restoration process:"
msgstr "ຂະບວນການກູ້ຄືນຈະ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:41
msgid "Stops the database service."
msgstr "ຢຸດບໍລິການຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:42
msgid "Clears the current database data directory."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນໃນ directory ຖານຂໍ້ມູນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:43
msgid "Extracts the base backup from the backup volume."
msgstr "ແຕກໄຟລ໌ base backup ຈາກ backup volume."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:44
msgid "Configures {postgresql} for recovery."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {postgresql} ສຳລັບການກູ້ຄືນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:45
msgid "Starts the database service."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍລິການຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:46
msgid "Replays the WAL segments to bring the database to the latest possible state."
msgstr "ຣັນ WAL segments ຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະທີ່ໃໝ່ທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:47
msgid ""
"The command will wait until the database has fully recovered and is ready to "
"accept connections."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງຈະລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າຖານຂໍ້ມູນຈະກູ້ຄືນສຳເລັດ ແລະ ພ້ອມທີ່ຈະຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Ensure you have a recent base backup and all necessary WAL segments in the "
"[literal]``var-pgsql-walbackup`` volume before performing a restore."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ base backup ທີ່ໃໝ່ຫຼ້າສຸດ ແລະ WAL segments ທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດໃນ [literal]``var-pgsql-walbackup`` volume ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຮັດການກູ້ຄືນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disabling backups"
msgstr "ການປິດໃຊ້ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:50
msgid "To turn off continuous archiving:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປິດ continuous archiving:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db disable\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db disable\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:52
msgid ""
"By default, this command disables archiving in the configuration and "
"restarts the database but preserves the backup volume."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະປິດການ archiving ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຖານຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ ແຕ່ຈະຍັງຮັກສາ backup volume ໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:53
msgid "To also remove the backup volume and all stored backups, use:"
msgstr "ຫາກຕ້ອງການລຶບ backup volume ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນສຳຮອງທັງໝົດທີ່ເກັບໄວ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db disable --purge-volume\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db disable --purge-volume\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:55
msgid ""
"Regularly test your restore procedures to verify data integrity and ensure "
"you are prepared for a recovery."
msgstr "ທົດສອບຂັ້ນຕອນການກູ້ຄືນຂອງທ່ານເປັນປະຈຳເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຮັບປະກັນວ່າທ່ານພ້ອມສຳລັບການກູ້ຄືນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "External documentation"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືພາຍນອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:57
msgid ""
"For more information on {postgresql}, see "
"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/{postgresql-version}/continuous-archiving.html[{postgresql} "
"{postgresql-version}: Continuous Archiving and Point-in-Time Recovery "
"(PITR)]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {postgresql}, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://www.postgresql.org/docs/{postgresql-version}/continuous-archiving.html[{postgresql} {postgresql-version}: Continuous Archiving and Point-in-Time Recovery (PITR)]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backup and Restore"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ການກູ້ຄືນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This chapter contains information on the files you need to back up.  With "
"the built-in backup and restore solution ([command]``mgradm backup``) you "
"create {productname} backups.  Information about restoring from your backups "
"in the case of a system failure completes this chapter."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ. ດ້ວຍວິທີການສຳຮອງ ແລະ ກູ້ຄືນທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ ([command]``mgradm backup``) ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ {productname}. ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການກູ້ຄືນຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ລະບົບເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຈະປິດທ້າຍບົດນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Because {productname} relies on a database as well as the installed program "
"and configurations, it is important to back up all components of your "
"installation.  Back up your {productname} installation regularly to prevent "
"data loss and enable quick recovery."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກ {productname} ອີງໃສ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນລວມທັງໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່າງໆ, ມັນຈຶ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທຸກພາກສ່ວນຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ໃຫ້ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານເປັນປະຈຳເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ກູ້ຄືນໄດ້ໄວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Regardless of the backup method you use, you must have available at least "
"three times the amount of space your current installation uses.  Running out "
"of space can result in backups failing, so check this often."
msgstr "ບໍ່ວ່າທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ວິທີການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບໃດ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສາມເທົ່າຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງປັດຈຸບັນໃຊ້ຢູ່. ການຂາດແຄນພື້ນທີ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນກວດສອບເລື້ອຍໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Back up {productname}"
msgstr "ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The most comprehensive method for backing up your {productname} installation "
"is to use [command]``mgradm backup create`` command.  This can save you time "
"in administering your backup, and can be faster to reinstall and "
"re-synchronize in the case of failure.  However, this method requires "
"significant disk space and could take a long time to perform the backup."
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ຄອບຄຸມທີ່ສຸດໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານແມ່ນການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup create``. ວິທີນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປະຢັດເວລາໃນການຈັດການການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ ຫຼື ຊິງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ວິທີນີ້ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ແລະ ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:7
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm backup create`` command performs backup to a directory.  "
"This directory can be both local or mounted remote storage."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup create`` ຈະເຮັດການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໄປຍັງ directory. directory ນີ້ສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງ local ຫຼື mounted remote storage."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:8
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm backup create`` command allows various customizations of "
"the content of the backup.  For all available options, see [command]``mgradm "
"backup create --help``."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup create`` ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງເນື້ອຫາຂອງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ຫຼາຍຢ່າງ. ສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup create --help``."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Full backup of {productname}"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ {productname} ແບບເຕັມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:10
msgid ""
"A full backup of the {productname} consists of backing up the following "
"components:"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ {productname} ແບບເຕັມປະກອບດ້ວຍການສຳຮອງສ່ວນປະກອບດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:11
msgid "{productname} volumes"
msgstr "{productname} volumes"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:12
msgid "database volumes"
msgstr "volumes ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:13
msgid "podman network configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ podman"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:14
msgid "podman secrets"
msgstr "podman secrets"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:15
msgid "{productname} systemd services"
msgstr "ບໍລິການ systemd ຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:16
msgid "{productname} container images"
msgstr "{productname} container images"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The {productname} service is automatically stopped for the time it takes to "
"create a full backup.  The downtime can be significant.  After backup is "
"done, service is automatically restarted."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ {productname} ຈະຖືກຢຸດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບເຕັມ. ໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ລະບົບຢຸດເຮັດວຽກອາດຈະດົນສົມຄວນ. ຫຼັງຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນສຳເລັດ, ບໍລິການຈະຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating full backup with [command]``mgradm backup create``"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບເຕັມດ້ວຍ [command]``mgradm backup create``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:19
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:27
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:31
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:39
msgid "On the container host, as root, create backup with:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ host container, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:21
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:29
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:33
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:41
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:56
msgid "Replace [literal]``$path`` by the path to the backup location."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ [literal]``$path`` ດ້ວຍເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Partial backup of {productname}"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ {productname} ບາງສ່ວນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:23
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm backup create`` tool allows creating partial backups.  It "
"is possible to skip individual or all volumes, skip database backup and "
"images."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgradm backup create`` ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນ. ສາມາດເລືອກຂ້າມບາງ volume ຫຼື ທັງໝົດ, ຂ້າມການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ images ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Particularly when database backup is skipped, backup is created without "
"stopping {productname} services and can act as a one phase in two phase "
"backup procedure."
msgstr "ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອຂ້າມການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຢຸດບໍລິການ {productname} ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຂັ້ນຕອນໜຶ່ງໃນຂະບວນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບສອງຂັ້ນຕອນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Partial backups are only considering a part of the data, and do not take "
"potential dependencies with other parts which may not have been backed up in "
"consideration.  Therefore they cannot guarantee backup/restore consistency."
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນຈະພິຈາລະນາແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຄຳນຶງເຖິງການຂຶ້ນຕໍ່ກັນ (dependencies) ທີ່ອາດມີກັບພາກສ່ວນອື່ນໆທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ພວກມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບປະກັນຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງຂອງການສຳຮອງ/ກູ້ຄືນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating partial backup by skipping database backup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນໂດຍການຂ້າມການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipdatabase $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipdatabase $path\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating partial backup by skipping a volume"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນໂດຍການຂ້າມ volume"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes $volumes $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes $volumes $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Replace [literal]``$volumes`` by the name of the volume name to be excluded "
"from the backup, or by a comma separated list of volumes to be excluded."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ [literal]``$volumes`` ດ້ວຍຊື່ຂອງ volume ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ຫຼື ດ້ວຍລາຍຊື່ volumes ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຍົກເວັ້ນໂດຍຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:35
msgid "Use [literal]``all`` to skip all volumes, except database volumes."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ [literal]``all`` ເພື່ອຂ້າມ volumes ທັງໝົດ, ຍົກເວັ້ນ volumes ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backing up extra volumes"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ extra volumes"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:37
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm backup`` command uses internal list of {productname} "
"volumes.  If additional volumes were configured during the installation, or "
"additional volumes should be added to the backup, they need to be specified "
"using [command]``--extravolumes $volumes``."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup`` ໃຊ້ລາຍຊື່ volumes ພາຍໃນຂອງ {productname}. ຫາກມີ volumes ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມ volumes ເພີ່ມເຕີມເຂົ້າໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ຕ້ອງລະບຸໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``--extravolumes $volumes``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating backup with additional custom volume"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນພ້ອມກັບ custom volume ເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --extravolumes $volume $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --extravolumes $volume $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Replace [literal]``$volumes`` by the name of the volume name to be included "
"in the backup. or by a comma separated list of volumes to be included."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ [literal]``$volumes`` ດ້ວຍຊື່ຂອງ volume ທີ່ຕ້ອງການລວມເຂົ້າໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ດ້ວຍລາຍຊື່ volumes ທີ່ຕ້ອງການລວມເຂົ້າໂດຍຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform a manual database backup"
msgstr "ເຮັດການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Performing a manual database backup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເຮັດການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:45
msgid "Allocate permanent storage space for your backup."
msgstr "ຈັດສັນພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖາວອນສຳລັບການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:46
msgid "At the command prompt of the {productname} container host, as root, use:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງຂອງ {productname} container host, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes all --skipconfig --skipimages $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes all --skipconfig --skipimages $path\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restore {productname} from the existing backup"
msgstr "ກູ້ຄືນ {productname} ຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:49
msgid ""
"Restoring {productname} from the existing backup will enumerate backup for "
"volumes, images and configuration to restore. Unlike in backup create "
"scenario, restore operation is not using an internal volume list, but "
"automatically detect every volume or image present in the backup."
msgstr "ການກູ້ຄືນ {productname} ຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະໄລ່ລຽງຂໍ້ມູນສຳຮອງສຳລັບ volumes, images ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອທຳການກູ້ຄືນ. ຕ່າງຈາກກໍລະນີການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ການກູ້ຄືນຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້ລາຍຊື່ volume ພາຍໃນ, ແຕ່ຈະກວດພົບທຸກ volume ຫຼື image ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:50
msgid ""
"After the list of items to restore is gathered, presence and integrity check "
"is performed. Presence check ensures backup restore will not accidentally "
"overwrite existing volumes, image or configurations. Integrity check is done "
"by computing backup items checksums."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກລວບລວມລາຍການທີ່ຈະກູ້ຄືນແລ້ວ, ຈະມີການກວດສອບການມີຢູ່ ແລະ ຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ (integrity). ການກວດສອບການມີຢູ່ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການກູ້ຄືນຈະບໍ່ໄປຂຽນທັບ volumes, image ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໂດຍບັງເອີນ. ການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງແມ່ນເຮັດໂດຍການຄຳນວນ checksums ຂອງລາຍການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:51
msgid "After both checks are successful, actual backup restore is performed."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການກວດສອບທັງສອງຢ່າງສຳເລັດ, ການກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຈິງຈະຖືກດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:52
msgid ""
"{productname} services are not automatically started after backup restore is "
"finished."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ {productname} ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກການກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Restoring from an existing backup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກູ້ຄືນຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:54
msgid "On the container host, as root, re-deploy the {productname} Server with:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ container host, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Server ຄືນໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm stop\n"
"mgradm backup restore $path\n"
"mgradm start\n"
msgstr ""
"mgradm stop\n"
"mgradm backup restore $path\n"
"mgradm start\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Verification of the backup can be a time-consuming operation. If backup "
"integrity is ensured by other means, verification can be skipped by using "
"[command]``--skipverify`` option."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ. ຫາກຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍວິທີອື່ນແລ້ວ, ສາມາດຂ້າມການກວດສອບໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ [command]``--skipverify``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:58
msgid ""
"If for some reason it is needed to skip restoring a volume present in the "
"backup, [command]``--skipvolumes $volumes`` option can be used."
msgstr "ຫາກມີເຫດຜົນບາງຢ່າງທີ່ຕ້ອງການຂ້າມການກູ້ຄືນ volume ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ [command]``--skipvolumes $volumes`` ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended steps after restoring a backup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ແນະນຳຫຼັງຈາກການກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Recommended steps after {productname} restore"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ແນະນຳຫຼັງຈາກການກູ້ຄືນ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Re-synchronize your {productname} repositories using either the "
"{productname} {webui}, or with the [command]``mgr-sync`` tool at the command "
"prompt in the container.  You can choose to re-register your product, or "
"skip the registration and SSL certificate generation sections."
msgstr "ຊິງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນຄືນໃໝ່ສຳລັບ {productname} repositories ຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}, ຫຼື ດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgr-sync`` ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງໃນ container. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກທີ່ຈະລົງທະບຽນຜະລິດຕະພັນຂອງທ່ານຄືນໃໝ່, ຫຼື ຂ້າມພາກສ່ວນການລົງທະບຽນ ແລະ ການສ້າງ SSL certificate ກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:62
msgid ""
"On the container host, check whether you need to restore "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/``.  "
"If "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`` "
"was not in your backup, you need to restore it.  If the source repository is "
"available, you can restore "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`u "
"with a complete channel synchronization:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ container host, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກູ້ຄືນ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`` ຫຼືບໍ່. ຫາກ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`` ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກູ້ຄືນມັນ. ຫາກ source repository ຍັງມີຢູ່, ທ່ານສາມາດກູ້ຄືນ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`` ໄດ້ດ້ວຍການຊິງຄ໌ຊ່ອງທາງ (channel synchronization) ແບບເຕັມຮູບແບບ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh --refresh-channels\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh --refresh-channels\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Schedule the re-creation of search indexes next time the "
"[command]``rhn-search`` service is started."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາການສ້າງ search indexes ໃໝ່ໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ບໍລິການ [command]``rhn-search`` ຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:65
msgid ""
"This command produces only debug messages, it does not produce error "
"messages."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງແຕ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ debug ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:66
msgid "On the container host, enter:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ container host, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-search cleanindex\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-search cleanindex\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel Management)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:2
msgid "Channels are a method of grouping software packages."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ (Channels) ແມ່ນວິທີການຈັດກຸ່ມຊຸດຊອບແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In {productname}, channels are grouped into base and child channels, with "
"base channels grouped by operating system type, version, and architecture, "
"and child channels being compatible with their related base channel.  When a "
"client has been assigned to a base channel, it is only possible for that "
"system to install the related child channels.  Organizing channels in this "
"way ensures that only compatible packages are installed on each system."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, ຊ່ອງທາງຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມອອກເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (base channels) ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child channels), ໂດຍຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມຕາມປະເພດລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ເວີຊັນ ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ, ສ່ວນຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍຈະຕ້ອງເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ເມື່ອ client ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໃດໜຶ່ງແລ້ວ, ລະບົບນັ້ນຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ສະເພາະຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ການຈັດລະບຽບຊ່ອງທາງໃນລັກສະນະນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມີພຽງແຕ່ຊຸດຊອບແວທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນແຕ່ລະລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Software channels use repositories to provide packages.  The channels mirror "
"the repositories in {productname}, and the package names and other data are "
"stored in the {productname} database.  You can have any number of "
"repositories associated with a channel.  The software from those "
"repositories can then be installed on clients by subscribing the client to "
"the appropriate channel."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວໃຊ້ repositories ເພື່ອສະໜອງຊຸດຊອບແວ. ຊ່ອງທາງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນເງົາ (mirror) ຂອງ repositories ໃນ {productname}, ແລະ ຊື່ຊຸດຊອບແວລວມທັງຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname}. ທ່ານສາມາດມີ repositories ຈຳນວນເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງໃດໜຶ່ງ. ຈາກນັ້ນ, ຊອບແວຈາກ repositories ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນສາມາດຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃສ່ clients ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຫ້ client ນັ້ນຕິດຕາມ (subscribe) ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Clients can only be assigned to one base channel.  The client can then "
"install or update packages from the repositories associated with that base "
"channel and any of its child channels."
msgstr "Clients ສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໄດ້ພຽງອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຈາກນັ້ນ client ຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດຊຸດຊອບແວຈາກ repositories ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກນັ້ນ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍຕ່າງໆຂອງມັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} provides a number of vendor channels, which provide you "
"everything you need to run {productname}.  {productname} Administrators and "
"Channel Administrators have channel management authority, which gives them "
"the ability to create and manage their own custom channels.  If you want to "
"use your own packages in your environment, you can create custom channels.  "
"Custom channels can be used as a base channel, or you can associate them "
"with a vendor base channel."
msgstr "{productname} ມີຊ່ອງທາງຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor channels) ຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງ ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໃນການຣັນ {productname}. ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ແລະ ຜູ້ດູແລຊ່ອງທາງ ມີອຳນາດໃນການຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາສາມາດສ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ (custom channels) ໄດ້. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຊຸດຊອບແວຂອງທ່ານເອງໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ custom channels ໄດ້. Custom channels ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໄປເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more on creating custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງ custom channels, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Administration"
msgstr "ການດູແລລະບົບຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:9
msgid ""
"By default, any user can subscribe channels to a system.  You can implement "
"restrictions on the channel using the {webui}."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທຸກຄົນສາມາດ subscribe ຊ່ອງທາງໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຂໍ້ຈຳກັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Restricting Subscriber Access to a Channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງການ Subscribe ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Channel List], and "
"select the channel to edit."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Channel List], ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Locate the [guimenu]``Per-User Subscription Restrictions`` section and check "
"[guimenu]``Only selected users within your organization may subscribe to "
"this channel``.  Click btn:[Update] to save the changes."
msgstr "ຊອກຫາພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Per-User Subscription Restrictions`` ແລະ ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ [guimenu]``Only selected users within your organization may subscribe to this channel``. ຄລິກ btn:[Update] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Subscribers`` tab and select or deselect users as "
"required."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Subscribers`` ແລະ ເລືອກ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delete Channels"
msgstr "ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:15
msgid "You can delete vendor software channels from the command prompt."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting Vendor Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ (Vendor Channels)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:17
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, list the "
"available vendor channels, and make a note of the channel you want to "
"delete:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດທີ່ມີຢູ່ ແລະ ຈົດຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລຶບໄວ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync list channels\n"
msgstr "mgr-sync list channels\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:19
msgid "Delete the channel:"
msgstr "ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-remove-channel -c <channel-name>\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-remove-channel -c <channel-name>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For more information about deleting channels manually, see "
"xref:administration:removing-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:removing-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For information about deleting custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລຶບ custom channels, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Confidential Computing"
msgstr "ການປະມວນຜົນແບບປິດລັບ (Confidential Computing)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{CoCo} is a technology which allows protection of data in use by using "
"hardware-based Trusted Execution Environment (TEE), the type of environments "
"that provide increased level of security for data integrity, data "
"confidentiality, and code integrity."
msgstr "{CoCo} ແມ່ນເຕັກໂນໂລຊີທີ່ຊ່ວຍປົກປ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກນຳໃຊ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ hardware-based Trusted Execution Environment (TEE), ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ໃຫ້ລະດັບຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ (data integrity), ຄວາມລັບຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ (data confidentiality) ແລະ ຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງໂຄ້ດ (code integrity)."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "{CoCo} with {productname}"
msgstr "{CoCo} ກັບ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The trustworthiness of the TEE is checked with the attestation process.  "
"{productname} can be used as an attestation server for the systems "
"registered to it.  It generates a report page for the systems which run in "
"this mode.  These systems need to be attested and checked on regular base.  "
"The history of the past checks is also stored and available per request."
msgstr "ຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືຂອງ TEE ຈະຖືກກວດສອບດ້ວຍຂະບວນການຢືນຢັນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ (attestation). {productname} ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນ attestation server ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບມັນ. ມັນຈະສ້າງໜ້າລາຍງານສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ຣັນໃນໂໝດນີ້. ລະບົບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນ ແລະ ກວດສອບເປັນປະຈຳ. ປະຫວັດການກວດສອບໃນອະດີດກໍຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ ແລະ ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ຕາມການຮ້ອງຂໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:5
msgid ""
"{CoCo} Attestation depends on the used hardware and environment where the "
"attested systems are running on."
msgstr "{CoCo} Attestation ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຮາດແວທີ່ໃຊ້ ແລະ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ລະບົບທີ່ຖືກກວດສອບນັ້ນກຳລັງຣັນຢູ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:6
msgid "{CoCo} Attestation is only available on x86_64 architecture."
msgstr "{CoCo} Attestation ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ x86_64 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:7
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:14
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:134
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ/ສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:8
msgid "{CoCo} can be set up in an environment with the following characteristics:"
msgstr "{CoCo} ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Attested system (virtual machine) is SLES15 SP6 and bootstrapped to "
"{productname}"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ຖືກກວດສອບ (virtual machine) ແມ່ນ SLES15 SP6 ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບການ bootstrap ໄປຫາ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Hardware must have [literal]``AMD EPYC Milan CPU`` or [literal]``AMD EPYC "
"Genoa CPU``"
msgstr "ຮາດແວຕ້ອງມີ [literal]``AMD EPYC Milan CPU`` ຫຼື [literal]``AMD EPYC Genoa CPU``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:11
msgid "BIOS must be configured to allow {CoCo} attestation"
msgstr "BIOS ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີ {CoCo} attestation"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Host OS and the virtualization software (KVM and libvirt) must support "
"{CoCo}."
msgstr "Host OS ແລະ ຊອບແວ virtualization (KVM ແລະ libvirt) ຕ້ອງຮອງຮັບ {CoCo}."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:13
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:269
#, no-wrap
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:14
msgid "SLES15 SP6 has {CoCo} attestation as technology preview."
msgstr "SLES15 SP6 ມີ {CoCo} attestation ໃນຮູບແບບ technology preview."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:15
msgid "{productname} has {CoCo} attestation as technology preview."
msgstr "{productname} ມີການຢັ້ງຢືນ {CoCo} ໃນຮູບແບບສະບັບທົດລອງເຕັກໂນໂລຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Secure boot is attested.  However, currently KVM secure boot and SNP Guest "
"are not working together."
msgstr "Secure boot ໄດ້ຮັບການຢັ້ງຢືນແລ້ວ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ KVM secure boot ແລະ SNP Guest ຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use {CoCo} in {productname}"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ {CoCo} ໃນ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For the exact steps for setting up and configuring {CoCo} on your host, "
"refer to the OS Vendor documentation."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ແນ່ນອນໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າ {CoCo} ໃນໂຮສຂອງທ່ານ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງເອກະສານປະກອບຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດ OS."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Enabling Attestation Container During the {productname} "
"Installation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ Attestation Container ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The attestation container is enabled during the installation of "
"{productname} with [literal]``mgradm install podman``."
msgstr "Attestation container ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [literal]``mgradm install podman``."

#. I need full path to this file.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:21
msgid "Add the following to file [literal]``mgradm.yaml``."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃສ່ໄຟລ໌ [literal]``mgradm.yaml``."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"coco:\n"
"    replicas: 1\n"
msgstr ""
"coco:\n"
"    replicas: 1\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Enabling Attestation Container After the {productname} "
"Installation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ Attestation Container ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:24
msgid ""
"To enable the attestation container after the installation, use the command "
"line parameter [literal]``mgradm``."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ attestation container ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີຄຳສັ່ງ [literal]``mgradm``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:25
msgid "Run the command"
msgstr "ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 1\n"
msgstr "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 1\n"

#.  (PLACEHOLDER): In the future instead of number 1, it should be possible to allow more then one container replica.
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Disabling Attestation Container After the {productname} "
"Installation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປິດໃຊ້ງານ Attestation Container ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:28
msgid "To disable the already enabled attestation container, run the command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ attestation container ທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 0\n"
msgstr "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 0\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling Attestation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານການຢັ້ງຢືນ (Attestation)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:31
msgid ""
"For the selected system, go to tab menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > "
"Settings]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ເລືອກ, ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Audit[Confidential Computing > Settings]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:32
msgid "Enable the attestation by selecting the toggle button."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການຢັ້ງຢືນໂດຍການເລືອກປຸ່ມສະຫຼັບ (toggle button)."

#. . (PLACEHOLDER) Enable the automatic attestaion at reboot by selecting the toggle button [literal]``Execution``.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the field [literal]``Environment Type`` select the correct option from "
"the drop-down list."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [literal]``Environment Type`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຈາກລາຍການແບບເລື່ອນລົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:34
msgid "Click button btn:[Save] to save the changes."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Scheduling New Attestation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດເວລາການຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:36
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:42
msgid ""
"For the selected system, go to tab menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > List "
"Attestations]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ເລືອກ, ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Audit[Confidential Computing > List Attestations]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:37
msgid "Click btn:[Schedule Attestation].  The new form opens."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Schedule Attestation]. ແບບຟອມໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເປີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:38
msgid ""
"In the field [literal]``Earliest`` select the time of running the "
"attestation."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [literal]``Earliest`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວລາທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມລັນການຢັ້ງຢືນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:39
msgid ""
"If needed, add the newly created attestation to the action chain by "
"selecting [literal]``Add to`` option."
msgstr "ຫາກຈຳເປັນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມການຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ໃສ່ໃນ action chain ໂດຍການເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ [literal]``Add to``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Click button btn:[Schedule] to save and schedule the new attestation "
"execution."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Schedule] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ ແລະ ກຳນົດເວລາການລັນການຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Viewing Attestation Reports from System Details"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເບິ່ງລາຍງານການຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກລາຍລະອຽດລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:43
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:50
msgid "Find and select the report you want to view."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ເລືອກລາຍງານທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເບິ່ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:44
msgid ""
"After clicking the selected attestation report tab [literal]``Overview`` "
"will open."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຄລິກເລືອກແທັບລາຍງານການຢັ້ງຢືນ, ໜ້າ [literal]``Overview`` ຈະຖືກເປີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:45
msgid "Move to the next tab [literal]``SEV-SNP``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບຖັດໄປ [literal]``SEV-SNP``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:46
msgid "Finally, move to the next tab [literal]``Secure Boot``."
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍ, ໄປທີ່ແທັບຖັດໄປ [literal]``Secure Boot``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Viewing Attestation Reports from Audit"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເບິ່ງລາຍງານການຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກການກວດສອບ (Audit)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:48
msgid "From the navigation bar, select menu:Audit[Confidential Computing]."
msgstr "ຈາກແຖບນຳທາງ (navigation bar), ເລືອກເມນູ: Audit[Confidential Computing]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:49
msgid "The list of all attestations will be shown in the main panel."
msgstr "ລາຍການການຢັ້ງຢືນທັງໝົດຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນແຖບຫຼັກ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Report Statuses"
msgstr "ສະຖານະລາຍງານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:52
msgid "Attestation reports can have one of the following statuses:"
msgstr "ລາຍງານການຢັ້ງຢືນສາມາດມີສະຖານະໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pending"
msgstr "ກຳລັງລໍຖ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:54
msgid ""
"This is the default status of the scheduled attestation.  The report is "
"still not available, either because the process has not yet started or "
"completed."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນສະຖານະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງການຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້. ລາຍງານຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ ເນື່ອງຈາກຂະບວນການຍັງບໍ່ທັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫຼື ຍັງບໍ່ທັນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Successful"
msgstr "ສຳເລັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:56
msgid ""
"When the scheduled attestation creates a report which can be viewed, the "
"status of the process is [literal]``Successful``."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ສ້າງລາຍງານທີ່ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້, ສະຖານະຂອງຂະບວນການຈະເປັນ [literal]``Successful``."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Failed"
msgstr "ລົ້ມເຫຼວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:58
msgid ""
"When the scheduled fails and does not create a report as a result, the "
"status of the process is [literal]``Failed``."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການກຳນົດເວລາລົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ສ້າງລາຍງານອອກມາ, ສະຖານະຂອງຂະບວນການຈະເປັນ [literal]``Failed``."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Related Topics"
msgstr "ຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:60
msgid ""
"For more information about {CoCo}, see "
"https://www.fortanix.com/platform/confidential-computing-manager/what-is-confidential-computing[here]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {CoCo}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້[ທີ່ນີ້] https://www.fortanix.com/platform/confidential-computing-manager/what-is-confidential-computing."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Lifecycle Management Examples"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ (Content Lifecycle Management)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains some common examples of how you can use content "
"lifecycle management.  Use these examples to build your own personalized "
"implementation."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບມີຕົວຢ່າງທົ່ວໄປບາງຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບວິທີທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ. ໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງການນຳໃຊ້ສ່ວນຕົວຂອງທ່ານເອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating a Project for a Monthly Patch Cycle"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໂຄງການສຳລັບຮອບວຽນການແພັດ (Patch) ປະຈຳເດືອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:4
msgid "An example project for a monthly patch cycle consists of:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໂຄງການສຳລັບຮອບວຽນການແພັດປະຈຳເດືອນປະກອບມີ:"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating a `By Date` filter"
msgstr "ການສ້າງຕົວຕອງແບບ `ຕາມວັນທີ`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:6
msgid "Adding the filter to the project"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງໃສ່ໂຄງການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:7
msgid "Applying the filter to a new project build"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງກັບການບິວ (Build) ໂຄງການໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:8
msgid "Excluding a patch from the project"
msgstr "ການຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດອອກຈາກໂຄງການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:9
msgid "Including a patch in the project"
msgstr "ການລວມແພັດເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The ``By Date`` filter excludes all patches released after a specified "
"date.  This filter is useful for your content lifecycle projects that follow "
"a monthly patch cycle."
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງ ``ຕາມວັນທີ`` ຈະຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາຫຼັງຈາກວັນທີທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຕົວຕອງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາຂອງທ່ານທີ່ເຮັດຕາມຮອບວຽນການແພັດປະຈຳເດືອນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating the ``By Date`` filter"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຕົວຕອງແບບ ``ຕາມວັນທີ``"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:13
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:38
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:53
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] "
"and click btn:[Create Filter]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Content Lifecycle[Filters] ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Filter]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:14
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:90
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filter Name`` field, type a name for your filter."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບຕົວຕອງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:15
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``Exclude patches by date``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``Exclude patches by date``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filter Type`` field, select [guimenu]``Patch (Issue "
"date)``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Patch (Issue date)``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, [guimenu]``later or equal`` is "
"autoselected."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ຕົວເລືອກ [guimenu]``later or equal`` ຈະຖືກເລືອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:18
msgid "Select the date and time."
msgstr "ເລືອກວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:19
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:25
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:45
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:62
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:150
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:146
msgid "Click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add a filter to the project"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງໃສ່ໂຄງການ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding a filter to a project"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງໃສ່ໂຄງການ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] "
"and select a project from the list."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Content Lifecycle[Projects] ແລະ ເລືອກໂຄງການຈາກລາຍການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:23
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters] link to see all available filters"
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ລິ້ງ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວຕອງທີ່ມີທັງໝົດ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:24
msgid "Select the new [guimenu]``Exclude patches by date`` filter."
msgstr "ເລືອກຕົວຕອງໃໝ່ [guimenu]``Exclude patches by date``."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apply a filter to a new project build"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງກັບການບິວໂຄງການໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The new filter is added to your filter list, but it still needs to be "
"applied to the project.  To apply the filter you need to build the first "
"environment."
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງໃໝ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການຕົວຕອງຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ມັນຍັງຕ້ອງໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບໂຄງການ. ເພື່ອຮັບຮອງເອົາຕົວຕອງ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງບິວສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environment) ທຳອິດ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using the filter"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:29
msgid "Click btn:[Build] to build the first environment."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Build] ເພື່ອບິວສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທຳອິດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:30
msgid "OPTIONAL: Add a message."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:31
msgid "You can use messages to help track the build history."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມເພື່ອຊ່ວຍຕິດຕາມປະຫວັດການບິວ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Check that the filter has worked correctly by using the new channels on a "
"test server."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າຕົວຕອງເຮັດວຽກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ໃໝ່ໃນເຊີບເວີທົດລອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:33
msgid "Click btn:[Promote] to move the content to the next environment."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Promote] ເພື່ອຍ້າຍເນື້ອຫາໄປຍັງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຖັດໄປ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The build takes longer if you have a large number of filters, or they are "
"very complex."
msgstr "ການບິວຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນກວ່າ ຫາກທ່ານມີຕົວຕອງເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼວງຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ຕົວຕອງມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude a patch from the project"
msgstr "ການຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດອອກຈາກໂຄງການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Tests may help you discover issues.  When an issue is found, exclude the "
"problem patch released before the `by date` filter."
msgstr "ການທົດສອບອາດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານພົບບັນຫາ. ເມື່ອພົບບັນຫາ, ໃຫ້ຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດທີ່ມີບັນຫາ ເຊິ່ງຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາກ່ອນຕົວຕອງ `ຕາມວັນທີ`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Excluding a patch"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:39
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filter Name`` field, enter a name for the filter."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Name``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ສຳລັບຕົວຕອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:40
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``Exclude openjdk patch``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``Exclude openjdk patch``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:41
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filter Type`` field, select [guimenu]``Patch (Advisory "
"Name)``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Patch (Advisory Name)``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:42
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:57
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, select [guimenu]``equals``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``equals``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:43
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Advisory Name`` field, type a name for the advisory."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Advisory Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຂອງ advisory."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:44
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``SUSE-15-2019-1807``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``SUSE-15-2019-1807``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:46
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:99
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:140
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:165
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:83
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:101
msgid "Navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] and select your project."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Content Lifecycle[Projects] ແລະ ເລືອກໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters] link, select [guimenu]``Exclude openjdk "
"patch``, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ລິ້ງ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Exclude openjdk patch``, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:48
msgid ""
"When you rebuild the project with the btn:[Build] button, the new filter is "
"used together with the [guimenu]``by date`` filter we added before."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານບິວໂຄງການໃໝ່ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມ btn:[Build], ຕົວຕອງໃໝ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຕົວຕອງ [guimenu]``ຕາມວັນທີ`` ທີ່ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ເພີ່ມໄປກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Include a patch in the project"
msgstr "ການລວມແພັດເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In this example, you have received a security alert.  An important security "
"patch was released several days after the first of the month you are "
"currently working on.  The name of the new patch is ``SUSE-15-2019-2071``.  "
"You need to include this new patch into your environment."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຄວາມປອດໄພ. ແພັດຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ສຳຄັນ ຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາສອງສາມມື້ຫຼັງຈາກຕົ້ນເດືອນທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. ຊື່ຂອງແພັດໃໝ່ແມ່ນ ``SUSE-15-2019-2071``. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລວມແພັດໃໝ່ນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:51
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Allow`` filters rule overrides the exclude function of the "
"[guimenu]``Deny`` filter rule.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ກົດລະບຽບຕົວຕອງ [guimenu]``Allow`` ຈະທັບຊ້ອນ (override) ຟັງຊັນການຍົກເວັ້ນຂອງ ກົດລະບຽບຕົວຕອງ [guimenu]``Deny``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Including a patch in a project"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລວມແພັດເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:54
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filter Name`` field, type a name for the filter."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບຕົວຕອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:55
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``Include kernel security fix``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``Include kernel security fix``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:58
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Advisory Name`` field, type "
"[guimenu]``SUSE-15-2019-2071``, and check [guimenu]``Allow``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Advisory Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [guimenu]``SUSE-15-2019-2071``, ແລະ ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ [guimenu]``Allow``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:59
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:98
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to store the filter."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກຕົວຕອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] and select your project from "
"the list."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Content Lifecycle[Projects] ແລະ ເລືອກໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານຈາກລາຍການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], and select [guimenu]``Include kernel "
"security patch``."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], ແລະ ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Include kernel security patch``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:63
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:114
msgid "Click btn:[Build] to rebuild the environment."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Build] ເພື່ອບິວສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update an existing monthly patch cycle"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດຮອບວຽນການແພັດປະຈຳເດືອນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:65
msgid ""
"When a monthly patch cycle is complete, you can update the patch cycle for "
"the next month."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຮອບວຽນການແພັດປະຈຳເດືອນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດອັບເດດຮອບວຽນການແພັດສຳລັບເດືອນຖັດໄປ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating a monthly patch cycle"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເດດຮອບວຽນການແພັດປະຈຳເດືອນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:67
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``by date`` field, change the date of the filter to the next "
"month."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``by date``, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນວັນທີຂອງຕົວຕອງເປັນເດືອນຖັດໄປ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:68
msgid "Alternatively, create a new filter and change the assignment to the project."
msgstr "ຫຼືອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງຕົວຕອງໃໝ່ ແລະ ປ່ຽນການກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບໂຄງການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:69
msgid ""
"Check if the exclude filter for ``SUSE-15-2019-1807`` can be detached from "
"the project."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າຕົວຕອງຍົກເວັ້ນສຳລັບ ``SUSE-15-2019-1807`` ສາມາດຖອດອອກ (detach) ຈາກໂຄງການໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:70
msgid "There may be a new patch available to fix this issue."
msgstr "ອາດຈະມີແພັດໃໝ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:71
msgid "Detach the ``allow`` filter you added previously."
msgstr "ຖອດຕົວຕອງ ``allow`` ທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ເພີ່ມໄປກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ອອກ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:72
msgid "The patch is included by default."
msgstr "ແພັດຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:73
msgid ""
"Rebuild the project to create a new environment with patches for the next "
"month."
msgstr "ບິວໂຄງການໃໝ່ເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ທີ່ມີແພັດສຳລັບເດືອນຖັດໄປ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enhance a project with live patching"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໂຄງການດ້ວຍ live patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:75
msgid ""
"This section covers setting up filters to create environments for live "
"patching."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຕອງເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຳລັບ live patching."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:76
msgid ""
"When you are preparing to use live patching, there are some important "
"considerations:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານກຳລັງກຽມໃຊ້ live patching, ມີຂໍ້ຄວນຄຳນຶງທີ່ສຳຄັນບາງຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:77
msgid "Only ever use one kernel version on your systems."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນ kernel ພຽງເວີຊັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:78
msgid "The live patching packages are installed with a specific kernel."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ live patching ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງກັບ kernel ສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:79
msgid "Live patching updates are shipped as one patch."
msgstr "ການອັບເດດ live patching ຈະຖືກສົ່ງມາໃນຮູບແບບແພັດດຽວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:80
msgid ""
"Each kernel patch that begins a new series of live patching kernels displays "
"the ``required reboot`` flag."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະ kernel patch ທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຊີຣີໃໝ່ຂອງ live patching kernels ຈະສະແດງ ທຸງ ``required reboot`` (ຕ້ອງມີການບູດລະບົບໃໝ່)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:81
msgid ""
"These kernel patches come with live patching tools.  When you have installed "
"them, you need to reboot the system at least once before the next year."
msgstr "kernel patches ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມາພ້ອມກັບເຄື່ອງມື live patching. ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງບູດລະບົບໃໝ່ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງກ່ອນປີຖັດໄປ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:82
msgid "Only install live patch updates that match the installed kernel version."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງສະເພາະການອັບເດດ live patch ທີ່ກົງກັບເວີຊັນ kernel ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:83
msgid "Live patches are provided as stand-alone patches."
msgstr "Live patches ຖືກສະໜອງໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບແພັດແບບ stand-alone."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:84
msgid ""
"You must exclude all regular kernel patches with higher kernel version than "
"the currently installed one."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງຍົກເວັ້ນທຸກ regular kernel patches ທີ່ມີເວີຊັນ kernel ສູງກວ່າເວີຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude packages with a higher kernel version"
msgstr "ການຍົກເວັ້ນແພັກເກດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນ kernel ສູງກວ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:86
msgid ""
"In this example you update your systems with the ``SUSE-15-2019-1244`` "
"patch.  This patch contains ``kernel-default-4.12.14-150.17.1-x86_64``."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ທ່ານຈະອັບເດດລະບົບຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍແພັດ ``SUSE-15-2019-1244``. ແພັດນີ້ປະກອບມີ ``kernel-default-4.12.14-150.17.1-x86_64``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:87
msgid ""
"You need to exclude all patches which contain a higher version of "
"[package]``kernel-default`` and [package]``kernel-default-base``."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຍົກເວັ້ນທຸກແພັດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນທີ່ສູງກວ່າຂອງ [package]``kernel-default`` ແລະ [package]``kernel-default-base``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Excluding packages with a higher kernel version"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍົກເວັ້ນແພັກເກດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນ kernel ສູງກວ່າ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:89
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:76
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:94
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters], "
"and click btn:[Create Filter]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Content Lifecycle[Filters], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Filter]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:91
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:92
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filter Type`` field, select [guimenu]``Patch (Contains "
"Package)``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Patch (Contains Package)``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:93
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, select [guimenu]``version greater than``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``version greater than``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:94
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Package Name`` field, type [systemitem]``kernel-default``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Package Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``kernel-default``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:95
msgid "Leave the [guimenu]``Epoch`` field empty."
msgstr "ປະຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Epoch`` ໃຫ້ວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:96
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Version`` field, type [systemitem]``4.12.14``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Version``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``4.12.14``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:97
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Release`` field, type [systemitem]``150.17.1``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Release``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``150.17.1``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:100
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:23
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:84
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:102
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:101
msgid ""
"Select [guimenu]``Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1``, and click "
"btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1``, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:102
msgid ""
"You need to repeat this procedure for the [package]``kernel-default-base`` "
"package."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດຊ້ຳຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສຳລັບແພັກເກດ [package]``kernel-default-base``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:103
msgid ""
"When you click btn:[Build], a new environment is created.  The new "
"environment contains all the kernel patches up to the version you installed."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຄລິກ btn:[Build], ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ຈະປະກອບມີ kernel patches ທັງໝົດຈົນຮອດເວີຊັນທີ່ທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:104
msgid ""
"All kernel patches with higher kernel versions are removed.  Live patching "
"kernels remain available as long as they are not the first in a series."
msgstr "Kernel patches ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນ kernel ສູງກວ່າຈະຖືກຖອດອອກ. Live patching kernels ຈະຍັງຄົງມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ ຕາບໃດທີ່ພວກມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນອັນທຳອິດໃນຊີຣີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:105
msgid ""
"This procedure can be automated using a filter template.  For more "
"information on how to apply a live patching filter template, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc#filter-templates[]."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງ (filter template). ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງ live patching, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc#filter-templates[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switch to a new kernel version for live patching"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ເວີຊັນ kernel ໃໝ່ສຳລັບ live patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:107
msgid ""
"Live patching for a specific kernel version is only available for one year.  "
"After one year you must update the kernel on your systems.  Execute these "
"environment changes:"
msgstr "Live patching ສຳລັບເວີຊັນ kernel ສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ໜຶ່ງປີເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫຼັງຈາກໜຶ່ງປີ ທ່ານຕ້ອງອັບເດດ kernel ໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ. ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການປ່ຽນແປງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Switch to a new kernel version"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ເວີຊັນ kernel ໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:109
msgid "Decide which kernel version to upgrade to."
msgstr "ຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າຈະອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັນ kernel ໃດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:110
msgid "For example: `4.12.14-150.32.1`"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: `4.12.14-150.32.1`"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:111
msgid "Create a new kernel version Filter."
msgstr "ສ້າງຕົວຕອງເວີຊັນ kernel ໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:112
msgid "Detach all previous Live Patching filters associated with the old kernel."
msgstr "ຖອດຕົວຕອງ Live Patching ທັງໝົດກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ kernel ເກົ່າອອກ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:113
msgid "Attach the new kernel version filter."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ (attach) ຕົວຕອງເວີຊັນ kernel ໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:115
msgid ""
"Once the build is complete, you must immediately re-attach the two filters "
"which:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອການບິວສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງຕົວຕອງສອງອັນຄືນໃໝ່ທັນທີ ເຊິ່ງຈະ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:116
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:72
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:90
msgid "Deny patches that contain ``reboot_suggested`` keyword"
msgstr "ປະຕິເສດ (Deny) ແພັດທີ່ມີຄຳສຳຄັນ ``reboot_suggested``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:117
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:73
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:91
msgid ""
"Deny patches that contain a package which provides the name "
"``installhint(reboot-needed)``"
msgstr "ປະຕິເສດແພັດທີ່ມີແພັກເກດເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ຊື່ ``installhint(reboot-needed)``"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:118
msgid ""
"The new environment contains all kernel patches up to the new kernel version "
"you selected.  You need to reboot systems after they have performed the "
"upgrade.  The new kernel remains valid for one year.  All packages installed "
"during the year match the current live patching kernel filter."
msgstr "ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ປະກອບມີ kernel patches ທັງໝົດຈົນຮອດເວີຊັນ kernel ໃໝ່ທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງບູດລະບົບໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ພວກມັນໄດ້ທຳການອັບເກຣດແລ້ວ. kernel ໃໝ່ຈະຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ໄດ້ເປັນເວລາໜຶ່ງປີ. ທຸກແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະຫວ່າງປີຈະກົງກັບຕົວຕອງ live patching kernel ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "AppStream filters"
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງ AppStream"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:120
msgid ""
"In a content lifecycle management project, you can use the AppStream filter "
"to transform modular repositories into regular repositories.  It does this "
"by keeping the packages in the repository and stripping away the module "
"metadata.  The resulting repository can be used in {productname} in the same "
"way as a regular repository."
msgstr "ໃນໂຄງການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ AppStream ເພື່ອປ່ຽນ modular repositories ໃຫ້ເປັນ repositories ທຳມະດາ. ມັນເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການເກັບ ແພັກເກດໄວ້ໃນ repository ແລະ ຕັດ metadata ຂອງໂມດູນອອກ. repository ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} ໄດ້ໃນລັກສະນະດຽວກັນກັບ repository ທຳມະດາ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:121
msgid "AppStream repositories are natively supported throughout the {webui}."
msgstr "AppStream repositories ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບແບບ native ທົ່ວທັງ {webui}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:122
msgid ""
"Since {productname} 5.0, AppStream repositories are natively supported "
"throughout the {webui}."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງແຕ່ {productname} 5.0 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, AppStream repositories ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບແບບ native ທົ່ວທັງ {webui}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:123
msgid ""
"Therefore, this process is not mandatory to work with AppStream "
"repositories."
msgstr "ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຂະບວນການນີ້ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແມ່ນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນໃນການເຮັດວຽກກັບ AppStream repositories."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:124
msgid ""
"The AppStream filter selects a single module stream to be included in the "
"target repository.  You can add multiple filters to select multiple module "
"streams."
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງ AppStream ຈະເລືອກ module stream ດຽວເພື່ອລວມເຂົ້າໃນ repository ປາຍທາງ. ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມຫຼາຍຕົວຕອງເພື່ອເລືອກຫຼາຍ module streams ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:125
msgid ""
"If you do not use an AppStream filter in your CLM project, the module "
"metadata in the modular sources remains intact, and the target repositories "
"contain the same module metadata.  As long as at least one AppStream filter "
"is enabled in the CLM project, all target repositories are transformed into "
"regular repositories."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ AppStream ໃນໂຄງການ CLM ຂອງທ່ານ, module metadata ໃນ modular sources ຈະຍັງຄົງຄືເກົ່າ, ແລະ repository ປາຍທາງຈະມີ module metadata ດຽວກັນ. ຕາບໃດທີ່ ມີຕົວຕອງ AppStream ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນໂຄງການ CLM, repository ປາຍທາງທັງໝົດ ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນ repository ທຳມະດາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:126
msgid ""
"In some cases, you might wish to build regular repositories without having "
"to include packages from any module.  To do so, add an AppStream filter "
"using the matcher [parameter]``none (disable modularity)``.  This will "
"disable all the modules in the target repository.  This is especially useful "
"for {rhel}{nbsp}9 clients, where the default versions of most modules are "
"already included in the AppStream repository as regular packages."
msgstr "ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການບິວ repository ທຳມະດາໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງລວມແພັກເກດຈາກ ໂມດູນໃດໆ. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງ AppStream ໂດຍໃຊ້ matcher [parameter]``none (disable modularity)``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານທຸກໂມດູນໃນ repository ປາຍທາງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເປັນພິເສດສຳລັບ ໄຄລແອນ {rhel}{nbsp}9, ເຊິ່ງເວີຊັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂມດູນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໄດ້ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນ AppStream repository ໃນຮູບແບບແພັກເກດທຳມະດາຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:127
msgid ""
"To use the AppStream filter, you need a CLM project with a modular "
"repository such as ``{rhel} AppStreams``.  Ensure that you included the "
"module you need as a source before you begin."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ AppStream, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີໂຄງການ CLM ທີ່ມີ modular repository ເຊັ່ນ ``{rhel} AppStreams``. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ລວມເອົາໂມດູນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເປັນ source ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using AppStream filters"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ AppStream"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:129
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:144
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:158
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to your {rhel}{nbsp}8 or 9 CLM "
"project."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ໂຄງການ CLM {rhel}{nbsp}8 ຫຼື 9 ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:130
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:145
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:159
msgid "Ensure that you have included the AppStream channels for your project."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ລວມເອົາຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) AppStream ສຳລັບໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:131
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:146
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:160
msgid "Click btn:[Create Filter] and use these parameters:"
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Filter] ແລະ ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:132
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:147
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:161
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filter Name`` field, type a name for the new filter."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບຕົວຕອງໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:133
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:148
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:162
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filter Type`` field, select [parameter]``Module "
"(Stream)``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [parameter]``Module (Stream)``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:134
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:149
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, select [parameter]``equals``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [parameter]``equals``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:135
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Module Name`` field, type a module name."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Module Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ໂມດູນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:136
msgid "For example, [parameter]``postgresql``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [parameter]``postgresql``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:137
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Stream`` field, type the name of the desired stream."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Stream``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຂອງ stream ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:138
msgid ""
"For example, [parameter]``10``.  If you leave this field blank, the default "
"stream for the module is selected."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [parameter]``10``. ຫາກທ່ານປະຊ່ອງນີ້ໃຫ້ວ່າງໄວ້, stream ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂມດູນຈະຖືກເລືອກ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:139
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:164
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to create the new filter."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຕອງໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:141
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:166
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], select your new AppStream filter, and "
"click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], ເເລືອກຕົວຕອງ AppStream ໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:142
msgid ""
"You can use the browse function in the ``Create/Edit Filter`` form to select "
"a module from a list of available module streams for a modular channel."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນການເລືອກເບິ່ງ (browse) ໃນແບບຟອມ ``Create/Edit Filter`` ເພື່ອເລືອກໂມດູນຈາກລາຍການ module streams ທີ່ມີສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງ modular."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:143
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Browsing available module streams"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເລືອກເບິ່ງ module streams ທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:150
msgid "Click ``Browse available modules`` to see all modular channels."
msgstr "ຄລິກ ``Browse available modules`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຊ່ອງທາງ modular ທັງໝົດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:151
msgid "Select a channel to browse the modules and streams:"
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງເພື່ອເບິ່ງໂມດູນ ແລະ streams:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:152
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Module Name`` field, start typing a module name to search, "
"or select from the list."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Module Name``, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມພິມຊື່ໂມດູນເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາ, ຫຼື ເລືອກຈາກລາຍການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:153
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Stream`` field, start typing a stream name to search, or "
"select from the list."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Stream``, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມພິມຊື່ stream ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາ, ຫຼື ເລືອກຈາກລາຍການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:154
msgid ""
"Channel selection is only for browsing modules.  The selected channel is not "
"be saved with the filter, and does not affect the CLM process in any way."
msgstr "ການເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງແມ່ນເພື່ອການເບິ່ງໂມດູນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເລືອກຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ ກັບຕົວຕອງ, ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຂະບວນການ CLM ແຕ່ຢ່າງໃດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:155
msgid ""
"You can create additional AppStream filters for any other module stream to "
"be included in the target repository.  Any module streams that the selected "
"stream depends on is automatically included."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຕົວຕອງ AppStream ເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບ module stream ອື່ນໆເພື່ອລວມເຂົ້າໃນ repository ປາຍທາງ. module streams ໃດໆທີ່ stream ທີ່ເລືອກນັ້ນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ (depends on) ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:156
msgid ""
"Be careful not to specify conflicting, incompatible, or missing module "
"streams.  For example, selecting two streams from the same module is "
"invalid."
msgstr "ຈົ່ງລະວັງບໍ່ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ module streams ທີ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັນ, ເຂົ້າກັນບໍ່ໄດ້, ຫຼື ບໍ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການເລືອກສອງ streams ຈາກໂມດູນດຽວກັນແມ່ນໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:157
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Disabling modularity"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປິດການໃຊ້ງານ modularity"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:163
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, select [parameter]``none (disable "
"modularity)``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [parameter]``none (disable modularity)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:167
msgid ""
"This will effectively remove the module metadata from the target repository, "
"excluding any package that belongs to a module."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະທຳການຖອດ module metadata ອອກຈາກ repository ປາຍທາງຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ, ໂດຍການຍົກເວັ້ນທຸກແພັກເກດທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບໂມດູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:168
msgid ""
"When you build your CLM project using the btn:[Build] button in the {webui}, "
"the target repository is a regular repository without any modules, that "
"contains packages from the selected module streams."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານບິວໂຄງການ CLM ຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ btn:[Build] ໃນ {webui}, repository ປາຍທາງຈະເປັນ repository ທຳມະດາທີ່ບໍ່ມີໂມດູນໃດໆ, ເຊິ່ງປະກອບມີ ແພັກເກດຈາກ module streams ທີ່ເລືອກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:169
msgid ""
"Disabling modularity altogether in {rhel}{nbsp}8 projects might result in a "
"faulty environment as some modules are essential for healthy operation in "
"{rhel}{nbsp}8."
msgstr "ການປິດການໃຊ້ງານ modularity ທັງໝົດໃນໂຄງການ {rhel}{nbsp}8 ອາດຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເນື່ອງຈາກບາງໂມດູນມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ປົກກະຕິໃນ {rhel}{nbsp}8."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Lifecycle Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ (Content Lifecycle Management)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Content lifecycle management allows you to customize and test packages "
"before updating production clients.  This is especially useful if you need "
"to apply updates during a limited maintenance window."
msgstr "ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງ ແລະ ທົດສອບແພັກເກດ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະອັບເດດໃຫ້ກັບໄຄລແອນທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (production clients). ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເປັນພິເສດ ຫາກທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງນຳໃຊ້ການອັບເດດໃນລະຫວ່າງຊ່ວງເວລາການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (maintenance window) ທີ່ຈຳກັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Content lifecycle management allows you to select software channels as "
"sources, adjust them as required for your environment, and thoroughly test "
"them before installing onto your production clients."
msgstr "ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ (software channels) ເປັນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ, ປັບແຕ່ງພວກມັນຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ທົດສອບຢ່າງລະອຽດ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງໃສ່ໄຄລແອນທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:4
msgid ""
"While you cannot directly modify vendor channels, you can clone them and "
"then modify the clones by adding or removing packages and custom patches.  "
"You can assign these cloned channels to test clients to ensure they work as "
"expected."
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor channels) ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດໂຄນ (clone) ພວກມັນ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງຕົວໂຄນໂດຍການເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຖອດແພັກເກດ ແລະ ແພັດທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງອອກໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໂຄນມາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ກັບໄຄລແອນທົດສອບ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພວກມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:5
msgid ""
"By default, cloned vendor channels match the original vendor channel and "
"automatically select the dependencies.  You can disable the automatic "
"selection for cloned channels by adding the following option in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດທີ່ໂຄນມາຈະກົງກັບຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດດັ້ງເດີມ ແລະ ເລືອກສິ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ (dependencies) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການເລືອກອັດຕະໂນມັດ ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໂຄນມາໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.cloned_channel_auto_selection = false\n"
msgstr "java.cloned_channel_auto_selection = false\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Then, when all tests pass, you can promote the cloned channels to production "
"servers."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນ, ເມື່ອການທົດສອບທັງໝົດຜ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລື່ອນ (promote) ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໂຄນມານັ້ນໄປຍັງເຊີບເວີທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This is achieved through a series of environments that your software "
"channels can move through on their lifecycle.  Most environment lifecycles "
"include at least test and production environments, but you can have as many "
"environments as you require."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ຜ່ານຊຸດຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຂອງທ່ານສາມາດຍ້າຍຜ່ານໄດ້ ຕາມວົງຈອນຊີວິດຂອງພວກມັນ. ວົງຈອນຊີວິດຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະປະກອບມີ ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທົດສອບ ແລະ ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ, ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດມີຫຼາຍສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This section covers the basic content lifecycle procedures, and the filters "
"available.  For more specific examples, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc[]."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາຂັ້ນຕອນວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາພື້ນຖານ, ແລະ ຕົວຕອງທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງກວ່າ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a content lifecycle project"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:11
msgid ""
"To set up a content lifecycle, you need to begin with a project.  The "
"project defines the software channel sources, the filters used to find "
"packages, and the build environments."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍໂຄງການ. ໂຄງການຈະກຳນົດແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ, ຕົວຕອງທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກດ, ແລະ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການບິວ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a content lifecycle project"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and click btn:[Create Project]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Content Lifecycle[Projects], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Project]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:14
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Label`` field, enter a label for your project."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Label``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນປ້າຍຊື່ (label) ສຳລັບໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:15
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Label`` field only accepts lowercase letters, numbers, "
"periods, hyphens, and underscores."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Label`` ຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່ຕົວອັກສອນພາສາອັງກິດພິມນ້ອຍ, ຕົວເລກ, ຈ້ຳ (.), ຂີດຕໍ່ (-), ແລະ ຂີດກ້ອງ (_) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:16
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Name`` field, enter a descriptive name for your project."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Name``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ທີ່ອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Click the btn:[Create] button to create your project and return to the "
"project page."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອສ້າງໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ກັບຄືນໄປທີ່ໜ້າໂຄງການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:18
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Sources]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Sources]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Sources`` dialog, select the source type, and select a "
"base channel for your project."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ [guimenu]``Sources``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກປະເພດແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (base channel) ສຳລັບໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The available child channels for the selected base channel are displayed, "
"including information on whether the channel is mandatory or recommended."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child channels) ທີ່ມີສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ເລືອກຈະຖືກສະແດງອອກມາ, ລວມທັງຂໍ້ມູນວ່າຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ບັງຄັບ ຫຼື ແນະນຳ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Check the child channels you require, and click btn:[Save] to return to the "
"project page."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອກັບຄືນໄປທີ່ໜ້າໂຄງການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:22
msgid "The software channels you selected should now be showing."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກຄວນຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາໃນຕອນນີ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filters`` dialog, select the filters you want to attach to "
"the project."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ [guimenu]``Filters``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຕົວຕອງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງໃສ່ໂຄງການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:25
msgid "To create a new filter, click btn:[Create new Filter]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຕອງໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Create new Filter]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:26
msgid "Click btn:[Add Environment]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Add Environment]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle`` dialog, give the first environment "
"a name, a label, and a description, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຊື່, ປ້າຍຊື່, ແລະ ຄຳອະທິບາຍສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທຳອິດ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Continue creating environments until you have all the environments for your "
"lifecycle completed."
msgstr "ສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຕໍ່ໄປຈົນກວ່າທ່ານຈະມີທຸກສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຄົບຖ້ວນສຳລັບ ວົງຈອນຊີວິດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You can select the order of the environments in the lifecycle by selecting "
"an environment in the [guimenu]``Insert before`` field when you create it."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກລຳດັບຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນວົງຈອນຊີວິດໄດ້ ໂດຍການເລືອກ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Insert before`` ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງມັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter types"
msgstr "ປະເພດຕົວຕອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:32
msgid ""
"{productname} allows you to create various types of filters to control the "
"content used for building the project.  Filters allow you to select which "
"packages are included or excluded from the build.  For example, you could "
"exclude all kernel packages, or include only specific releases of some "
"packages."
msgstr "{productname} ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງຕົວຕອງປະເພດຕ່າງໆເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມເນື້ອຫາ ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການບິວໂຄງການ. ຕົວຕອງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກວ່າແພັກເກດໃດ ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ຍົກເວັ້ນອອກຈາກການບິວ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ທ່ານສາມາດຍົກເວັ້ນ ແພັກເກດ kernel ທັງໝົດ, ຫຼື ລວມສະເພາະເວີຊັນທີ່ກຳນົດຂອງບາງແພັກເກດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:33
msgid "The supported filters are:"
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງທີ່ຮອງຮັບຄື:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:34
msgid "package filtering"
msgstr "ການຕອງແພັກເກດ"

#. type: Plain text
