#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:45
msgid "Take a note of the file paths and profiles for performing the scan."
msgstr "ຈົດບັນທຶກເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການກວດສອບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform an audit scan"
msgstr "ການປະຕິບັດການກວດສອບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:47
msgid ""
"When you have installed or transferred your content files, you can perform "
"audit scans.  Audit scans can be triggered using the {productname} {webui}.  "
"You can also use the {productname} API to schedule regular scans."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ສົ່ງໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມການກວດສອບໄດ້. ການກວດສອບສາມາດເລີ່ມໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui} ຫຼື ໃຊ້ {productname} API ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍກຳນົດເວລາການກວດສອບແບບປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running an audit scan from the {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບຜ່ານ {webui}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:49
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List] and "
"select the client you want to scan."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Systems[Systems List] ແລະ ເລືອກຄຼາຍເອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການກວດສອບ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Audit`` tab, and the [guimenu]``Schedule`` "
"subtab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Audit`` ແລະ ແທັບຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``Schedule``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:51
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Path to XCCDF Document`` field, enter the parameters for "
"the SCAP template and profile you want to use on the client.  For example:"
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Path to XCCDF Document``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນພາຣາມິເຕີສຳລັບແມ່ແບບ SCAP ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:52
msgid "[literal]``Command``: /usr/bin/oscap xccdf eval"
msgstr "[literal]``Command``: /usr/bin/oscap xccdf eval"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:53
msgid ""
"[literal]``Command-line arguments``: --profile "
"xccdf_org.ssgproject.content_profile_stig"
msgstr "[literal]``Command-line arguments``: --profile xccdf_org.ssgproject.content_profile_stig"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:54
msgid ""
"[literal]``Path to XCCDF document``: "
"/usr/share/xml/scap/ssg/content/ssg-sle15-ds.xml"
msgstr "[literal]``Path to XCCDF document``: /usr/share/xml/scap/ssg/content/ssg-sle15-ds.xml"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:55
msgid ""
"If you use [literal]``--fetch-remote-resources`` parameter a lot of RAM is "
"required.  In addition, you may need to increase the value of "
"[literal]``file_recv_max_size``."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີ [literal]``--fetch-remote-resources``, ລະບົບຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ RAM ຫຼາຍ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຄ່າຂອງ [literal]``file_recv_max_size`` ນຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:56
msgid "The scan runs at the client's next scheduled synchronization."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ຄຼາຍເອນມີການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຊິນ (synchronization)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:57
msgid ""
"The XCCDF content file is validated before it is run on the remote system.  "
"If the content file includes invalid arguments, the test fails."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ XCCDF ຈະຖືກກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໄປເຮັດວຽກໃນລະບົບປາຍທາງ. ຖ້າໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາມີອາຣກິວເມັນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ການທົດສອບຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running an audit scan from the API"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບຜ່ານ API"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Before you begin, ensure that the client to be scanned has Python and "
"XML-RPC libraries installed."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າຄຼາຍເອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການກວດສອບໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ Python ແລະ ໄລບຣາຣີ XML-RPC ແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Choose an existing script or create a script for scheduling a system scan "
"through ``system.scap.scheduleXccdfScan``.  For example:"
msgstr "ເລືອກສະຄຣິບທີ່ມີຢູ່ ຫຼື ສ້າງສະຄຣິບໃໝ່ເພື່ອ ກຳນົດເວລາການກວດສອບຜ່ານ ``system.scap.scheduleXccdfScan``. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/usr/bin/python3\n"
"import xmlrpc.client\n"
"client = xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy('https://server.example.com/rpc/api')\n"
"key = client.auth.login('username', 'password')\n"
"client.system.scap.scheduleXccdfScan(key, <1000010001>,\n"
"    '<path_to_xccdf_file.xml>',\n"
"    '--profile <profile_name>')\n"
"client.auth.logout(session_key)\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/usr/bin/python3\n"
"import xmlrpc.client\n"
"client = xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy('https://server.example.com/rpc/api')\n"
"key = client.auth.login('username', 'password')\n"
"client.system.scap.scheduleXccdfScan(key, <1000010001>,\n"
"    '<ເສັ້ນທາງ_ໄປຫາ_ໄຟລ໌_xccdf.xml>',\n"
"    '--profile <ຊື່_ໂປຣໄຟລ໌>')\n"
"client.auth.logout(session_key)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:62
msgid "In this example:"
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:63
msgid "``<1000010001>`` is the system ID (sid)."
msgstr "``<1000010001>`` ແມ່ນ ID ຂອງລະບົບ (sid)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:64
msgid ""
"``<path_to_xccdf_file.xml>`` is the path to the content file location on the "
"client.  For example, "
"[path]``/usr/share/xml/scap/ssg/content/ssg-sle15-ds.xml``."
msgstr "``<ເສັ້ນທາງ_ໄປຫາ_ໄຟລ໌_xccdf.xml>`` ແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາໃນຄຼາຍເອນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: [path]``/usr/share/xml/scap/ssg/content/ssg-sle15-ds.xml``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:65
msgid ""
"``<profile_name>`` is an additional argument for the [command]``oscap`` "
"command.  For example, use "
"``united_states_government_configuration_baseline`` (USGCB)."
msgstr "``<ຊື່_ໂປຣໄຟລ໌>`` ແມ່ນອາຣກິວເມັນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``oscap``. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃຊ້ ``united_states_government_configuration_baseline`` (USGCB)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:66
msgid "Run the script on the client you want to scan, from the command prompt."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບໃນຄຼາຍເອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການກວດສອບ ຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ command prompt."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scan results"
msgstr "ຜົນການກວດສອບ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:68
msgid ""
"Information about the scans you have run is in the {productname} {webui}.  "
"Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > All Scans] for a table of results.  For "
"more information about the data in this table, see "
"xref:reference:audit/openscap-all-scans.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການກວດສອບທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ເຮັດຈະຢູ່ໃນ {productname} {webui}. ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Audit[OpenSCAP > All Scans] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕາຕະລາງຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃນຕາຕະລາງນີ້, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:reference:audit/openscap-all-scans.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:69
msgid ""
"To ensure that detailed information about scans is available, you need to "
"enable it on the client.  In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to "
"menu:Admin[Organizations] and click on the organization the client is a part "
"of.  Navigate to the [guimenu]``Configuration`` tab, and check the "
"[guimenu]``Enable Upload of Detailed SCAP Files`` option.  When enabled, "
"this generates an additional HTML file on every scan, which contains extra "
"information.  The results show an extra line similar to this:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມີຂໍ້ມູນລາຍລະອຽດຂອງການກວດສອບ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານມັນໃນຄຼາຍເອນ. ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Admin[Organizations] ແລະ ຄລິກໃສ່ອົງກອນທີ່ຄຼາຍເອນສັງກັດຢູ່. ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Configuration``, ແລະ ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຕົວເລືອກ [guimenu]``Enable Upload of Detailed SCAP Files``. ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ລະບົບຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ HTML ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນທຸກໆການກວດສອບ ເຊິ່ງຈະມີຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດຂຶ້ນ. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະສະແດງແຖວເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Detailed Results: xccdf-report.html xccdf-results.xml "
"scap-yast2sec-oval.xml.result.xml\n"
msgstr "Detailed Results: xccdf-report.html xccdf-results.xml scap-yast2sec-oval.xml.result.xml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:71
msgid ""
"To retrieve scan information from the command line, use the "
"[command]``spacewalk-report`` command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການກວດສອບຜ່ານ command line, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-report``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacewalk-report system-history-scap\n"
"spacewalk-report scap-scan\n"
"spacewalk-report scap-scan-results\n"
msgstr ""
"spacewalk-report system-history-scap\n"
"spacewalk-report scap-scan\n"
"spacewalk-report scap-scan-results\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:73
msgid ""
"You can also use the {productname} API to view results, with the "
"``system.scap`` handler."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} API ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການ ``system.scap``."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Removing SCAP Scan Results"
msgstr "ການລຶບຜົນການກວດສອບ SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:75
msgid ""
"Only SCAP scans that have passed the configured retention period can be "
"deleted.  You can configure the retention period in the "
"[literal]``Organization Configuration`` section."
msgstr "ສະເພາະການກວດສອບ SCAP ທີ່ກາຍກຳນົດເວລາການເກັບຮັກສາທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດລຶບໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະເວລາການເກັບຮັກສາໄດ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [literal]``Organization Configuration``."

#. type: Block title
