msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ການກວດສອບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລຶບ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:83
msgid "Click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:85
msgid ""
"Remediation Bash scripts and Ansible playbooks are provided in the same SCAP "
"Security Guide packages to harden the client systems."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບແກ້ໄຂແບບ Bash ແລະ Ansible playbooks ມີໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນແພັກເກັດ SCAP Security Guide ອັນດຽວກັນ ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍເສີມສ້າງຄວາມປອດໄພ (harden) ໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບຄຼາຍເອນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:86
msgid ""
"If you have the beta SCAP features enabled, you can apply remediation "
"directly from scan results in the {webui}, including custom per-rule "
"remediation scripts.  See "
"xref:administration:openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc#remediation-enhanced[Enhanced "
"SCAP Auditing - Remediation]."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ SCAP ເບຕ້າ, ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກຜົນການກວດສອບໃນ {webui}, ລວມທັງສະຄຣິບແກ້ໄຂແບບກຳນົດເອງຕາມແຕ່ລະກົດລະບຽບ. ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc#remediation-enhanced[Enhanced SCAP Auditing - Remediation]."

