#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Organizations"
msgstr "ອົງກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Organizations are used to manage user access and permissions within "
"{productname}."
msgstr "ອົງກອນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການການເຂົ້າເຖິງ ແລະ ສິດທິຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For most environments, a single organization is enough.  However, more "
"complicated environments might need several organizations.  You might like "
"to have an organization for each physical location within your business, or "
"for different business functions."
msgstr "ສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ອົງກອນດຽວກໍພຽງພໍແລ້ວ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ ຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າອາດຈະຕ້ອງມີຫຼາຍອົງກອນ. ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການແບ່ງອົງກອນຕາມສະຖານທີ່ຕັ້ງຕົວຈິງ ພາຍໃນທຸລະກິດຂອງທ່ານ ຫຼື ຕາມໜ້າທີ່ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When you have created your organizations, you can create and assign users to "
"your organizations.  You can then assign permissions on an organization "
"level, which applies by default to every user assigned to the organization."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງອົງກອນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ ແລະ ມອບໝາຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃຫ້ກັບອົງກອນນັ້ນໆ. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດສິດທິໃນລະດັບອົງກອນ ເຊິ່ງຈະມີຜົນກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທຸກຄົນໃນອົງກອນນັ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can also configure authentication methods for your new organization, "
"including PAM and single sign-on.  For more information about "
"authentication, see xref:administration:auth-methods.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບອົງກອນໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້, ລວມທັງ PAM ແລະ single sign-on. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:auth-methods.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a New Organization"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງອົງກອນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Organizations], and "
"click btn:[Create Organization]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Admin[Organizations], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Organization]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:9
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Create Organization`` dialog, complete these fields:"
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ [guimenu]``Create Organization``, ໃຫ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃສ່ຫ້ອງຕ່າງໆດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Organization Name`` field, type a name for your new "
"organization."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Organization Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ອົງກອນໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:11
msgid "The name should be between 3 and 128 characters long."
msgstr "ຊື່ອົງກອນຄວນມີຄວາມຍາວລະຫວ່າງ 3 ຫາ 128 ຕົວອັກສອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Desired Login`` field, type the login name you want to use "
"for the organization's administrator."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Desired Login``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ເຂົ້າລະບົບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ສຳລັບຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຂອງອົງກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:13
msgid ""
"This must be a new administrator account, you are not be able to use an "
"existing administrator account to sign in to the new organization, including "
"the one you are currently signed in with."
msgstr "ນີ້ຕ້ອງເປັນບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບໃໝ່, ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ອົງກອນໃໝ່ໄດ້, ລວມທັງບັນຊີທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Desired Password`` field, type a password for the new "
"organization's administrator."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Desired Password``, ໃຫ້ພິມລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບອົງກອນໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Confirm the password by typing it again in the [guimenu]``Confirm Password`` "
"field.  Password strength is indicated by the colored bar beneath the "
"password fields."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນລະຫັດຜ່ານໂດຍການພິມຄືນໃໝ່ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Confirm Password``. ຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະຫັດຜ່ານຈະສະແດງດ້ວຍແຖບສີທີ່ຢູ່ກ້ອງຫ້ອງລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Email`` field, type an email address for the new "
"organization's administrator."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Email``, ໃຫ້ພິມທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວສຳລັບຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບອົງກອນໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``First Name`` field, select a salutation, and type a given "
"name for the new organization's administrator."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``First Name``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຄຳນຳໜ້າ ແລະ ພິມຊື່ແທ້ຂອງຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບອົງກອນໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Last Name`` field, type a surname for the new "
"organization's administrator."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Last Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມນາມສະກຸນຂອງຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບອົງກອນໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:19
msgid "Click btn:[Create Organization]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Organization]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Organizations"
msgstr "ການຈັດການອົງກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:21
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Organizations] to see a "
"list of available organizations.  Click the name of an organization to "
"manage it."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Admin[Organizations] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ອົງກອນທີ່ມີຢູ່. ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງອົງກອນເພື່ອຈັດການມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:22
msgid ""
"From the menu:Admin[Organizations] section, you can access tabs to manage "
"users, trusts, configuration, and states for your organization."
msgstr "ຈາກສ່ວນເມນູ:Admin[Organizations], ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງແທັບຕ່າງໆເພື່ອຈັດການຜູ້ໃຊ້, ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື (trusts), ການກຳນົດຄ່າ ແລະ ສະຖານະ (states) ສຳລັບອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Organizations can only be managed by their administrators.  To manage an "
"organization, ensure you are signed in as the correct administrator for the "
"organization you want to change."
msgstr "ອົງກອນສາມາດຈັດການໄດ້ໂດຍຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຂອງພວກເຂົາເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອຈັດການອົງກອນ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ໃນນາມຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບອົງກອນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Organization Users"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນອົງກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Users`` tab to view the list of all users "
"associated with the organization, and their role.  Clicking a username takes "
"you to the [guimenu]``Users`` menu to add, change, or delete users."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Users`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບອົງກອນ ແລະ ບົດບາດຂອງພວກເຂົາ. ການຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະນຳທ່ານໄປທີ່ເມນູ [guimenu]``Users`` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ, ປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ລຶບຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trusted Organizations"
msgstr "ອົງກອນທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Trusts`` tab to add or remove trusted "
"organizations.  Establishing trust between organizations allow them to share "
"content between them, and gives you the ability to transfer clients from one "
"organization to another."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Trusts`` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຶບອົງກອນທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້. ການສ້າງຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືລະຫວ່າງອົງກອນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາສາມາດແບ່ງປັນເນື້ອຫາຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດໂອນຍ້າຍໄຄເອັນ (client) ຈາກອົງກອນໜຶ່ງໄປຫາອີກອົງກອນໜຶ່ງໄດ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Organizations"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າອົງກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Configuration`` tab to manage the configuration "
"of your organization.  This includes the use of staged contents, and the use "
"of SCAP files."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Configuration`` ເພື່ອຈັດການການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ. ເຊິ່ງລວມເຖິງການໃຊ້ເນື້ອຫາແບບ staged ແລະ ການໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ SCAP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:30
msgid ""
"For more information about content staging, see "
"xref:administration:content-staging.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ content staging, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:content-staging.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:31
msgid ""
"For more information about OpenSCAP, see "
"xref:reference:audit/audit-openscap-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ OpenSCAP, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:reference:audit/audit-openscap-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage States"
msgstr "ຈັດການສະຖານະ (States)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``States`` tab to manage Salt states for all "
"clients in your organization.  States allow you to define global security "
"policies, or add a common admin user to all clients."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``States`` ເພື່ອຈັດການ Salt states ສຳລັບໄຄເອັນທັງໝົດໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ. ສະຖານະ (States) ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດນະໂຍບາຍຄວາມປອດໄພແບບລວມ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບທົ່ວໄປໃຫ້ກັບໄຄເອັນທັງໝົດໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:34
msgid ""
"For more information about Salt States, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt States, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Configuration Channels"
msgstr "ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:36
msgid ""
"You can select which configuration channels should be applied across your "
"organization.  Configuration channels can be created in the {productname} "
"{webui} by navigating to menu:Configuration[Channels].  Apply configuration "
"channels to your organization using the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ກັບທົ່ວອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ. ຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ໃນ {productname} {webui} ໂດຍໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Configuration[Channels]. ນຳໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying Configuration Channels to an Organization"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບອົງກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:38
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Home[My Organization > "
"Configuration Channels]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Home[My Organization > Configuration Channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:39
msgid "Use the search feature to locate a channel by name."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດການຄົ້ນຫາເພື່ອຊອກຫາຊ່ອງທາງຕາມຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:40
msgid "Check the channel to be applied and click btn:[Save Changes]."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save Changes]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:41
msgid "This saves to the database, but does not apply the changes to the channel."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນການບັນທຶກລົງໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ນຳໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງກັບຊ່ອງທາງເທື່ອ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:42
msgid "Apply the changes by clicking btn:[Apply]."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍການຄລິກ btn:[Apply]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:43
msgid ""
"This schedules the task to apply the changes to all clients within the "
"organization."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນການກຳນົດເວລາໜ້າວຽກເພື່ອພະຍາຍາມນຳໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງກັບໄຄເອັນທັງໝົດພາຍໃນອົງກອນ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patch Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການແພັດ (Patch Management)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:2
msgid "This chapter contains various topics related to patch management."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ປະກອບມີຫົວຂໍ້ຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການຈັດການແພັດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retracted Patches"
msgstr "ແພັດທີ່ຖືກຖອນຄືນ (Retracted Patches)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When a new patch gets released by the vendor, it might happen that the patch "
"has undesirable side effects (security, stability) in some scenario that was "
"not identified by testing. When this happens (very rarely), vendors "
"typically release a new patch, which may take hours or days, depending on "
"the internal processes in place by that vendor."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີແພັດໃໝ່ຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາໂດຍຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor), ບາງຄັ້ງແພັດນັ້ນອາດຈະມີຜົນຂ້າງຄຽງທີ່ບໍ່ເພິ່ງປະສົງ (ຄວາມປອດໄພ, ຄວາມສະຖຽນ) ໃນບາງສະຖານະການທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກວດພົບໃນຕອນທົດສອບ. ເມື່ອເກີດເຫດການນີ້ (ເຊິ່ງເກີດຂຶ້ນໜ້ອຍຫຼາຍ), ຜູ້ຜະລິດມັກຈະປ່ອຍແພັດໃໝ່ອອກມາ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍມື້ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຂະບວນການພາຍໃນຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:5
msgid ""
"SUSE has introduced a new mechanism (2021) called \"retracted patches\" to "
"revoke such patches almost immediately by setting their advisory status to "
"\"retracted\" (instead of \"final\" or \"stable\")."
msgstr "SUSE ໄດ້ນຳສະເໜີກົນໄກໃໝ່ (2021) ທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"retracted patches\" ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກແພັດດັ່ງກ່າວເກືອບຈະທັນທີ ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຖານະການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ (advisory status) ເປັນ \"retracted\" (ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ \"final\" ຫຼື \"stable\")."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:6
msgid ""
"A patch is \"retracted,\" when its advisory status attribute is set to "
"\"retracted.\" A package is \"retracted,\" when it belongs to a "
"\"retracted\" patch."
msgstr "ແພັດຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນ \"retracted\" (ຖືກຖອນຄືນ) ເມື່ອຄຸນລັກສະນະສະຖານະການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຂອງມັນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ \"retracted\". ແພັກເກັດຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນ \"retracted\" ເມື່ອມັນເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງແພັດທີ່ຖືກຖອນຄືນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:7
msgid ""
"A retracted patch or package cannot be installed on systems with "
"{productname}. The only way to install a retracted package, is to do it "
"manually with [literal]``zypper install`` and specifying the exact package "
"version.  For example:"
msgstr "ແພັດ ຫຼື ແພັກເກັດທີ່ຖືກຖອນຄືນ ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນລະບົບດ້ວຍ {productname} ໄດ້. ວິທີດຽວທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດທີ່ຖືກຖອນຄືນແມ່ນຕ້ອງເຮັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [literal]``zypper install`` ແລະ ລະບຸເວີຊັນຂອງແພັກເກັດໃຫ້ຊັດເຈນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper install vim-8.0.1568-5.14.1\n"
msgstr "zypper install vim-8.0.1568-5.14.1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Retracted status of patches and packages is depicted with the "
"icon:times-circle[role=\"red\"] icon in the {webui} of {productname}. For "
"example, see:"
msgstr "ສະຖານະການຖອນຄືນຂອງແພັດ ແລະ ແພັກເກັດຈະຖືກສະແດງດ້ວຍໄອຄອນ icon:times-circle[role=\"red\"] ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເບິ່ງທີ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:10
msgid "list of packages in a channel"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ແພັກເກັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງ (channel)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:11
msgid "list of patches in a channel"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ແພັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງ (channel)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:12
msgid ""
"When a patch or package, that has been installed on a system, gets "
"retracted, the icon:times-circle[role=\"red\"] icon is also displayed in the "
"installed packages list of that system. {productname} does not provide a way "
"to downgrade such a patch or package."
msgstr "ເມື່ອແພັດ ຫຼື ແພັກເກັດທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະບົບແລ້ວຖືກຖອນຄືນ, ໄອຄອນ icon:times-circle[role=\"red\"] ຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນລາຍຊື່ແພັກເກັດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວຂອງລະບົບນັ້ນນຳ. {productname} ບໍ່ມີວິທີການໃນການດາວເກຣດ (downgrade) ແພັດ ຫຼື ແພັກເກັດດັ່ງກ່າວ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Clones"
msgstr "ການໂຄລນຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel Clones)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:14
msgid ""
"When using cloned channels, you must pay attention to the propagation of the "
"retracted advisory status from the original channels to the clones."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນມາ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະມັດລະວັງກ່ຽວກັບການສົ່ງຕໍ່ສະຖານະການແຈ້ງເຕືອນການຖອນຄືນຈາກຊ່ອງທາງຕົ້ນສະບັບໄປຫາຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໂຄລນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Upon cloning vendor channels into your organization, channel patches will be "
"cloned as well."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທຳການໂຄລນຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດມາໄວ້ໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ, ແພັດຂອງຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນກໍຈະຖືກໂຄລນມານຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:16
msgid ""
"When the vendor retracts a patch in a channel and {productname} synchronizes "
"this channel (for example, with the nightly job), the \"retracted\" "
"attribute will not get propagated to the cloned patches and will not be "
"observed by the clients subscribed to cloned channels. To propagate the "
"attribute to your cloned channels use one of the following ways:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຜູ້ຜະລິດຖອນຄືນແພັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ {productname} ທຳການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ດ້ວຍ nightly job), ຄຸນລັກສະນະ \"retracted\" ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາແພັດທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນ ແລະ ໄຄເອັນທີ່ສະໝັກຮັບຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໂຄລນຈະບໍ່ເຫັນການປ່ຽນແປງນີ້. ເພື່ອສົ່ງຕໍ່ຄຸນລັກສະນະນີ້ໄປຫາຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໂຄລນຂອງທ່ານ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ວິທີໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Patch Sync (menu:Software[Manage > cloned channel > Patches > Sync]). This "
"function allows you to align the attributes of patches in your cloned "
"channel to their originals."
msgstr "Patch Sync (ເມນູ:Software[Manage > cloned channel > Patches > Sync]). ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດປັບຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງແພັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໂຄລນໃຫ້ກົງກັບຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Content Lifecycle Management. For more information about cloned channels in "
"the context of Content Lifecycle Management, see "
"xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "Content Lifecycle Management. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໂຄລນໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງ Content Lifecycle Management, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patch sharing"
msgstr "ການແບ່ງປັນແພັດ (Patch sharing)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:20
msgid ""
"When you create multiple vendor channel clones in your organization, the "
"patches are not cloned multiple times, but are shared between cloned "
"channels. As a consequence, when you synchronize your cloned patch (either "
"using the patch sync function or with Content Lifecycle Management mentioned "
"above), all channels using the cloned patch will observe that change."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງການໂຄລນຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດຫຼາຍອັນໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ, ແພັດຈະບໍ່ຖືກໂຄລນຊ້ຳຫຼາຍເທື່ອ, ແຕ່ຈະຖືກແບ່ງປັນລະຫວ່າງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໂຄລນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເມື່ອທ່ານຊິງໂຄຣໄນແພັດທີ່ໂຄລນ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ patch sync ຫຼື Content Lifecycle Management ທີ່ກ່າວມານັ້ນ), ທຸກໆຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໃຊ້ແພັດທີ່ໂຄລນນັ້ນຈະເຫັນການປ່ຽນແປງນຳກັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Consider two Content Lifecycle Management projects [literal]``prj1`` and "
"[literal]``prj2``"
msgstr "ພິຈາລະນາສອງໂຄງການ Content Lifecycle Management [literal]``prj1`` ແລະ [literal]``prj2``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Both of these projects have 2 environments [literal]``dev`` and "
"[literal]``test``"
msgstr "ທັງສອງໂຄງການນີ້ມີ 2 ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຄື [literal]``dev`` ແລະ [literal]``test``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:24
msgid "Both of these projects have a vendor channel set as a source channel"
msgstr "ທັງສອງໂຄງການນີ້ມີຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຕົ້ນທາງ (source channel)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:25
msgid ""
"All channels in this scenario (four cloned channels in total) are aligned to "
"the latest state of the vendor channels"
msgstr "ທຸກໆຊ່ອງທາງໃນສະຖານະການນີ້ (ລວມທັງໝົດສີ່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໂຄລນມາ) ແມ່ນຖືກປັບໃຫ້ກົງກັບສະຖານະຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Vendor retracts a patch in the source channel and the nighly job "
"synchronizes it to your {productname}"
msgstr "ຜູ້ຜະລິດຖອນຄືນແພັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງຕົ້ນທາງ ແລະ nightly job ທຳການຊິງໂຄຣໄນມັນມາຍັງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:27
msgid ""
"None of the four channels see this change because they are using a patch "
"clone, not the patch directly."
msgstr "ທັງສີ່ຊ່ອງທາງຈະບໍ່ເຫັນການປ່ຽນແປງນີ້ ເພາະວ່າພວກເຂົາໃຊ້ແພັດທີ່ໂຄລນມາ, ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ແພັດໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:28
msgid ""
"As soon as you synchronize your patch (either you build any of these two "
"projects, or you use the Patch Sync function on any of the four cloned "
"channels), due to the patch sharing, *ALL* of the cloned channels will see "
"the patch as retracted."
msgstr "ທັນທີທີ່ທ່ານຊິງໂຄຣໄນແພັດຂອງທ່ານ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນການບິວດ໌ໂຄງການໃດໜຶ່ງໃນສອງອັນນີ້, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ Patch Sync ກັບຊ່ອງທາງໃດໜຶ່ງໃນສີ່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໂຄລນ), ຍ້ອນການແບ່ງປັນແພັດຮ່ວມກັນ, *ທັງໝົດ* ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໂຄລນຈະເຫັນແພັດນັ້ນຖືກຖອນຄືນ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using PTFs in {productname}"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ PTF ໃນ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"SUSE provides temporary fixes for all currently supported solutions shipped "
"directly to its customers.  These PTFs (Program Temporary Fixes) are now "
"available as repositories, which can be synced in {productname}."
msgstr "SUSE ສະໜອງການແກ້ໄຂຊົ່ວຄາວສຳລັບທຸກໆໂຊລູຊັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບໃນປັດຈຸບັນ ໂດຍສົ່ງກົງໃຫ້ກັບລູກຄ້າ. PTF (Program Temporary Fixes) ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕອນນີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງຄັງເກັບ (repositories), ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຊິງໂຄຣໄນໄດ້ໃນ {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Understanding PTF packages"
msgstr "ທຳຄວາມເຂົ້າໃຈກ່ຽວກັບແພັກເກັດ PTF"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"PTF packages are installed via a proxy package and are named `ptf-xxxxxx`, "
"where xxxxxx is a number and part of the name of the package, not its "
"version."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ PTF ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານແພັກເກັດພຣັອກຊີ (proxy package) ແລະ ມີຊື່ວ່າ `ptf-xxxxxx`, ໂດຍທີ່ xxxxxx ແມ່ນຕົວເລກ ແລະ ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຊື່ແພັກເກັດ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນເວີຊັນຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:5
msgid ""
"They will depend on the correct version of the package that is known to "
"include the correction in the software.  This type of package:"
msgstr "ພວກມັນຈະຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບເວີຊັນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງແພັກເກັດທີ່ຮູ້ກັນວ່າໄດ້ລວມເອົາການແກ້ໄຂໃນຊອບແວແລ້ວ. ແພັກເກັດປະເພດນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"cannot be installed accidentally (i.e. zypper update will never suggest "
"installing them),"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍບັງເອີນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: zypper update ຈະບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນ),"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:7
msgid ""
"cannot be removed accidentally (i.e. a newer package version will not "
"replace the PTF one, unless the user makes it explicitly on the zypper "
"command line),"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກລຶບອອກໄດ້ໂດຍບັງເອີນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ແພັກເກັດເວີຊັນໃໝ່ກວ່າຈະບໍ່ມາແທນທີ່ PTF, ຍົກເວັ້ນຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະລະບຸຢ່າງຊັດເຈນໃນຄຳສັ່ງ zypper),"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"is only updated when the newer version is known to address the specific "
"issue previously solved by the PTF,"
msgstr "ຈະຖືກອັບເດດກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເວີຊັນໃໝ່ກວ່າເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ກັນວ່າໄດ້ແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາສະເພາະທີ່ເຄີຍແກ້ໄຂໂດຍ PTF ແລ້ວ,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:9
msgid ""
"updates only packages already installed on the system (i.e. if a software is "
"split into multiple packages, the PTF will replace only those currently "
"installed on the system)."
msgstr "ອັບເດດສະເພາະແພັກເກັດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າຊອບແວຖືກແຍກອອກເປັນຫຼາຍແພັກເກັດ, PTF ຈະປ່ຽນແທນສະເພາະແພັກເກັດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບປັດຈຸບັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The correct ID of the package will be provided by SUSE Support during the "
"course of the support case investigation, along with instruction on how to "
"deploy/restart the affected services."
msgstr "ID ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງແພັກເກັດຈະຖືກສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ SUSE Support ໃນລະຫວ່າງການກວດສອບກໍລະນີການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ, ພ້ອມກັບຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການນຳໃຊ້/ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການບໍລິການທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing PTF packages"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ PTF"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:12
msgid ""
"PTF packages are currently only supported for SLE 12 and SLE 15 based "
"systems.  Other versions or operating systems do not have this feature and "
"the pages are not visible for them."
msgstr "ປັດຈຸບັນແພັກເກັດ PTF ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະລະບົບທີ່ໃຊ້ SLE 12 ແລະ SLE 15 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເວີຊັນອື່ນໆ ຫຼື ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການອື່ນໆ ຈະບໍ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ ແລະ ໜ້າເວັບຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາເຫັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Access to PTF channels via {productname} needs to be requested from L3 "
"support."
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງ PTF ຜ່ານ {productname} ຈະຕ້ອງຮ້ອງຂໍຈາກ L3 support."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Enabling and synchronizing PTF repositories using the command "
"line"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັງເກັບ PTF ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ (command line)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:15
msgid "On the console enter [command]``mgr-sync refresh``."
msgstr "ໃນຄອນໂຊລ ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-sync refresh``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Enter [command]``mgr-sync list channel`` and look for channels starting with "
"your {scc} account name and `ptfs` in its name.  For example, "
"`a123456-sles-15.3-ptfs-x86_64`."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-sync list channel`` ແລະ ຊອກຫາຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຊື່ບັນຊີ {scc} ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ມີຄຳວ່າ `ptfs` ຢູ່ໃນຊື່. ຕົວຢ່າງ: `a123456-sles-15.3-ptfs-x86_64`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:17
msgid "Enable the PTF channel with [command]``mgr-sync add channel <label>``."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງ PTF ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-sync add channel <label>``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:18
msgid ""
"This channel is now available and can be added to every system which is "
"using the same base channel."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ ແລະ ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນທຸກໆລະບົບທີ່ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ (base channel) ດຽວກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:19
msgid ""
"PTF packages need to be installed explicitly, since they are not "
"automatically picked up when updating a system.  The SUSE Customer Support "
"will provide the PTF number to fix a specific problem.  With the number the "
"proxy package can be identified in the PTF list.  In {productname} {webui} "
"every system with PTFs available for installation has a page which lists "
"them."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ PTF ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ, ເພາະວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກເລືອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອທຳການອັບເດດລະບົບ. SUSE Customer Support ຈະສະໜອງໝາຍເລກ PTF ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ. ດ້ວຍໝາຍເລກນີ້, ແພັກເກັດພຣັອກຊີຈະສາມາດຖືກລະບຸໄດ້ໃນລາຍຊື່ PTF. ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ທຸກໆລະບົບທີ່ມີ PTF ພ້ອມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ ຈະມີໜ້າທີ່ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຂອງພວກມັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Enabling and synchronizing PTF repositories via the {productname} "
"{webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັງເກັບ PTF ຜ່ານ {productname} {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:21
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > "
"Products] and look for the product you want to enable the PTF repository "
"for."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products] ແລະ ຊອກຫາຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້ຄັງເກັບ PTF."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:22
msgid "Click btn:[Show product's channels] next to the products sync status."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Show product's channels] ຖັດຈາກສະຖານະການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:23
msgid ""
"You should see a popup listing mandatory and optional channels for the "
"product."
msgstr "ທ່ານຄວນຈະເຫັນປ໊ອບອັບທີ່ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ບັງຄັບ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງທາງເລືອກສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the optional channels list look for channels starting with your {scc} "
"account name and `ptfs` in its name.  For example "
"`a123456-sles-15.3-ptfs-x86_64`."
msgstr "ໃນລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງທາງເລືອກ ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຊື່ບັນຊີ {scc} ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ມີຄຳວ່າ `ptfs` ຢູ່ໃນຊື່. ຕົວຢ່າງ: `a123456-sles-15.3-ptfs-x86_64`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Select the channel using the checkbox next to its name and click "
"btn:[Confirm] to schedule the sync."
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກຖັດຈາກຊື່ຂອງມັນ ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Confirm] ເພື່ອກຳນົດເວລາການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Note that the product has to be installed to be able to add optional "
"channels to it."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: ຜະລິດຕະພັນຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງກ່ອນ ຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງທາງເລືອກເຂົ້າໄປໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing the PTF packages"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ PTF"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List] and "
"select the client where you want to install a PTF."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Systems[Systems List] ແລະ ເລືອກໄຄເອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ PTF."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Systems[Software > Packages > Software Channels] and "
"select the [systemitem]``PTF channel``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Systems[Software > Packages > Software Channels] ແລະ ເລືອກ [systemitem]``PTF channel``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Next], and [guimenu]``Confirm Software Channel Change`` with "
"btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Next], ແລະ [guimenu]``Confirm Software Channel Change`` ດ້ວຍ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:31
msgid ""
"To check if the channel assignment is finished, navigate to "
"menu:Systems[Events > History] to see the results."
msgstr "ເພື່ອທຳການກວດສອບວ່າການກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງສຳເລັດຫຼືບໍ່, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Systems[Events > History] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຜົນລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:32
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Systems[Software > PTFs > Install] sub tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບຍ່ອຍ ເມນູ:Systems[Software > PTFs > Install]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:33
msgid "Select the PTF package you want to install."
msgstr "ເລືອກແພັກເກັດ PTF ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Install PTF], and [guimenu]``Confirm Program Temporary Fixes "
"(PTFs) Installation`` with btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Install PTF], ແລະ [guimenu]``Confirm Program Temporary Fixes (PTFs) Installation`` ດ້ວຍ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:35
msgid "To see PTF installation results, navigate to menu:Systems[Events > History]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຜົນການຕິດຕັ້ງ PTF, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Systems[Events > History]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:36
msgid ""
"In case a PTF should be installed using the API, the normal "
"[systemitem]``system.schedulePackageInstall`` API can be used with the proxy "
"package name."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ PTF ໂດຍໃຊ້ API, ສາມາດໃຊ້ API ປົກກະຕິ [systemitem]``system.schedulePackageInstall`` ພ້ອມກັບຊື່ແພັກເກັດພຣັອກຊີໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "After PTF installation"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ PTF"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Once a PTF is confirmed to address the reported issue, the updated package "
"will be tracked for inclusion into a future maintenance update before being "
"widely distributed as an regular maintenance update in the update "
"repositories."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ PTF ໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນວ່າແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາທີ່ລາຍງານໄດ້ແລ້ວ, ແພັກເກັດທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວຈະຖືກຕິດຕາມເພື່ອລວມເຂົ້າໃນການອັບເດດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (maintenance update) ໃນອະນາຄົດ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ຢ່າງກວ້າງຂວາງເປັນການອັບເດດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາປົກກະຕິໃນຄັງເກັບການອັບເດດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:39
msgid ""
"When this regular update with the fix is released, an updated version of the "
"PTF will also be released into the account-specific PTF repository.  The "
"updated PTF will remove the strict dependencies and allow updates to be "
"installed again."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການອັບເດດປົກກະຕິທີ່ມີການແກ້ໄຂນີ້ຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາ, PTF ເວີຊັນທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວກໍຈະຖືກປ່ອຍເຂົ້າໃນຄັງເກັບ PTF ສະເພາະບັນຊີຄືກັນ. PTF ທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວຈະລຶບການຂຶ້ນຕໍ່ກັນ (dependencies) ທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດອອກ ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງການອັບເດດໄດ້ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:40
msgid ""
"The replacement of the PTF with the maintenance update which includes the "
"fix happens automatically via a standard package update or patch "
"installation."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແທນ PTF ດ້ວຍການອັບເດດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາທີ່ມີການແກ້ໄຂນັ້ນ ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຜ່ານການອັບເດດແພັກເກັດມາດຕະຖານ ຫຼື ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Removing the patched version of a package"
msgstr "ການລຶບແພັກເກັດເວີຊັນທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ (patched) ອອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:42
msgid ""
"In cases where a PTF needs to be uninstalled and the non-patched version of "
"the packages need to be installed on the system, a simple package remove "
"cannot be used.  The PTF package is not selectable in the standard package "
"list page."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງການຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ PTF ແລະ ຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດເວີຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ (non-patched) ລົງໃນລະບົບ, ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ການລຶບແພັກເກັດແບບປົກກະຕິໄດ້. ແພັກເກັດ PTF ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ໃນໜ້າລາຍຊື່ແພັກເກັດມາດຕະຖານ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Removing the PTF packages"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບແພັກເກັດ PTF ອອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:44
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List] and "
"select the client you want to remove a PTF from."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Systems[Systems List] ແລະ ເລືອກໄຄເອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລຶບ PTF ອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:45
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Systems[Software > PTFs > List/Remove] sub tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບຍ່ອຍ ເມນູ:Systems[Software > PTFs > List/Remove]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:46
msgid "Select the ptf package you want to remove."
msgstr "ເລືອກແພັກເກັດ PTF ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລຶບອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Remove PTFs], and on the [guimenu]``Confirm Program Temporary "
"Fixes (PTFs) Removal`` page click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Remove PTFs], ແລະ ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Confirm Program Temporary Fixes (PTFs) Removal`` ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:48
msgid "To see the results, navigate to menu:Systems[Events > History]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຜົນລັດ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Systems[Events > History]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:49
msgid ""
"Removing PTFs requires a special version of [literal]``libzypp`` and "
"[literal]``zypper`` to be installed on the client system.  Check "
"[command]``zypper --help`` to confirm whether [command]``removeptf`` is "
"supported.  The ``List/Remove`` tab is only visible if this condition is "
"met."
msgstr "ການລຶບ PTF ຕ້ອງການ [literal]``libzypp`` ແລະ [literal]``zypper`` ເວີຊັນພິເສດຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບໄຄເອັນ. ກວດສອບດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``zypper --help`` ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນວ່າຮອງຮັບ [command]``removeptf`` ຫຼື ບໍ່. ແທັບ ``List/Remove`` ຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອບັນລຸເງື່ອນໄຂນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In case the PTF should be removed using the API, the normal "
"[systemitem]``system.schedulePackageRemove`` API can be used with the proxy "
"package name."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງການລຶບ PTF ໂດຍໃຊ້ API, ສາມາດໃຊ້ API ປົກກະຕິ [systemitem]``system.schedulePackageRemove`` ພ້ອມກັບຊື່ແພັກເກັດພຣັອກຊີໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Removing the patched version of a package on the client"
msgstr "ການລຶບແພັກເກັດເວີຊັນທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ (patched) ອອກໃນໄຄເອັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:52
msgid ""
"In case a PTF should be removed directly on the client using the console, it "
"is required to use a special command ``zypper removeptf``.  All other ways "
"result either in an error or can lead to unwanted behavior like removing "
"important packages from the system and make the system unusable."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງການລຶບ PTF ໂດຍກົງໃນໄຄເອັນຜ່ານຄອນໂຊລ, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງພິເສດ ``zypper removeptf``. ວິທີການອື່ນໆ ທັງໝົດອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ຫຼື ນຳໄປສູ່ພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ ເຊັ່ນ: ການລຶບແພັກເກັດທີ່ສຳຄັນອອກຈາກລະບົບ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Removing Channel"
msgstr "ການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງ (Removing Channel)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This chapter describes how to manually remove {suse} provided channels from "
"{productname} and clean up end-of-life products, to reclaim space or for "
"other purposes."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ {suse} ສະໜອງໃຫ້ອອກຈາກ {productname} ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ແລະ ການລຶບລ້າງຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານ (end-of-life) ເພື່ອຄືນພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງ ຫຼື ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare to Remove a Channel"
msgstr "ການກຽມຕົວເພື່ອລຶບຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Before removing a channel, you must identify the label for the channel to be "
"removed.  It can be done with {webui} or on the command line."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລຶບຊ່ອງທາງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸປ້າຍຊື່ (label) ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈະລຶບ. ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຜ່ານ {webui} ຫຼື ຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ (command line)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Be careful not to remove channels that systems are currently subscribed to, "
"or that you are planning on subscribing a system to."
msgstr "ລະມັດລະວັງຢ່າລຶບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ລະບຸບກຳລັງສະໝັກຮັບຂໍ້ມູນຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ຫຼື ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງວາງແຜນຈະໃຫ້ລະບົບສະໝັກຮັບຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If there are systems that are currently subscribed to a channel that you "
"want to delete, do not remove the channel until those systems are upgraded "
"or unsubscribed."
msgstr "ຫາກມີລະບົບທີ່ກຳລັງສະໝັກຮັບຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລຶບ, ຫ້າມລຶບຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນຈົນກວ່າລະບົບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກອັບເກຣດ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການສະໝັກຮັບຂໍ້ມູນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Identify Channel Labels"
msgstr "ລະບຸປ້າຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel Labels)"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Identifying Channel Labels Using {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລະບຸປ້າຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:9
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:17
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Channel List > All]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Software[Channel List > All]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:10
msgid ""
"This page displays the [label]``Channel Name``.  If you select the link for "
"a channel name, you will see the field for [literal]``Channel Label``."
msgstr "ໜ້ານີ້ຈະສະແດງ [label]``Channel Name``. ຖ້າທ່ານເລືອກລິ້ງສຳລັບຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ [literal]``Channel Label``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:11
msgid "Identify the channel, and child channels, to be removed."
msgstr "ລະບຸຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child channels) ທີ່ຈະລຶບ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Identifying Channel Labels Using the Command Line"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລະບຸປ້າຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ (Command Line)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:13
msgid ""
"You can get a list of channels by running the following command on the "
"{productname} container host:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເອົາລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ {productname} container host:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-remove-channel -l\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-remove-channel -l\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify Channel System Subscriptions"
msgstr "ກວດສອບການສະໝັກຮັບຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Verifying Channel System Subscriptions Using {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບການສະໝັກຮັບຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບຂອງຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:18
msgid "Locate [literal]``Systems`` column on the right."
msgstr "ຊອກຫາຄໍລຳ [literal]``Systems`` ທາງດ້ານຂວາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Check the [literal]``Systems`` column for the channel, or any child "
"channels, that you want to remove."
msgstr "ກວດສອບຄໍລຳ [literal]``Systems`` ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງ ຫຼື ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລຶບ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Verifying Channel System Subscriptions Using the Command Line"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບການສະໝັກຮັບຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບຂອງຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:21
msgid "Run the following command on the {productname} container host:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ {productname} container host:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'spacecmd -- softwarechannel_listsystems <Channel "
"Label>'\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- 'spacecmd -- softwarechannel_listsystems <Channel Label>'\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove Channel"
msgstr "ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:24
msgid ""
"A channel, with its metadata, can be removed with command line tools only.  "
"The [command]``spacewalk-remove-channel`` command automatically removes the "
"software packages, if they are not referenced anymore by other channels.  "
"Thus it removes the metadata from the database and the files from the "
"storage medium."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາດາຕາ (metadata) ຂອງມັນ ສາມາດລຶບອອກໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືຄຳສັ່ງ (command line) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-remove-channel`` ຈະລຶບແພັກເກັດຊອບແວໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫາກພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກອ້າງອີງໂດຍຊ່ອງທາງອື່ນອີກແລ້ວ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈະລຶບເມຕາດາຕາອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ລຶບໄຟລ໌ອອກຈາກສື່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove a Child Channel"
msgstr "ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Removing a Child Channel Using the Command Line"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:27
msgid ""
"To remove an individual channel run the following command on the "
"{productname} container host:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອລຶບຊ່ອງທາງດຽວ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ {productname} container host:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-remove-channel -c channel-label\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-remove-channel -c channel-label\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:29
msgid ""
"To remove multiple channels at the same time, use [literal]``-c`` flag for "
"each channel, followed by the [literal]``channel-label``.  For example:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອລຶບຫຼາຍຊ່ອງທາງພ້ອມກັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແຟລັກ [literal]``-c`` ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງ ຕາມດ້ວຍ [literal]``channel-label``. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-remove-channel -c channel-label1 -c "
"channel-label2\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-remove-channel -c channel-label1 -c channel-label2\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove a Parent and All Its Child Channels"
msgstr "ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທັງໝົດຂອງມັນ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Removing a Parent and All Its Child Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທັງໝົດຂອງມັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:33
msgid ""
"To remove a parent channel with all of the child channels run "
"[command]``spacewalk-remove-channel`` with the [option]``-a`` option and "
"replace [literal]``parent-channel-label`` with a channel label such as "
"[literal]``sles12-sp5-pool-x86_64``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກພ້ອມກັບຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທັງໝົດ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-remove-channel`` ພ້ອມກັບຕົວເລືອກ [option]``-a`` ແລະ ແທນທີ່ [literal]``parent-channel-label`` ດ້ວຍປ້າຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງ ເຊັ່ນ [literal]``sles12-sp5-pool-x86_64``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-remove-channel -a parent-channel-label\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-remove-channel -a parent-channel-label\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repository Metadata"
msgstr "ເມຕາດາຕາຂອງຄັງເກັບ (Repository Metadata)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:2
msgid "You require a custom GPG key to be able to sign repository metadata."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຄີ GPG ແບບກຳນົດເອງ ເພື່ອຈະສາມາດເຊັນກຳກັບເມຕາດາຕາຂອງຄັງເກັບໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generating a custom GPG key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຄີ GPG ແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:5
msgid "As the root user, use the [command]``gpg`` command to generate a new key:"
msgstr "ໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``gpg`` ເພື່ອສ້າງຄີໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -it -- gpg --full-generate-key\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -it -- gpg --full-generate-key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:7
msgid ""
"At the prompts, select [systemitem]``RSA`` as the key type, with a size of "
"2048 bits, and select an appropriate expiry date for your key."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [systemitem]``RSA`` ເປັນປະເພດຄີ, ດ້ວຍຂະໜາດ 2048 bits, ແລະ ເລືອກວັນໝົດອາຍຸທີ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບຄີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:8
msgid "Check the details for your new key, and type [systemitem]``y`` to confirm."
msgstr "ກວດສອບລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຄີໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ພິມ [systemitem]``y`` ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:9
msgid ""
"At the prompts, enter a name and email address to be associated with your "
"key."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລທີ່ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຄີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can also add a comment to help you identify the key, if desired.  When "
"you are happy with the user identity, type [systemitem]``O`` to confirm."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເພີ່ມຄຳເຫັນ (comment) ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍລະບຸຄີໄດ້ ຫາກຕ້ອງການ. ເມື່ອທ່ານພໍໃຈກັບຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຕົນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``O`` ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:11
msgid "At the prompt, enter a passphrase to protect your key."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານ (passphrase) ເພື່ອປົກປ້ອງຄີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:12
msgid "The key should be automatically added to your keyring."
msgstr "ຄີຄວນຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ keyring ຂອງທ່ານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:13
msgid "You can check by listing the keys in your keyring:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ໂດຍການສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຄີໃນ keyring ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- gpg --list-keys\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- gpg --list-keys\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Add the password for your keyring to the [filename]``/etc/rhn/signing.conf`` "
"configuration file, by opening the file in your text editor and adding this "
"line:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບ keyring ຂອງທ່ານເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ [filename]``/etc/rhn/signing.conf`` ໂດຍການເປີດໄຟລ໌ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມ (text editor) ແລະ ເພີ່ມແຖວນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPGPASS=\"password\"\n"
msgstr "GPGPASS=\"password\"\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For renewing a GPG key, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕໍ່ອາຍຸຄີ GPG, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:18
msgid ""
"You can manage metadata signing on the command line using the "
"[command]``mgr-sign-metadata-ctl`` command."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດການການເຊັນກຳກັບເມຕາດາຕາໃນຄຳສັ່ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-sign-metadata-ctl``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling metadata signing"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ການເຊັນກຳກັບເມຕາດາຕາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:20
msgid "You need to know the short identifier for the key to use."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຮູ້ລະຫັດລະບຸແບບສັ້ນ (short identifier) ສຳລັບຄີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:21
msgid "You can list your available public keys in short format:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຄີສາທາລະນະ (public keys) ທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງທ່ານໃນຮູບແບບສັ້ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- gpg --keyid-format short --list-keys\n"
"...\n"
"pub   rsa4096/3E7BFE0A 2019-04-02 [SC] [expires: 2029-04-01]\n"
"      A43F9EC645ED838ED3014B035CFA51BF3E7BFE0A\n"
"uid         [ultimate] SUSE Manager\n"
"sub   rsa4096/118DE7FF 2019-04-02 [E] [expires: 2029-04-01]\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -- gpg --keyid-format short --list-keys\n"
"...\n"
"pub   rsa4096/3E7BFE0A 2019-04-02 [SC] [expires: 2029-04-01]\n"
"      A43F9EC645ED838ED3014B035CFA51BF3E7BFE0A\n"
"uid         [ultimate] SUSE Manager\n"
"sub   rsa4096/118DE7FF 2019-04-02 [E] [expires: 2029-04-01]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:23
msgid "Enable metadata signing with the [command]``mgr-sign-metadata-ctl`` command:"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການເຊັນກຳກັບເມຕາດາຕາດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-sign-metadata-ctl``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- mgr-sign-metadata-ctl enable 3E7BFE0A\n"
"OK. Found key 3E7BFE0A in keyring.\n"
"DONE. Set key 3E7BFE0A in /etc/rhn/signing.conf.\n"
"DONE. Enabled metadata signing in /etc/rhn/rhn.conf.\n"
"DONE. Exported key 3E7BFE0A to /srv/susemanager/salt/gpg/mgr-keyring.gpg.\n"
"DONE. Exported key 3E7BFE0A to /var/spacewalk/gpg/<KEY_NAME>.key.\n"
"NOTE. For the changes to become effective run:\n"
"   mgr-sign-metadata-ctl regen-metadata\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -- mgr-sign-metadata-ctl enable 3E7BFE0A\n"
"OK. Found key 3E7BFE0A in keyring.\n"
"DONE. Set key 3E7BFE0A in /etc/rhn/signing.conf.\n"
"DONE. Enabled metadata signing in /etc/rhn/rhn.conf.\n"
"DONE. Exported key 3E7BFE0A to /srv/susemanager/salt/gpg/mgr-keyring.gpg.\n"
"DONE. Exported key 3E7BFE0A to /var/spacewalk/gpg/<KEY_NAME>.key.\n"
"NOTE. For the changes to become effective run:\n"
"   mgr-sign-metadata-ctl regen-metadata\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:25
msgid "You can check that your configuration is correct with this command:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງທ່ານຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- mgr-sign-metadata-ctl check-config\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- mgr-sign-metadata-ctl check-config\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:27
msgid "Restart the container for the configuration changes to be detected."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄອນເທນເນີໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກວດພົບການປ່ຽນແປງການກຳນົດຄ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Schedule metadata regeneration to replace all metadata with new signed "
"versions."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາການສ້າງເມຕາດາຕາໃໝ່ (metadata regeneration) ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແທນເມຕາດາຕາທັງໝົດດ້ວຍເວີຊັນໃໝ່ທີ່ໄດ້ເຊັນກຳກັບແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- mgr-sign-metadata-ctl regen-metadata\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- mgr-sign-metadata-ctl regen-metadata\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:31
msgid ""
"You can also use the [command]``mgr-sign-metadata-ctl`` command to perform "
"other tasks.  Use [command]``mgr-sign-metadata-ctl --help`` to see the "
"complete list."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-sign-metadata-ctl`` ເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກອື່ນໆ ໄດ້. ໃຊ້ [command]``mgr-sign-metadata-ctl --help`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການທັງໝົດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Repository metadata signing is a global option.  When it is enabled, it is "
"enabled on all software channels on the server.  This means that all clients "
"connected to the server need to trust the new GPG key to be able to install "
"or update packages."
msgstr "ການເຊັນກຳກັບເມຕາດາຕາຂອງຄັງເກັບແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກແບບທົ່ວໄປ (global option). ເມື່ອມັນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້, ມັນຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນທຸກໆຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວໃນເຊີບເວີ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທຸກໆໄຄເອັນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີບເວີຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຊື່ອຖືຄີ GPG ໃໝ່ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດແພັກເກັດໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Importing GPG keys on clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳເຂົ້າຄີ GPG ໃນໄຄເອັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:34
msgid "Deploying GPG keys to the clients works with salt states."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງຄີ GPG ໄປຍັງໄຄເອັນແມ່ນເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ salt states."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:35
msgid "Apply the highstate with the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ highstate ດ້ວຍ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:36
msgid ""
"For more information about troubleshooting GPG keys, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຄີ GPG, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate Reports"
msgstr "ສ້າງລາຍງານ (Generate Reports)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} allows the user to produce a variety of reports.  These "
"reports can be helpful for taking inventory of your subscribed systems, "
"users, and organizations.  Using reports is often simpler than gathering "
"information manually from the {productname} {webui}, especially if you have "
"many systems under management."
msgstr "{productname} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດສ້າງລາຍງານທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ. ລາຍງານເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການເຮັດບັນຊີລາຍຊື່ລະບົບທີ່ສະໝັກຮັບຂໍ້ມູນ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ. ການໃຊ້ລາຍງານມັກຈະງ່າຍກວ່າການລວບລວມຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຈາກ {productname} {webui}, ໂດຍສະເພາະຖ້າທ່ານມີຫຼາຍລະບົບທີ່ຕ້ອງຈັດການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:3
msgid ""
"While the command line tool [command]``spacewalk-report`` can be used to "
"generate pre-configured reports, with the introduction of the "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc[Hub Reporting] "
"it is also possible to generate fully customized reports.  This can be "
"achieved by connecting any reporting tool that supports the SQL language to "
"the reporting database and extract the data directly.  For more information "
"about the data availability and structure, see the reporting database schema "
"documentation."
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຄື່ອງມືຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-report`` ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງລາຍງານທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າໄດ້, ແຕ່ດ້ວຍການນຳສະເໜີ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc[Hub Reporting] ທ່ານກໍຍັງສາມາດສ້າງລາຍງານທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ຢ່າງເຕັມຮູບແບບ. ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄື່ອງມືສ້າງລາຍງານໃດໆ ທີ່ຮອງຮັບພາສາ SQL ກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານ (reporting database) ແລະ ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນອອກມາໂດຍກົງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມພ້ອມຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ເອກະສານ schema ຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using ``spacewalk-report``"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ ``spacewalk-report``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:6
msgid ""
"To generate reports, you must have the [package]``spacewalk-reports`` "
"package installed.  The [command]``spacewalk-report`` command allows you to "
"organize and display reports about content, systems, and user resources "
"across {productname}."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງລາຍງານ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ [package]``spacewalk-reports``. ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-report`` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດລະບຽບ ແລະ ສະແດງລາຍງານກ່ຽວກັບເນື້ອຫາ, ລະບົບ ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວທັງ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Due to the introduction of "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc[Hub Reporting], "
"[command]``spacewalk-report`` now gathers by default the data from the "
"reporting database. See <<spacewalk-report-reporting-db>> for more "
"information."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກການນຳສະເໜີ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc[Hub Reporting], ຕອນນີ້ [command]``spacewalk-report`` ຈະລວບລວມຂໍ້ມູນຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ <<spacewalk-report-reporting-db>> ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:8
msgid "You can generate reports on:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງລາຍງານກ່ຽວກັບ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Inventory"
msgstr "ບັນຊີລາຍຊື່ລະບົບ (System Inventory)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:10
msgid "List all the systems registered to {productname}."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ລະບົບທັງໝົດທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patches"
msgstr "ແພັດ (Patches)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:12
msgid ""
"  List all the patches relevant to the registered systems.  You can sort "
"patches by severity, as well as the systems that apply to a particular "
"patch."
msgstr "  ລາຍຊື່ແພັດທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບລະບົບທີ່ລົງທະບຽນ. ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດລຽງແພັດຕາມລະດັບຄວາມຮຸນແຮງ, ລວມທັງລະບົບທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ແພັດໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍສະເພາະ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:13
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (Users)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:14
msgid ""
"  List all registered users and any systems associated with a particular "
"user."
msgstr "  ລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນທັງໝົດ ແລະ ລະບົບຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To get the report in CSV format, run this command at the command prompt on "
"the server:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ລາຍງານໃນຮູບແບບ CSV, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ໃນ terminal ຂອງເຊີບເວີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-report <report_name>\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-report <report_name>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "``spacewalk-report`` and the reporting database"
msgstr "``spacewalk-report`` ແລະ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:18
msgid ""
"[command]``spacewalk-report`` uses by default the new reporting database to "
"extract the data.  This means that the new generated reports will have some "
"differences in the structure and the format of the data.  The differences "
"common to all reports are:"
msgstr "[command]``spacewalk-report`` ໃຊ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານໃໝ່ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າລາຍງານໃໝ່ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງບາງຢ່າງໃນໂຄງສ້າງ ແລະ ຮູບແບບຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ. ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງທີ່ພົບໃນທຸກໆລາຍງານແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:19
msgid ""
"the report data is not changing in real-time, but it's updated only by the "
"execution of a scheduled task;"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງແບບທັນທີ (real-time), ແຕ່ຈະຖືກອັບເດດໂດຍການເຮັດວຽກຂອງໜ້າວຽກທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ເທົັ້ນນັ້ນ;"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:20
msgid ""
"data duplication has been removed and columns that were previously "
"considered \"multival\" contain now multiple values separated by ``;``. This "
"also means that the command line options ``--multival-on-rows`` and "
"``--multival-separator`` are no longer applicable to the new reports, as "
"their behavior is now the default;"
msgstr "ການຊ້ຳກັນຂອງຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ຖືກລຶບອອກ ແລະ ຄໍລຳທີ່ເຄີຍເປັນ \"multival\" ຕອນນີ້ຈະມີຫຼາຍຄ່າທີ່ແຍກກັນດ້ວຍ ``;``. ນີ້ຍັງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຕົວເລືອກຄຳສັ່ງ ``--multival-on-rows`` ແລະ ``--multival-separator`` ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບລາຍງານໃໝ່ໄດ້ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ເພາະພຶດຕິກຳດັ່ງກ່າວໄດ້ກາຍເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ;"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:21
msgid ""
"in all reports the new columns ``mgm_id`` and ``synced_date`` have been "
"introduced to identify the management server in the hub scenario and the "
"last time the information was updated from the application database;"
msgstr "ໃນທຸກໆລາຍງານຈະມີຄໍລຳໃໝ່ ``mgm_id`` ແລະ ``synced_date`` ເພື່ອລະບຸເຊີບເວີຈັດການໃນສະຖານະການ hub ແລະ ເວລາຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນຖືກອັບເດດຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ;"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:22
msgid ""
"all boolean values are now represented by the ``True``/``False`` and not by "
"a ``1``/``0`` values;"
msgstr "ຄ່າບູລີນ (boolean) ທັງໝົດຕອນນີ້ຈະສະແດງດ້ວຍ ``True``/``False`` ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄ່າ ``1``/``0``;"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:23
msgid ""
"the column ``org_id`` has been replaced by ``organization``, which contains "
"the organization name and not the numerical identifier;"
msgstr "ຄໍລຳ ``org_id`` ຖືກປ່ຽນແທນດ້ວຍ ``organization``, ເຊິ່ງຈະມີຊື່ອົງກອນ ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕົວເລກລະຫັດລະບຸ;"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:24
msgid ""
"The term \"server\" has been replaced by \"system.\" So, for example, the "
"column ``server_id`` is now called ``system_id``."
msgstr "ຄຳວ່າ \"server\" ຖືກປ່ຽນແທນດ້ວຍ \"system\". ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄໍລຳ ``server_id`` ຕອນນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ ``system_id``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:25
msgid "For report specific changes, see <<report-list>>."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການປ່ຽນແປງສະເພາະຂອງລາຍງານ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ <<report-list>>."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:26
msgid ""
"If this changed behavior causes trouble, the new option ``--legacy-report`` "
"can be used to fall back to the old report, which is executed against the "
"application database."
msgstr "ຫາກພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກໃໝ່ ``--legacy-report`` ເພື່ອຢ້ອນກັບໄປໃຊ້ລາຍງານແບບເກົ່າ ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດວຽກກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For more information about hub reporting, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ hub reporting, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "List of available reports"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ລາຍງານທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:29
