#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Subscription Matching"
msgstr "ການຈັບຄູ່ການສະໝັກໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Your {suse} products require subscriptions, which are managed by the "
"{scclongform} ({scc}).  {productname} runs a nightly report checking the "
"subscription status of all your registered clients against your {scc} "
"account.  The report gives you information about which clients consume which "
"subscriptions, how many subscriptions you have remaining and available to "
"use, and which clients do not have a current subscription."
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscriptions), ເຊິ່ງຄຸ້ມຄອງໂດຍ {scclongform} ({scc}). {productname} ຈະຣັນລາຍງານທຸກໆຄືນເພື່ອທຽບສະຖານະ ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ຂອງໄຄເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນທັງໝົດກັບບັນຊີ {scc} ຂອງທ່ານ. ລາຍງານຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນວ່າ ໄຄເອັນໃດໃຊ້ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ອັນໃດ, ທ່ານເຫຼືອຈຳນວນການສະໝັກໃຊ້ເທົ່າໃດທີ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ, ແລະ ໄຄເອັນໃດທີ່ບໍ່ມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:3
msgid "Navigate to menu:Audit[Subscription Matching] to see the report."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Audit[Subscription Matching] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Subscriptions Report`` tab gives information about current "
"and expiring subscriptions."
msgstr "ແທັບ [guimenu]``Subscriptions Report`` ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ ທີ່ກຳລັງຈະໝົດອາຍຸ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Unmatched Products Report`` tab gives a list of clients that "
"do not have a current subscription.  This includes clients that could not be "
"matched, or that are not currently registered with {productname}.  The "
"report includes product names and the number of systems that remain "
"unmatched."
msgstr "ແທັບ [guimenu]``Unmatched Products Report`` ຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ໄຄເອັນທີ່ບໍ່ມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ລວມທັງໄຄເອັນທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຈັບຄູ່ໄດ້ ຫຼື ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname}. ລາຍງານປະກອບມີ ຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ຈຳນວນລະບົບທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ມີການຈັບຄູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Pins`` tab allows you to associate individual clients to the "
"relevant subscription.  This is especially useful if the subscription "
"manager is not automatically associating clients to subscriptions "
"successfully."
msgstr "ແທັບ [guimenu]``Pins`` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອມໂຍງໄຄເອັນແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໄດ້. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ subscription manager ບໍ່ສາມາດຈັບຄູ່ໄຄເອັນກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Messages`` tab shows all the messages generated by "
"subscription matcher during the matching process.  They provide information "
"to help understand the results and to improve the matching."
msgstr "ແທັບ [guimenu]``Messages`` ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ subscription matcher ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການຈັບຄູ່. ຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໃຈຜົນລັບ ແລະ ປັບປຸງການຈັບຄູ່ໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You can also download the reports in .csv format, or access them from that "
"command prompt in the [path]``/var/lib/spacewalk/subscription-matcher/`` "
"directory."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດລາຍງານໃນຮູບແບບ .csv ຫຼື ເຂົ້າເຖິງພວກມັນຜ່ານ command prompt ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/lib/spacewalk/subscription-matcher/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:9
msgid ""
"By default, the subscription matcher runs daily, at midnight.  To change "
"this, navigate to menu:Admin[Task Schedules] and click "
"``gatherer-matcher-default``.  Change the schedule as required, and click "
"btn:[Update Schedule]."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, subscription matcher ຈະຣັນທຸກມື້ໃນເວລາທ່ຽງຄືນ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Admin[Task Schedules] ແລະ ຄລິກ ``gatherer-matcher-default``. ປ່ຽນແປງກຳນົດເວລາຕາມຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Update Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Because the report can only match current clients with current "
"subscriptions, you might find that the matches change over time.  The same "
"client does not always match the same subscription.  This can be due to new "
"clients being registered or unregistered, or because of the addition or "
"expiration of subscriptions."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກລາຍງານສາມາດຈັບຄູ່ໄດ້ສະເພາະໄຄເອັນ ແລະ ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບວ່າການຈັບຄູ່ປ່ຽນແປງໄປຕາມເວລາ. ໄຄເອັນເຄື່ອງເດີມອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັບຄູ່ກັບ ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ອັນເດີມສະເໝີໄປ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເກີດຈາກການລົງທະບຽນໄຄເອັນໃໝ່, ການຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນ, ຫຼື ການເພີ່ມ ແລະ ການໝົດອາຍຸຂອງການສະໝັກໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The subscription matcher automatically attempts to reduce the number of "
"unmatched products, limited by the terms and conditions of the subscriptions "
"in your account.  However, if you have incomplete hardware information, "
"unknown virtual machine host assignments, or clients running in unknown "
"public clouds, the matcher might show that you do not have enough "
"subscriptions available.  Always ensure you have complete data about your "
"clients included in {productname}, to help ensure accuracy."
msgstr "subscription matcher ຈະພະຍາຍາມຫຼຸດຈຳນວນຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ບໍ່ມີການຈັບຄູ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ພາຍໃຕ້ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ແລະ ເງື່ອນໄຂຂອງການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໃນບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຫາກທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນຮາດແວບໍ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ, ບໍ່ຮູ້ການມອບໝາຍໂຮສຂອງເວີຊວລແມຊີນ, ຫຼື ໄຄເອັນທີ່ຣັນໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ, matcher ອາດຈະສະແດງວ່າ ທ່ານມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ. ຄວນກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈສະເໝີວ່າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນໄຄເອັນ ທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນໃນ {productname} ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຈັບຄູ່ມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The subscription matcher does not always match clients and subscriptions "
"accurately.  It is not intended to be a replacement for auditing."
msgstr "subscription matcher ອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັບຄູ່ໄຄເອັນ ແລະ ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ 100% ສະເໝີໄປ. ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ແທນການກວດສອບ (auditing) ຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pin Clients to Subscriptions"
msgstr "ການປັກໝຸດໄຄເອັນກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If the subscription matcher is not automatically matching a particular "
"client with the correct subscription, you can manually pin them.  When you "
"have created a pin, the subscription matcher favors matching a specific "
"subscription with a given system or group of systems."
msgstr "ຫາກ subscription matcher ບໍ່ສາມາດຈັບຄູ່ໄຄເອັນໃດໜຶ່ງກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ທ່ານສາມາດປັກໝຸດ (pin) ພວກເຂົາດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້. ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງໝຸດແລ້ວ, subscription matcher ຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມສຳຄັນກັບການຈັບຄູ່ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ກັບລະບົບ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມລະບົບນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:15
msgid ""
"However, the matcher does not always respect a pin.  It depends on the "
"subscription being available, and whether or not the subscription can be "
"applied to the client.  Additionally, pins are ignored if they result in a "
"match that violates the terms and conditions of the subscription, or if the "
"matcher detects a more accurate match if the pin is ignored."
msgstr "ແຕ່ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, matcher ອາດຈະບໍ່ປະຕິບັດຕາມໝຸດສະເໝີໄປ. ມັນຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າ ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ນັ້ນພ້ອມໃຊ້ຫຼືບໍ່, ແລະ ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ກັບໄຄເອັນນັ້ນໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໝຸດຈະຖືກລະເລີຍຫາກມັນສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ການຈັບຄູ່ລະເມີດຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ແລະ ເງື່ອນໄຂ, ຫຼື ຫາກ matcher ພົບການຈັບຄູ່ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງກວ່າເມື່ອບໍ່ໃຊ້ໝຸດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:16
msgid "To add a new pin, click btn:[Add a Pin], and select the client to pin."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມໝຸດໃໝ່, ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Add a Pin], ແລະ ເລືອກໄຄເອັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການປັກໝຸດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:17
msgid ""
"We do not recommend using pinning regularly, or for a large number of "
"clients.  The subscription matcher tool is generally accurate enough for "
"most installations."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການປັກໝຸດເປັນປະຈຳ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ກັບໄຄເອັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ເຄື່ອງມື subscription matcher ແມ່ນມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງພຽງພໍສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support"
msgstr "ການສະໜັບສະໜູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When you manage systems in {productname} where you are entitled for support "
"from {suse}, you can get the support data like [command]``supportconfig`` or "
"[command]``sosreport``.  You will get the data from the managed client and "
"upload it directly to SUSE Global Technical Support."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຄຸ້ມຄອງລະບົບໃນ {productname} ທີ່ທ່ານມີສິດໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນຈາກ {suse}, ທ່ານສາມາດດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການສະໜັບສະໜູນເຊັ່ນ [command]``supportconfig`` ຫຼື [command]``sosreport``. ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ມູນຈາກໄຄເອັນທີ່ຖືກຄຸ້ມຄອງ ແລະ ອັບໂຫຼດໂດຍກົງຫາ SUSE Global Technical Support."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a service request number"
msgstr "ສ້າງເລກຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍໃຊ້ບໍລິການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Before handing over the support data to Global Technical Support, you need "
"to generate a service request number first."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການສະໜັບສະໜູນໃຫ້ກັບ Global Technical Support, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງເລກຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍໃຊ້ບໍລິການ (service request number) ກ່ອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To create a service request, go to https://scc.suse.com/support/requests and "
"follow the instructions on the screen.  Write down the service request "
"number."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍໃຊ້ບໍລິການ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ https://scc.suse.com/support/requests ແລະ ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳໃນໜ້າຈໍ. ຈົດເລກຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍໃຊ້ບໍລິການໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Privacy statement**\n"
msgstr "**ຖະແຫຼງການຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວ**\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:7
msgid ""
"{suse} treats system reports as confidential data.  For details about the "
"{suse} privacy commitment, see "
"https://www.suse.com/company/policies/privacy/."
msgstr "{suse} ຖືວ່າລາຍງານລະບົບເປັນຂໍ້ມູນລັບ. ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບພັນທະຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວຂອງ {suse}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ຢູ່ https://www.suse.com/company/policies/privacy/."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collect and upload support data from {productname} to {suse}"
msgstr "ເກັບກຳ ແລະ ອັບໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນການສະໜັບສະໜູນຈາກ {productname} ຫາ {suse}"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Collecting support data and uploading with the {productname} "
"{webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນການສະໜັບສະໜູນ ແລະ ອັບໂຫຼດດ້ວຍ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List > All] "
"and select the client which support data should be added to the case."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Systems[System List > All] ແລະ ເລືອກໄຄເອັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນການສະໜັບສະໜູນເຂົ້າໃນເຄສ (case)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Then navigate to the [guimenu]``Details`` tab and select the "
"[guimenu]``Support`` sub-tab."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Details`` ແລະ ເລືອກແທັບຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``Support``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the field [literal]``Support Case Number`` enter the service request "
"number created above."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [literal]``Support Case Number`` ໃຫ້ປ້ອນເລກຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍໃຊ້ບໍລິການທີ່ສ້າງໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the field [literal]``Upload Region`` select option [literal]``EU`` or "
"[literal]``US`` depending on the server where you want to upload your data."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [literal]``Upload Region`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ [literal]``EU`` ຫຼື [literal]``US`` ຂຶ້ນກັບເຊີເວີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການອັບໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the field [literal]``Command-line Arguments`` you can enter options for "
"tool which is used to collect the data from the target system.  Which tool "
"will be used can be found in the tip below this field."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [literal]``Command-line Arguments`` ທ່ານສາມາດປ້ອນຕົວເລືອກສຳລັບເຄື່ອງມື ທີ່ໃຊ້ເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນຈາກລະບົບເປົ້າໝາຍ. ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ວ່າເຄື່ອງມືໃດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນຄຳແນະນຳລຸ່ມຊ່ອງນີ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:15
msgid "In the field [literal]``Earliest`` select the time of running this action."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [literal]``Earliest`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວລາທີ່ຈະຣັນການດຳເນີນການນີ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Click button btn:[Schedule].  The action is scheduled and will be executed "
"defined time. It will collect the data from the client and upload it "
"directly to the upload server."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Schedule]. ການດຳເນີນການຈະຖືກກຳນົດເວລາ ແລະ ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດຕາມເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ. ມັນຈະເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນຈາກໄຄເອັນ ແລະ ອັບໂຫຼດໂດຍກົງໄປຍັງເຊີເວີອັບໂຫຼດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:17
msgid "Supported Products where support data can be collected:"
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບການເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນການສະໜັບສະໜູນ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:18
msgid "{productname} Proxy"
msgstr "{productname} Proxy"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:19
msgid ""
"{productname} Server when it is registered as Peripheral Server in a Hub "
"Scenario"
msgstr "{productname} Server ເມື່ອມັນຖືກລົງທະບຽນເປັນ Peripheral Server ໃນ Hub Scenario"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:20
msgid "all {sles} and {opensuse} clients"
msgstr "ໄຄເອັນ {sles} ແລະ {opensuse} ທັງໝົດ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:21
msgid "SUSE Liberty and compatible clients"
msgstr "SUSE Liberty ແລະ ໄຄເອັນທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:22
msgid "Ubuntu clients"
msgstr "ໄຄເອັນ Ubuntu"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:23
msgid "Debian clients"
msgstr "ໄຄເອັນ Debian"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:24
msgid ""
"To upload the support data from the main {productname} Server please still "
"use [command]``mgradm support config`` from the container host."
msgstr "ເພື່ອອັບໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນການສະໜັບສະໜູນຈາກ {productname} Server ຫຼັກ, ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ [command]``mgradm support config`` ຈາກໂຮສຄອນເທນເນີ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task Schedules"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາຂອງວຽກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:2
msgid "All predefined task bunches are listed under menu:Admin[Task Schedules]."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມວຽກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າທັງໝົດຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນເມນູ menu:Admin[Task Schedules]."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "admin_task_schedules.png"
msgstr "admin_task_schedules.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Click menu:{productname} Schedules[Schedule name] to open the menu:Schedule "
"Name[Basic Schedule Details].  You can disable it or change its frequency."
msgstr "ຄລິກ menu:{productname} Schedules[ຊື່ຕາຕະລາງ] ເພື່ອເປີດ menu:Schedule Name[ລາຍລະອຽດຕາຕະລາງພື້ນຖານ]. ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການໃຊ້ງານ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຄວາມຖີ່ຂອງມັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:5
msgid "Click btn:[Edit Schedule] to update the schedule with your settings."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Edit Schedule] ເພື່ອອັບເດດຕາຕະລາງດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Disable Schedule] in the upper right-hand corner to disable a "
"schedule."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Disable Schedule] ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານຕາຕະລາງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Only disable a schedule if you are absolutely certain this is necessary as "
"they are essential for {productname} to work properly."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ປິດການໃຊ້ງານຕາຕະລາງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານແນ່ໃຈແທ້ໆວ່າມັນຈຳເປັນ, ເພາະວຽກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ມີຄວາມສຳຄັນຫຼາຍຕໍ່ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:8
msgid ""
"When a task is disabled, it is still shown in the list.  When you click "
"menu:{productname} Schedules[Schedule name] you can activate the job again "
"by clicking btn:[Activate Schedule]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອວຽກຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ, ມັນຍັງຄົງສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່. ເມື່ອທ່ານຄລິກ menu:{productname} Schedules[ຊື່ຕາຕະລາງ], ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ວຽກຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ໂດຍຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Activate Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If you click a bunch name, a list of runs of that bunch type and their "
"status is displayed."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ກຸ່ມວຽກ (bunch name), ລາຍຊື່ການຣັນຂອງວຽກປະເພດນັ້ນ ແລະ ສະຖານະຂອງມັນຈະຖືກສະແດງອອກມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Clicking the start time links takes you back to the menu:Schedule Name[Basic "
"Schedule Details]."
msgstr "ການຄລິກທີ່ລິ້ງເວລາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຈະນຳທ່ານກັບຄືນໄປຫາ menu:Schedule Name[ລາຍລະອຽດຕາຕະລາງພື້ນຖານ]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Predefined task bunches"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມວຽກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The following predefined task bunches are scheduled by default and can be "
"configured:"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມວຽກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຖືກກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:auto-errata-default[]"
msgstr "menu:auto-errata-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:14
msgid "Schedules auto errata updates as necessary."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາອັບເດດ errata (ການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:channel-repodata-default[]"
msgstr "menu:channel-repodata-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:16
msgid "(Re)generates repository metadata files."
msgstr "ສ້າງ (ໃໝ່) ໄຟລ໌ metadata ຂອງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (repository)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:cleanup-data-default[]"
msgstr "menu:cleanup-data-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Cleans up stale package change log and monitoring time series data from the "
"database."
msgstr "ລຶບລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງແພັກເກັດທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕາມແບບ time series ຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:clear-taskologs-default[]"
msgstr "menu:clear-taskologs-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Clears task engine (taskomatic) history data older than a specified number "
"of days, depending on the job type, from the database."
msgstr "ລຶບລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນປະຫວັດຂອງ task engine (taskomatic) ທີ່ເກົ່າກວ່າຈຳນວນມື້ທີ່ກຳນົດ, ເຊິ່ງຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງວຽກ, ຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:cobbler-sync-default[]"
msgstr "menu:cobbler-sync-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Synchronizes distribution and profile data from {productname} to {cobbler}.  "
"For more information about autoinstallation powered by {cobbler}, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຂໍ້ມູນການແຈກຈ່າຍ (distribution) ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ຈາກ {productname} ໄປຫາ {cobbler}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍ {cobbler}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ຢູ່ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:compare-configs-default[]"
msgstr "menu:compare-configs-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Compares configuration files as stored in configuration channels with the "
"files stored on all configuration-enabled servers.  To review comparisons, "
"click menu:Systems[] tab and select the system of interest.  Go to "
"menu:Configuration[Compare Files].  For more information, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc#sd-config-compare-files[]."
msgstr "ປຽບທຽບໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນ configuration channels ກັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນ ເຊີເວີທັງໝົດທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ເພື່ອກວດສອບການປຽບທຽບ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກແທັບ menu:Systems[] ແລະ ເລືອກລະບົບທີ່ສົນໃຈ. ໄປທີ່ menu:Configuration[Compare Files]. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ຢູ່ xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc#sd-config-compare-files[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:cve-server-channels-default[]"
msgstr "menu:cve-server-channels-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Updates internal pre-computed CVE data that is used to display results on "
"the menu:Audit[CVE Audit] page.  Search results in the menu:Audit[CVE Audit] "
"page are updated to the last run of this schedule.  For more information, "
"see xref:reference:audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc[]."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນ CVE ທີ່ຄຳນວນໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນໃນໜ້າ menu:Audit[CVE Audit]. ຜົນການຄົ້ນຫາໃນໜ້າ menu:Audit[CVE Audit] ຈະຖືກອັບເດດຕາມການຣັນຄັ້ງລ່າສຸດຂອງຕາຕະລາງນີ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ຢູ່ xref:reference:audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:daily-status-default[]"
msgstr "menu:daily-status-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Sends daily report e-mails to relevant addresses.  For more information "
"about configuring notifications for specific users, see "
"xref:reference:users/user-details.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງອີເມລລາຍງານປະຈຳວັນໄປຫາທີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ຢູ່ xref:reference:users/user-details.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:errata-advisory-map-sync-default[]"
msgstr "menu:errata-advisory-map-sync-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Updates internal {suse} patch vendor advisory database tables.  If "
"available, the original advisory provided by {suse} is shown in the section "
"Vendor Advisory of each patch detail."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຕາຕະລາງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ patch vendor advisory ພາຍໃນຂອງ {suse}. ຫາກມີຂໍ້ມູນ, ຄຳແນະນຳຕົ້ນສະບັບຈາກ {suse} ຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນພາກ Vendor Advisory ຂອງລາຍລະອຽດແຕ່ລະແພັດ (patch)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:errata-cache-default[]"
msgstr "menu:errata-cache-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Updates internal patch cache database tables, which are used to look up "
"packages that need updates for each server.  Also, this sends notification "
"emails to users that might be interested in certain patches.  For more "
"information about patches, see xref:reference:patches/patches-menu.adoc[]."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຕາຕະລາງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ patch cache ພາຍໃນ, ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກັດທີ່ ຕ້ອງອັບເດດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຍັງຈະສົ່ງອີເມລແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ ອາດຈະສົນໃຈແພັດບາງອັນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແພັດ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ຢູ່ xref:reference:patches/patches-menu.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:errata-queue-default[]"
msgstr "menu:errata-queue-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Queues automatic updates (patches) for servers that are configured to "
"receive them."
msgstr "ຈັດຄິວການອັບເດດອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ແພັດ) ສຳລັບເຊີເວີທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຮັບພວກມັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:gatherer-matcher-default[]"
msgstr "menu:gatherer-matcher-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Gather virtual host data by running Virtual Host Gatherer configured in "
"Virtual Host Managers.  After updated data are available, the Subscription "
"Matcher job is run."
msgstr "ເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນເວີຊວລໂຮສ (virtual host) ໂດຍການຣັນ Virtual Host Gatherer ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ໃນ Virtual Host Managers. ຫຼັງຈາກຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວພ້ອມໃຊ້, ວຽກ Subscription Matcher ຈະຖືກຣັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:kickstart-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:kickstart-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:38
msgid "Cleans up stale {kickstart} session data."
msgstr "ລຶບລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນເຊດຊັນ (session) ຂອງ {kickstart} ທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:kickstartfile-sync-default[]"
msgstr "menu:kickstartfile-sync-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Generates {cobbler} files corresponding to {kickstart} profiles created by "
"the configuration wizard."
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ {cobbler} ທີ່ກົງກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {kickstart} ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງໂດຍ configuration wizard."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:mgr-forward-registration-default[]"
msgstr "menu:mgr-forward-registration-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Synchronizes client registration data with {scclongform}.  By default, new, "
"changed, or deleted client data are forwarded.  To disable synchronization "
"set in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, run:"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຂໍ້ມູນການລົງທະບຽນໄຄເອັນກັບ {scclongform}. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຂໍ້ມູນໄຄເອັນ ທີ່ສ້າງໃໝ່, ປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ຖືກລຶບ ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປ. ເພື່ອປິດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ໂດຍຣັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.susemanager.forward_registration = 0\n"
msgstr "server.susemanager.forward_registration = 0\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Disabling data synchronizing with {scc} will lead to reduced visibility of "
"your managed clients between RMT, SMT, {productname} and {scc}-directly "
"registered clients."
msgstr "ການປິດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຂໍ້ມູນກັບ {scc} ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການເບິ່ງເຫັນໄຄເອັນທີ່ຖືກຄຸ້ມຄອງ ລະຫວ່າງ RMT, SMT, {productname} ແລະ ໄຄເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {scc} ໂດຍກົງຫຼຸດລົງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:45
msgid "By synchronizing data, you ensure a uniform view of all registered clients."
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຂໍ້ມູນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນພາບລວມຂອງໄຄເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນທັງໝົດໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:46
msgid ""
"https://suselinux.fra1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_0ooNnrY0rYuQScS[Help us "
"improve our services by sharing your reason for opting out]"
msgstr "https://suselinux.fra1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_0ooNnrY0rYuQScS[ຊ່ວຍພວກເຮົາປັບປຸງບໍລິການໂດຍການແບ່ງປັນເຫດຜົນທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ]"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:mgr-sync-refresh-default[]"
msgstr "menu:mgr-sync-refresh-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Synchronizes with {scclongform} (``mgr-sync-refresh``).  By default, all "
"custom channels are also synchronized as part of this task.  For more "
"information about custom channel synchronization, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[]."
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນກັບ {scclongform} (``mgr-sync-refresh``). ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, custom channels ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງວຽກນີ້ຄືກັນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ custom channel, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ຢູ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:minion-action-chain-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:minion-action-chain-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:50
msgid "Cleans up outdated action chain data."
msgstr "ລຶບລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນລຳດັບການດຳເນີນການ (action chain) ທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:minion-action-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:minion-action-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:52
msgid ""
"Deletes stale client action data from the file system.  First it tries to "
"complete any possibly unfinished actions by looking up the corresponding "
"results stored in the {salt} job cache.  An unfinished action can occur if "
"the server has missed the results of the action.  For successfully completed "
"actions it removes artifacts such as executed script files."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນການດຳເນີນການຂອງໄຄເອັນທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວອອກຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌. ທຳອິດມັນຈະພະຍາຍາມ ເຮັດໃຫ້ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ອາດຈະຍັງບໍ່ສຳເລັດນັ້ນສຳເລັດ ໂດຍການກວດສອບຜົນລັບທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນ {salt} job cache. ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ບໍ່ສຳເລັດອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນຫາກເຊີເວີພາດຜົນລັບຂອງການດຳເນີນການ. ສຳລັບການດຳເນີນການທີ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະລຶບໄຟລ໌ເສດເຫຼືອຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ ໄຟລ໌ສະຄຣິບທີ່ຣັນໄປແລ້ວ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:minion-checkin-default[]"
msgstr "menu:minion-checkin-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:54
msgid "Performs a regular check-in on clients."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດການເຊັກອິນ (check-in) ປົກກະຕິໃນໄຄເອັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:notifications-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:notifications-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:56
msgid "Cleans up expired notification messages."
msgstr "ລຶບລ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸແລ້ວ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:oval-data-sync-default[]"
msgstr "menu:oval-data-sync-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:58
msgid "Generate OVAL data required to increase the accuracy of CVE audit queries."
msgstr "ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງການກວດສອບ CVE (CVE audit queries)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:package-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:package-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:60
msgid "Deletes stale package files from the file system."
msgstr "ລຶບໄຟລ໌ແພັກເກັດທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວອອກຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:reboot-action-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:reboot-action-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Any reboot actions pending for more than six hours are marked as failed and "
"associated data is cleaned up from the database.  For more information on "
"scheduling reboot actions, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc#sd-power-management[]."
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການຣີບູດ (reboot) ໃດໆທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ເກີນຫົກຊົ່ວໂມງ ຈະຖືກໝາຍວ່າຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ ການກຳນົດເວລາຣີບູດ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ຢູ່ xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc#sd-power-management[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:session-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:session-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Cleans up stale Web interface sessions, typically data that is temporarily "
"stored when a user logs in and then closes the browser before logging out."
msgstr "ລຶບລ້າງເຊດຊັນ (session) ຂອງເວັບອິນເຕີເຟດທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ຊົ່ວຄາວເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ລັອກອິນ ແລ້ວປິດບຣາວເຊີກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລັອກເອົາ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:ssh-service-default[]"
msgstr "menu:ssh-service-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Prompts clients to check in with {productname} via SSH if they are "
"configured with a `SSH Push` contact method.  Also resume action chains "
"after a reboot."
msgstr "ແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃຫ້ໄຄເອັນເຊັກອິນກັບ {productname} ຜ່ານ SSH ຫາກພວກເຂົາຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ ດ້ວຍວິທີຕິດຕໍ່ `SSH Push`. ແລະ ຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ action chains ເຮັດວຽກຕໍ່ຫຼັງຈາກການຣີບູດ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:system-overview-update-queue-default[]"
msgstr "menu:system-overview-update-queue-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:68
msgid "Update the systems overview data."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນພາບລວມຂອງລະບົບ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:system-profile-refresh-default[]"
msgstr "menu:system-profile-refresh-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:70
msgid ""
"Runs a hardware refresh on all systems.  This happens only monthly and can "
"increase load on the {productname} Server.  The job uses "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc[Salt Rate Limiting].  "
"For tuning the batch size, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/tuning.adoc#java-salt-batch-size[]."
msgstr "ຣັນການຣີເຟຣຊ (refresh) ຮາດແວໃນທຸກລະບົບ. ວຽກນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນພຽງແຕ່ເດືອນລະຄັ້ງ ແລະ ອາດຈະເພີ່ມໂຫຼດໃຫ້ກັບ {productname} Server. ວຽກນີ້ໃຊ້ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc[Salt Rate Limiting]. ສຳລັບການປັບຂະໜາດ batch, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ຢູ່ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/tuning.adoc#java-salt-batch-size[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:token-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:token-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:72
msgid ""
"Deletes expired repository tokens that are used by {salt} clients to "
"download packages and metadata."
msgstr "ລຶບໂທເຄັນ (token) ຂອງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ ເຊິ່ງຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍໄຄເອັນ {salt} ເພື່ອດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກັດ ແລະ metadata."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:update-payg-default[]"
msgstr "menu:update-payg-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:74
msgid "Collects authentication data from configured {payg} cloud instances."
msgstr "ເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນການຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນຈາກຄລາວອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (cloud instances) ຂອງ {payg} ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:update-reporting-default[]"
msgstr "menu:update-reporting-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:76
msgid "Updates the local Reporting Database."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານ (Reporting Database) ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:update-reporting-hub-default[]"
msgstr "menu:update-reporting-hub-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:78
msgid ""
"Collects all reporting data from peripheral {productname} Server and update "
"the Hub Reporting Database."
msgstr "ເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານທັງໝົດຈາກ peripheral {productname} Server ແລະ ອັບເດດ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານສູນກາງ (Hub Reporting Database)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:update-system-overview-default[]"
msgstr "menu:update-system-overview-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:80
msgid "Regularly ensure the systems overview data are up to date."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນພາບລວມຂອງລະບົບຖືກອັບເດດໃຫ້ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:uuid-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:uuid-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:82
msgid "Cleans up outdated UUID records."
msgstr "ລຶບລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນບັນທຶກ UUID ທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Third-party Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຈາກພາກສ່ວນພາຍນອກ (Third-party Channels)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} includes the ability to synchronize the content of optional "
"third-party repositories with some of the products that can be managed by "
"it."
msgstr "{productname} ມີຄວາມສາມາດໃນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເນື້ອໃນຂອງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວພາຍນອກ ກັບບາງຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ສາມາດຄຸ້ມຄອງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Some third-party GPG keys are included by default in the {productname} "
"database, and some are not.  For third-party keys that are not included, the "
"relevant keys need to be imported when choosing to synchronize such "
"third-party repositories."
msgstr "ຄີ GPG ຂອງພາກສ່ວນພາຍນອກບາງອັນຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname} ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແຕ່ບາງອັນກໍບໍ່ໄດ້ລວມເຂົ້າ. ສຳລັບຄີທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ລວມເຂົ້າ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າຄີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ເມື່ອເລືອກທີ່ຈະຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວພາຍນອກເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To import a GPG key, use the following command syntax, executing the command "
"on the {productname} host server:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອນຳເຂົ້າຄີ GPG, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ໂດຍຣັນຄຳສັ່ງຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} host server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm gpg add <path-to-gpg-key-file-or-URL>\n"
msgstr "mgradm gpg add <path-to-gpg-key-file-or-URL>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:6
msgid "Example: Adding a GPG key from a file"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການເພີ່ມຄີ GPG ຈາກໄຟລ໌"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm gpg add repomd.xml.key\n"
msgstr "mgradm gpg add repomd.xml.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:8
msgid "Example: Adding a GPG key from a remote repository using a URL"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການເພີ່ມຄີ GPG ຈາກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທາງໄກໂດຍໃຊ້ URL"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm gpg add "
"https://<3rd-party-domain>/path/to/repository/repodata/repomd.xml.key\n"
msgstr "mgradm gpg add https://<3rd-party-domain>/path/to/repository/repodata/repomd.xml.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:10
msgid ""
"To list the keys currently held in the {productname} GPG database, run the "
"following command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຄີທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ GPG ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- gpg --homedir /var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir --list-keys\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- gpg --homedir /var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir --list-keys\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:12
msgid ""
"When installing a package on the client, you may also need to trust the GPG "
"key on the client itself.  This requires that the GPG key is also available "
"there."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດໃນໄຄເອັນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຄເອັນເຊື່ອຖືຄີ GPG ນັ້ນຄືກັນ. ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄີ GPG ຈະຕ້ອງມີຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງໄຄເອັນນັ້ນນຳ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:13
msgid "For more information, see: xref:client-configuration:gpg-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ຢູ່: xref:client-configuration:gpg-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Autoinstallation"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you use the plain {salt} (salt-minion) implementation for communication, "
"you on your own must make sure that all the needed software (software "
"packages) is properly available in configured client channels.  It is not "
"recommended to use this implementation together with {productname}."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບ {salt} ທຳມະດາ (salt-minion) ສຳລັບການສື່ສານ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງກວດສອບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງວ່າຊອບແວທີ່ຈຳເປັນ (ແພັກເກັດຊອບແວ) ທັງໝົດ ມີພ້ອມໃນຊ່ອງທາງໄຄເອັນທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້. ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບນີຮ່ວມກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:3
msgid ""
"With the default {salt} bundle (venv-salt-minion) implementation you only "
"need a client tools channel as a child channel that is compatible with your "
"client base channel.  All required packages will be part of the {salt} "
"bundle."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບ {salt} bundle (venv-salt-minion) ມາດຕະຖານ, ທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງການ ຊ່ອງທາງເຄື່ອງມືໄຄເອັນ (client tools channel) ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (base channel) ຂອງທ່ານ. ແພັກເກັດທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດຈະລວມຢູ່ໃນ {salt} bundle ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Check that the client tools software channel related to the base channel in "
"your autoinstallation profile is available to your organization and your "
"user."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວເຄື່ອງມືໄຄເອັນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດຂອງທ່ານນັ້ນ ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບອົງກອນ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Check that the tools channel is available to your {productname} as a child "
"channel."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າຊ່ອງທາງເຄື່ອງມືນັ້ນມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານໃນຖານະຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Only if using the plain {salt} (salt-minion) implementation, also check that "
"the required packages and any dependencies are available in the associated "
"channels."
msgstr "ສະເພາະກໍລະນີທີ່ໃຊ້ {salt} (salt-minion) ແບບທຳມະດາເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າ ແພັກເກັດທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ແລະ dependency ຕ່າງໆ ມີຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Bootstrap Repository for End-of-Life Products"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Bootstrap Repository ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸການສະໜັບສະໜູນ (EOL)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When supported products are synchronized, bootstrap repositories are "
"automatically created and regenerated on the {productname} Server.  When a "
"product reaches end-of-life and becomes unsupported, bootstrap repositories "
"must be created manually if you want to continue using the product."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຍັງໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ, bootstrap repositories ຈະຖືກສ້າງ ແລະ ສ້າງໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນ {productname} Server. ແຕ່ເມື່ອຜະລິດຕະພັນຮອດ ວັນໝົດອາຍຸ (end-of-life) ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, bootstrap repositories ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about bootstrap repositories, see "
"xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ bootstrap repositories, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ຢູ່ xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating Bootstrap Repositories for End-Of-Life Products"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Bootstrap Repositories ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ (EOL)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:5
msgid ""
"At the command prompt of the {productname} container host, as root, enter "
"the server container:"
msgstr "ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງໂຮສຄອນເທນເນີ {productname}, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໄປໃນຄອນເທນເນີເຊີເວີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:8
msgid ""
"List the available unsupported bootstrap repositories with the "
"[option]``--force`` option, for example:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ bootstrap repositories ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ [option]``--force``, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --list --force\n"
"1. SLE-12-SP2-x86_64\n"
"2. SLE-12-SP3-x86_64\n"
msgstr ""
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --list --force\n"
"1. SLE-12-SP2-x86_64\n"
"2. SLE-12-SP3-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Create the bootstrap repository by using the appropriate repository name as "
"the product label:"
msgstr "ສ້າງ bootstrap repository ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ repository ທີ່ເໝາະສົມເປັນ product label:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --create SLE-12-SP2-x86_64 --force\n"
msgstr "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --create SLE-12-SP2-x86_64 --force\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you do not want to create bootstrap repositories manually, you can check "
"whether LTSS is available for the product and bootstrap repository you need."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Clients Cloned Salt Clients"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໄຄເອັນ Salt ທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນ (Cloned Clients)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you have used your hypervisor clone utility, and attempted to register "
"the cloned Salt client, you might get this error:"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືໂຄລນ (clone) ຂອງໄຮເປີໄວເຊີ (hypervisor) ແລະ ພະຍາຍາມລົງທະບຽນ ໄຄເອັນ Salt ທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນມາ, ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "We're sorry, but the system could not be found.\n"
msgstr "ຂໍອະໄພ, ບໍ່ພົບລະບົບດັ່ງກ່າວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This is caused by the new, cloned, system having the same machine ID as an "
"existing, registered, system.  You can adjust this manually to correct the "
"error and register the cloned system successfully."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຈາກລະບົບໃໝ່ທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນມາມີ machine ID ຄືກັນກັບລະບົບທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນລະບົບທີ່ໂຄລນມາໄດ້ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information and instructions, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ຄຳແນະນຳ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ຢູ່ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Container with Full Disk Event"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ມີເຫດການດິດເຕັມ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In case a dedicated disk mounted as a persistent storage medium of a "
"container runs out of storage space, an emergency action is needed."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ດິດທີ່ແຍກອອກມາຕ່າງຫາກ ເຊິ່ງຖືກເມົາທ໌ (mount) ເປັນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖາວອນຂອງ ຄອນເທນເນີມີເນື້ອທີ່ໝົດ, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການດຳເນີນການສຸກເສີນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Proceed as follows to solve the problem with resizing the storage medium.  "
"Run all listed commands as [literal]``root`` on the container host."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາດ້ວຍການປັບຂະໜາດບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ. ໃຫ້ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງທັງໝົດໃນຖານະ [literal]``root`` ຢູ່ເທິງໂຮສຄອນເທນເນີ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resize Storage Medium"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບຂະໜາດບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Increase the disk size.  Actions to take depend on the installation "
"scenario."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຂະໜາດດິດ. ວິທີການເພີ່ມຈະຂຶ້ນກັບຮູບແບບການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If the disk is partitioned (for example, there is a [path]``/dev/vdb1`` for "
"disk [path]``/dev/vdb``), run the following commands:"
msgstr "ຫາກດິດມີການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນ (partition) (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ມີ [path]``/dev/vdb1`` ສຳລັບ ດິດ [path]``/dev/vdb``), ໃຫ້ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:7
msgid "Run the following commands:"
msgstr "ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:8
msgid "[command]``parted /dev/vdb``"
msgstr "[command]``parted /dev/vdb``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:9
msgid "[literal]``(parted)`` [command]``print``"
msgstr "[literal]``(parted)`` [command]``print``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:10
msgid ""
"[literal]``(parted)`` [command]``resizepart NUMBER 100%`` where "
"[literal]``NUMBER`` is the partition number shown by [command]``print`` "
"command (for example, [literal]``1`` if [literal]``/dev/vdb1``)"
msgstr "[literal]``(parted)`` [command]``resizepart NUMBER 100%`` ໂດຍທີ່ [literal]``NUMBER`` ແມ່ນໝາຍເລກພາທິຊັນ (partition) ທີ່ສະແດງໂດຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``print`` (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [literal]``1`` ຫາກແມ່ນ [literal]``/dev/vdb1``)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:11
msgid "[literal]``(parted)`` [command]``quit``"
msgstr "[literal]``(parted)`` [command]``quit``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:12
msgid "Resize the filesystem.  For example, for an XFS filesystem, run the command:"
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດລະບົບໄຟລ໌ (filesystem). ຕົວຢ່າງ: ສຳລັບລະບົບໄຟລ໌ XFS, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "xfs_growfs /dev/vdb1\n"
msgstr "xfs_growfs /dev/vdb1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:14
msgid ""
"After completing the procedure, an XFS filesystem should be using all space "
"available on the disk."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກສິ້ນສຸດຂັ້ນຕອນ, ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ XFS ຄວນຈະໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນດິດ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Corrupt Repositories"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຄັງຊອບແວເສຍຫາຍ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The information in the repository metadata files can become corrupt or out "
"of date.  This can create problems with updating clients.  You can fix this "
"by removing the files and regenerating it.  With an new repository data "
"file, updates should operate as expected."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນໃນໄຟລ໌ເມຕາດາຕ້າ (metadata) ຂອງຄັງຊອບແວອາດຈະເສຍຫາຍ ຫຼື ລ້າສະໄໝ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດສ້າງບັນຫາໃນການອັບເດດລູກຂ່າຍ (clients). ເຈົ້າສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ ໂດຍການລຶບໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນແລ້ວສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່. ເມື່ອມີໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນຄັງຊອບແວໃໝ່ແລ້ວ, ການອັບເດດຄວນຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Corrupt Repository Data"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນຄັງຊອບແວເສຍຫາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:4
msgid "Remove all files from [path]``/var/cache/rhn/repodata/<channel-label>``."
msgstr "ລຶບໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດອອກຈາກ [path]``/var/cache/rhn/repodata/<channel-label>``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:5
msgid ""
"If you do not know the channel label, you can find it in the {productname} "
"{webui}, by navigating to menu:Software[Channels > Channel Label]."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າບໍ່ຮູ້ປ້າຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງ (channel label), ເຈົ້າສາມາດຊອກຫາມັນໄດ້ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໂດຍການເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ ເມນູ:Software[Channels > Channel Label]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the container host, from the command line, execute the following command "
"to regenerate the file in the container:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງເຄື່ອງແມ່ (container host), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ໃນຄອນເທນເນີ (container) ຄືນໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- spacecmd softwarechannel_regenerateyumcache "
"<channel-label>\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacecmd softwarechannel_regenerateyumcache <channel-label>\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Custom Channel with Conflicting Packages"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງທີ່ມີແພັກເກດຂັດແຍ້ງກັນ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Cause: Conflicting packages in custom channel
#. Consequence: Creating bootstrap repo can fail
#. Fix: Separate trees from each other
#. Result: Clean and functional boostrap repo will be created
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When setting up a custom channel with conflicting packages features such as "
"creating a bootstrap repository can result in undefined behavior and make "
"registering clients fail."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງທີ່ມີແພັກເກດຂັດແຍ້ງກັນ, ຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ ການສ້າງຄັງຊອບແວບູດສະແຕຣັບ (bootstrap repository) ອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກຜິດພາດ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For example, conflicting packages with higher version numbers could be "
"included into the bootstrap repository.  Such packages (for example, "
"[package]``python3-zmq`` or [package]``zeromq``) may corrupt the creation of "
"the bootstrap repository or cause issues during bootstrap of the client."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ແພັກເກດທີ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັນທີ່ມີເວີຊັນສູງກວ່າອາດຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນຄັງຊອບແວບູດສະແຕຣັບ. ແພັກເກດດັ່ງກ່າວ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [package]``python3-zmq`` ຫຼື [package]``zeromq``) ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການສ້າງຄັງຊອບແວບູດສະແຕຣັບເສຍຫາຍ ຫຼື ເກີດບັນຫາລະຫວ່າງການບູດສະແຕຣັບລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When the custom channel (for example, an EPEL channel) is added below the "
"parent vendor channel, issues with conflicting packages cannot be solved "
"directly.  The way how to solve this is to separate the custom channel from "
"the vendor channel.  The custom channel needs to be created in a separate "
"tree.  In case that the custom channel needs to be delivered as a child, "
"such environment can be created using Content Lifecycle Management (CLM).  "
"Sources in a CLM project can be added there from different trees.  Using "
"such an approach, the custom channel stays below the parent within the built "
"environment.  However, the vendor channel tree stays without the custom "
"channel and the bootstrap repository.  Then registering clients works "
"correctly."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຊ່ອງທາງ EPEL) ຖືກເພີ່ມໄວ້ກ້ອງຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ (parent vendor channel), ບັນຫາແພັກເກດຂັດແຍ້ງຈະບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ວິທີແກ້ໄຂແມ່ນການແຍກຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງອອກຈາກຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດ. ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນໂຄງສ້າງ (tree) ທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງສົ່ງມອບຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງລູກ (child channel), ສາມາດສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມດັ່ງກ່າວໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ Content Lifecycle Management (CLM). ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໃນໂປຣເຈັກ CLM ສາມາດເພີ່ມມາຈາກໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້. ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້, ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຈະຍັງຄົງ ຢູ່ກ້ອງຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໂຄງສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດຈະບໍ່ມີຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ ຄັງຊອບແວບູດສະແຕຣັບປົນຢູ່. ຈາກນັ້ນການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກໍຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:5
msgid ""
"When the custom channel with the conflicting packages (salt, zeromq, and so "
"on) is created as a child channel, following steps can help to avoid the "
"issue:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງທີ່ມີແພັກເກດຂັດແຍ້ງ (salt, zeromq, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ຖືກສ້າງເປັນຊ່ອງທາງລູກ, ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫາໄດ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Avoiding Conflicting Packages in Custom Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຫຼີກລ່ຽງແພັກເກດຂັດແຍ້ງໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Remove the custom channel as a child channel from parent channel.  For more "
"information, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_manage_custom_channels[]."
msgstr "ເອົາຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງອອກຈາກການເປັນຊ່ອງທາງລູກຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_manage_custom_channels[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Create the custom channel in a separate tree.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_creating_custom_channels_and_repositories[]."
msgstr "ສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໃນໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_creating_custom_channels_and_repositories[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:9
msgid ""
"To get the custom channel as a child channel within Content Lifecycle "
"Management (CLM):"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງເປັນຊ່ອງທາງລູກພາຍໃນ Content Lifecycle Management (CLM):"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[], and "
"click btn:[Create Project].  Enter [guimenu]``Name`` and [guimenu]``Label``."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ ເມນູ:Content Lifecycle[], ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Project]. ປ້ອນ [guimenu]``Name`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Label``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Attach Source to the project.  Use the needed vendor channels and the custom "
"channel.  (sharing example using CentOS8)"
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ (Source) ເຂົ້າກັບໂປຣເຈັກ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ. (ຕົວຢ່າງການແບ່ງປັນໂດຍໃຊ້ CentOS8)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:12
msgid "Add environment into the Project.  For example, use CentOS8."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environment) ເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃຊ້ CentOS8."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To build the environment click the btn:[Build] button.  This creates an "
"environment with vendor and custom channels that can be associated with an "
"activation key and used to bootstrap the client."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງ (build) ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Build]. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີທັງຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດນຳໄປຜູກກັບ ລະຫັດເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (activation key) ແລະ ໃຊ້ເພື່ອບູດສະແຕຣັບລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Important note: In the CLM project, it is recommend to add a filter, which "
"excludes the problematic or conflicting packages.  Otherwise the conflicting "
"packages with higher version numbers would be installed during the update of "
"the client.  For more information about filtering, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#exclude-higher-kernel-version[]."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດສຳຄັນ: ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ CLM, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງ (filter) ເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນແພັກເກດ ທີ່ມີບັນຫາ ຫຼື ຂັດແຍ້ງກັນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ແພັກເກດທີ່ຂັດແຍ້ງທີ່ມີເວີຊັນສູງກວ່າ ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງລະຫວ່າງການອັບເດດລູກຂ່າຍ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕອງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#exclude-higher-kernel-version[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To get the latest patches into the CLM environment (with vendor and custom "
"channel), click the btn:[Build] button in the project.  This is needed to "
"re-built the environment."
msgstr "ເພື່ອດຶງເອົາແພັດ (patch) ລ້າສຸດເຂົ້າໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ CLM (ທີ່ມີຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ), ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Build] ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຄືນໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For more information about CLM, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ CLM, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Using the Extra Packages for Enterprise Linux (EPEL) directly on {rhel} "
"clients (or compatible: {sll}, {centos}, {oracle}, etc.) will install the "
"{salt} packages from EPEL, which miss some features available in the "
"{productname}-provided {salt} packages.  This is especially important "
"because it will result in a bootstrap repository containing the non-SUSE "
"{salt} packages.  Therefore, this is an unsupported scenario."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Extra Packages for Enterprise Linux (EPEL) ໂດຍກົງໃນລູກຂ່າຍ {rhel} (ຫຼື ທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້: {sll}, {centos}, {oracle}, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແພັກເກດ {salt} ຈາກ EPEL, ເຊິ່ງຈະຂາດບາງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນແພັກເກດ {salt} ທີ່ {productname} ຈັດຫາໃຫ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ສຳຄັນຫຼາຍ ເພາະມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄັງຊອບແວບູດສະແຕຣັບ ມີແພັກເກດ {salt} ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂອງ SUSE. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ກໍລະນີນີ້ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນ (unsupported)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:18
msgid ""
"If you need to enable the EPEL repository, make sure you filter out the "
"{salt} packages from EPEL in advance (for example, by removing the {salt} "
"packages in menu:Software[Manage > Channels > EPEL > Packages]."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄັງຊອບແວ EPEL, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕອງເອົາແພັກເກດ {salt} ຈາກ EPEL ອອກກ່ອນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂດຍການລຶບແພັກເກດ {salt} ອອກໃນ ເມນູ:Software[Manage > Channels > EPEL > Packages])."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-delclients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registering Deleted Clients"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກລຶບໄປແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-delclients.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Sometimes a new registration of a deleted (unregistered) client might not be "
"possible.  To solve this issue, some Salt cache files should be deleted on "
"the {productname} Server (Salt master) before trying to re-register again:"
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງ ການລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກລຶບ (ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນ) ອາດຈະເຮັດບໍ່ໄດ້. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ຄວນລຶບໄຟລ໌ແຄຊ (cache) ຂອງ Salt ບາງໄຟລ໌ໃນ {productname} Server (Salt master) ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລອງລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-delclients.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /var/cache/salt/master/thin/version\n"
"rm /var/cache/salt/master/thin/thin.tgz\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /var/cache/salt/master/thin/version\n"
"rm /var/cache/salt/master/thin/thin.tgz\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Disabling the FQDNS grain"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການປິດໃຊ້ງານ FQDNS grain"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The FQDNS grain returns the list of all the fully qualified DNS services in "
"the system.  Collecting this information is usually a fast process, but if "
"the DNS settings have been misconfigured, it could take a much longer time.  "
"In some cases, the client could become unresponsive, or crash."
msgstr "FQDNS grain ຈະສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ຂອງບໍລິການ DNS ທີ່ສົມບູນ (fully qualified) ທັງໝົດໃນລະບົບ. ການຮວບຮວມຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະໄວ, ແຕ່ຫາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DNS ຜິດພາດ, ມັນອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນກວ່າເກົ່າ. ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ລູກຂ່າຍອາດຈະບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງ ຫຼື ຄ້າງ (crash)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To prevent this problem, you can disable the FQDNS grain with a Salt flag.  "
"If you disable the grain, you can use a network module to provide FQDNS "
"services, without the risk of the client becoming unresponsive."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບັນຫານີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດປິດໃຊ້ງານ FQDNS grain ດ້ວຍ Salt flag. ຫາກເຈົ້າປິດ grain ນີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ໂມດູນເຄືອຂ່າຍ (network module) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິການ FQDNS ແທນ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍຈະບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This only applies to older Salt clients.  If you registered your Salt client "
"recently, the FQDNS grain is disabled by default."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ລຸ້ນເກົ່າເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກເຈົ້າລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເມື່ອບໍ່ດົນມານີ້, FQDNS grain ຈະຖືກປິດໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:5
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, use this command to "
"disable the FQDNS grain:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server, ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ (command prompt), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອປິດ FQDNS grain:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_disable_fqdns_grain\n"
msgstr "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_disable_fqdns_grain\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:7
msgid ""
"This command restarts each client and generate Salt events that the server "
"needs to process.  If you have a large number of clients, you can execute "
"the command in batch mode instead:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງແຕ່ລະລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ ແລະ ສ້າງເຫດການ (events) ຂອງ Salt ທີ່ເຊີບເວີຕ້ອງປະມວນຜົນ. ຫາກເຈົ້າມີລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງໃນຮູບແບບກຸ່ມ (batch mode) ແທນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls util.mgr_disable_fqdns_grain\n"
msgstr "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls util.mgr_disable_fqdns_grain\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Wait for the batch command to finish executing.  Do not interrupt the "
"process with kbd:[Ctrl+C]."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງແບບກຸ່ມເຮັດວຽກໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ. ຫ້າມຂັດຈັງຫວະຂະບວນການດ້ວຍ kbd:[Ctrl+C]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Disk Space"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາພື້ນທີ່ດິດ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Running out of disk space can have a severe impact on the {productname} "
"database and file structure which, in most cases, is not recoverable.  "
"{productname} monitors free space in specific directories, and has "
"configurable alerts.  For more on space management, see "
"xref:administration:space-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການທີ່ພື້ນທີ່ດິດເຕັມ ສາມາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຮ້າຍແຮງຕໍ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຂອງ {productname} ເຊິ່ງໃນຫຼາຍກໍລະນີແມ່ນບໍ່ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນໄດ້. {productname} ຈະກວດສອບພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ກຳນົດ ແລະ ມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການພື້ນທີ່, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:space-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Generally, container volumes share space with the host filesystem.  When the "
"[systemitem]``btrfs`` filesystem becomes full, it can prevent you from "
"deleting files.  To resolve this, you can add a small amount of storage "
"temporarily to the filesystem using the [command]``btrfs device add`` "
"command.  This will allow you to delete files to gain space for further "
"filesystem maintenance.  When done with the maintenance, you can remove the "
"temporary storage with [command]``btrfs device delete``.  For more "
"information about this topic, see "
"https://www.suse.com/support/kb/doc/?id=000018779."
msgstr "ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ວໍລຸມ (volumes) ຂອງຄອນເທນເນີຈະໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ຮ່ວມກັບລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງເຄື່ອງແມ່ (host). ເມື່ອລະບົບໄຟລ໌ [systemitem]``btrfs`` ເຕັມ, ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບໄຟລ໌ໄດ້. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຈຳນວນໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຊົ່ວຄາວເຂົ້າໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``btrfs device add``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດລຶບໄຟລ໌ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງສຳລັບການບຳລຸງຮັກສາລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຕໍ່ໄປ. ເມື່ອສຳເລັດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເອົາພື້ນທີ່ຊົ່ວຄາວນັ້ນອອກໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``btrfs device delete``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ https://www.suse.com/support/kb/doc/?id=000018779."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:4
msgid "You can recover disk space by removing unused software channels."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດກູ້ຄືນພື້ນທີ່ດິດໄດ້ ໂດຍການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ງານອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For instructions on how to delete vendor channels, see "
"xref:administration:channel-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບວິທີການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:channel-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For instructions on how to delete custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບວິທີການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You can also check how often your custom channels are synchronized.  For "
"instructions on how deal with custom channel synchronization, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຂອງເຈົ້າຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ (sync) ດຸປານໃດ. ສຳລັບວິທີການຈັດການການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You can also recover disk space by cleaning up unused activation keys, "
"content lifecycle projects, and client registrations.  You can also remove "
"redundant database entries:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດກູ້ຄືນພື້ນທີ່ດິດໄດ້ ໂດຍການລຶບລະຫັດເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (activation keys) ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້, ໂປຣເຈັກວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ (content lifecycle projects), ແລະ ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດລຶບລາຍການຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊ້ຳຊ້ອນອອກໄດ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Redundant Database Entries"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂລາຍການຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Use the [command]``spacewalk-data-fsck`` command to list any redundant "
"database entries."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-data-fsck`` ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:11
msgid "Use the [command]``spacewalk-data-fsck --remove`` command to delete them."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-data-fsck --remove`` ເພື່ອລຶບພວກມັນອອກ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disk Check Warnings for Missing Directories"
msgstr "ຄຳເຕືອນການກວດສອບດິດສຳລັບໂຟນເດີທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:13
msgid ""
"After migrating to containerized deployments from 5.0 or when using custom "
"disk check configurations, you might see warnings for directories that no "
"longer exist.  This commonly occurs when the [systemitem]``DISKCHECKDIRS`` "
"environment variable references [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` or its "
"subdirectories."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຍ້າຍມານຳໃຊ້ແບບຄອນເທນເນີ (containerized deployments) ຈາກເວີຊັນ 5.0 ຫຼື ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການກວດສອບດິດແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະເຫັນຄຳເຕືອນກ່ຽວກັບໂຟນເດີທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [systemitem]``DISKCHECKDIRS`` ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In containerized deployments, the PostgreSQL database runs in its own "
"container, and the [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` directory no longer exists in "
"the server container.  The database files are stored in a separate database "
"container volume."
msgstr "ໃນການນຳໃຊ້ແບບຄອນເທນເນີ, ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ PostgreSQL ຈະລັນຢູ່ໃນຄອນເທນເນີຂອງມັນເອງ, ແລະ ໂຟນເດີ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` ຈະບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຄອນເທນເນີຂອງເຊີບເວີອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ໄຟລ໌ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນວໍລຸມ (volume) ຂອງຄອນເທນເນີຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:15
msgid "If you see warnings like these in the logs or notifications:"
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າເຫັນຄຳເຕືອນຄືແນວນີ້ໃນ ລັອກ (logs) ຫຼື ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"DISKCHECK: Directory /var/lib/pgsql does not exist\n"
"DISKCHECK: Directory /var/lib/pgsql/data does not exist\n"
msgstr ""
"DISKCHECK: Directory /var/lib/pgsql does not exist\n"
"DISKCHECK: Directory /var/lib/pgsql/data does not exist\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:17
msgid ""
"This indicates that the disk check configuration includes directories that "
"are no longer valid in containerized deployments."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ບົ່ງບອກວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າກວດສອບດິດລວມເອົາໂຟນເດີທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ແລ້ວ ໃນການນຳໃຊ້ແບບຄອນເທນເນີ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cause"
msgstr "ສາເຫດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Prior to containerization, customers could configure custom directories to "
"monitor by setting the [systemitem]``spacecheck_dirs`` parameter in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``.  A common configuration included "
"[path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` to monitor database disk space."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະມີການໃຊ້ຄອນເທນເນີ, ລູກຄ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຟນເດີກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອຕິດຕາມ ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``spacecheck_dirs`` ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນລວມເອົາ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມພື້ນທີ່ດິດຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:20
msgid "In containerized deployments:"
msgstr "ໃນການນຳໃຊ້ແບບຄອນເທນເນີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The [systemitem]``spacecheck_dirs`` parameter in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"is still read, but is overridden by the [systemitem]``DISKCHECKDIRS`` "
"environment variable if set"
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``spacecheck_dirs`` ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ຍັງຖືກອ່ານຢູ່, ແຕ່ຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບໂດຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [systemitem]``DISKCHECKDIRS`` ຫາກມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:22
msgid ""
"If [systemitem]``DISKCHECKDIRS`` is not set, the system falls back to "
"[systemitem]``spacecheck_dirs`` from the configuration file"
msgstr "ຫາກ [systemitem]``DISKCHECKDIRS`` ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້, ລະບົບຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ [systemitem]``spacecheck_dirs`` ຈາກໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າແທນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The database runs in a separate container and has its own dedicated disk "
"check"
msgstr "ຖານຂໍ້ມູນລັນຢູ່ໃນຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ແລະ ມີການກວດສອບດິດສະເພາະຂອງມັນເອງ"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fix"
msgstr "ວິທີແກ້ໄຂ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Remove the obsolete directory references from the "
"[systemitem]``DISKCHECKDIRS`` environment variable."
msgstr "ເອົາການອ້າງອີງເຖິງໂຟນເດີທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝອອກຈາກຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [systemitem]``DISKCHECKDIRS``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Removing Obsolete Directory References"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເອົາການອ້າງອີງໂຟນເດີທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝອອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Check if you have a systemd override file with custom directory "
"configuration:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບເບິ່ງວ່າເຈົ້າມີໄຟລ໌ systemd override ທີ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຟນເດີກຳນົດເອງຫຼືບໍ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "cat /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/diskcheck.conf\n"
msgstr "cat /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/diskcheck.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:29
msgid ""
"If the file contains [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` or other non-existent "
"directories, update it to use only valid directories:"
msgstr "ຫາກໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນມີ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີອື່ນໆ ທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ອັບເດດມັນ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ສະເພາະໂຟນເດີທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ແທນ:"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Result"
msgstr "ຜົນລັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The disk check warnings for missing directories will no longer appear.  The "
"server container will only monitor the directories that exist within the "
"container."
msgstr "ຄຳເຕືອນການກວດສອບດິດສຳລັບໂຟນເດີທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ຄອນເທນເນີເຊີບເວີຈະຕິດຕາມສະເພາະໂຟນເດີທີ່ມີຢູ່ພາຍໃນຄອນເທນເນີເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:35
msgid ""
"The database container has its own separate disk check that monitors the "
"PostgreSQL data directory ([path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data``) within the "
"database container.  This check is automatically configured and does not "
"require manual intervention."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີຖານຂໍ້ມູນມີການກວດສອບດິດແຍກຕ່າງຫາກທີ່ຕິດຕາມໂຟນເດີຂໍ້ມູນ PostgreSQL ([path]``/var/lib/pgsql/data``) ພາຍໃນຄອນເທນເນີຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ການກວດສອບນີ້ ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການຈັດການດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:36
msgid ""
"For more information about disk space management in containerized "
"deployments, see xref:administration:space-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການພື້ນທີ່ດິດໃນການນຳໃຊ້ແບບຄອນເທນເນີ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:space-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Firewalls"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໄຟວໍ (Firewalls)"

#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Cause: User firewall is set to block outgoing traffic by dropping the packet request. During sync with {scc}, mlm waits for an answer on each URL until it times out, eventually causing the entire refresh of the product list to timeout. Applies only to third party (non-SUSE) products, as sync with {scc} needs to access locations other than {scc} to verify if the if the download location is valid.
#. Consequence: The sync to {scc} fails, and the third party products are not shown in the product list.
#. Fix: Configure the firewall to reject requests from mlm instead of drop (preferred), or configure a firewall on the server (if no ability to change firewall settings)
#. Result: Sync to {scc} is either able to reach the URLs required, or rejects the request so that the request fails rather than times out.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you are using a firewall that blocks outgoing traffic, it can either "
"``REJECT`` or ``DROP`` network requests.  If it is set to ``DROP`` then you "
"might find that synchronizing with the {scclongform} times out."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າກຳລັງໃຊ້ໄຟວໍທີ່ປິດກັ້ນການຈະລາຈອນຂາອອກ, ມັນສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງແບບ ``REJECT`` ຫຼື ``DROP`` ການຮ້ອງຂໍເຄືອຂ່າຍ. ຫາກມັນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ ``DROP``, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະພົບວ່າ ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນກັບ {scclongform} ໝົດເວລາ (timeout)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This occurs because the synchronization process needs to access third-party "
"repositories that provide packages for non-{suse} clients, and not just the "
"{scclongform}.  When the {productname} Server attempts to reach these "
"repositories to check that they are valid, the firewall drops the requests, "
"and the synchronization continues to wait for the response until it times "
"out."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນຍ້ອນຂະບວນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັງຊອບແວພາຍນອກ (third-party) ທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການແພັກເກດສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse}, ບໍ່ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ {scclongform} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເມື່ອ {productname} Server ພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັງຊອບແວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໄຟວໍຈະ Drop ການຮ້ອງຂໍ, ແລະ ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຈະຍັງຄົງລໍຖ້າການຕອບກັບຈົນກວ່າຈະໝົດເວລາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If this occurs, the synchronization takes a long time before it fails, and "
"your non-{suse} products are not shown in the product list."
msgstr "ຫາກເກີດບັນຫານີ້, ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ, ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse} ຂອງເຈົ້າຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃນລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:5
msgid "You can fix this problem in several different ways."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ໄດ້ຫຼາຍວິທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The simplest method is to configure your firewall to allow access to the "
"URLs required by non-{suse} repositories.  This allows the synchronization "
"process to reach the URLs and complete successfully."
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍຂອງເຈົ້າໃຫ້ອະນຸຍາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ URL ຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ຂອງຄັງຊອບແວທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse}. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂະບວນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສາມາດ ເຂົ້າເຖິງ URL ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:7
msgid ""
"If allowing external traffic is not possible, configure your firewall to "
"``REJECT`` requests from {productname} instead of ``DROP``.  This rejects "
"requests to third-party URLs, so that the synchronization fails early rather "
"than times out, and the products are not shown in the list."
msgstr "ຫາກບໍ່ສາມາດອະນຸຍາດການຈະລາຈອນພາຍນອກໄດ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍໃຫ້ ``REJECT`` ການຮ້ອງຂໍ ຈາກ {productname} ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ ``DROP``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປະຕິເສດການຮ້ອງຂໍໄປຫາ URL ພາຍນອກ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລົ້ມເຫຼວໃນທັນທີແທນທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າຈົນໝົດເວລາ, ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃນລາຍຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:8
msgid ""
"If you do not have configuration access to the firewall, you can consider "
"setting up a separate firewall on the {productname} Server instead."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍໄດ້, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະພິຈາລະນາການຕັ້ງ ໄຟວໍແຍກຕ່າງຫາກເທິງ {productname} Server ແທນ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Troubleshooting high sync times between {productname} Server and Proxy over "
"WAN connections"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຊິງໂຄຣໄນທີ່ໃຊ້ເວລາດົນລະຫວ່າງ {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy ຜ່ານການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ WAN"

#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure.
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Depending on what changes are executed in the WebUI or via an API call to "
"distribution or system settings, [command]``cobbler sync`` command may be "
"required to transfer files from {productname} Server to {productname} Proxy "
"systems.  To accomplish this, {cobbler} uses a list of proxies specified in "
"[literal]``/etc/cobbler/settings``."
msgstr "ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບວ່າການປ່ຽນແປງໃດທີ່ຖືກລັນໃນ WebUI ຫຼື ຜ່ານການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ API ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ການແຈກຢາຍ (distribution) ຫຼື ລະບົບ, ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``cobbler sync`` ອາດຈະຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເພື່ອໂອນຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ຈາກ {productname} Server ໄປຫາລະບົບ {productname} Proxy. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, {cobbler} ຈະໃຊ້ລາຍຊື່ proxy ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ [literal]``/etc/cobbler/settings``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Due to its design, [command]``cobbler sync`` is not able to sync only the "
"changed or recently added files."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Instead, executing [command]``cobbler sync`` triggers a full sync of the "
"[literal]``/srv/tftpboot`` directory to all specified proxies configured in "
"[literal]``/etc/cobbler/settings``.  It is also influenced by the latency of "
"the WAN connection between the involved systems."
msgstr "ແຕ່ການລັນ [command]``cobbler sync`` ຈະກະຕຸ້ນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນແບບເຕັມຮູບແບບຂອງ ໂຟນເດີ [literal]``/srv/tftpboot`` ໄປຫາ proxy ທັງໝົດທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ໃນ [literal]``/etc/cobbler/settings``. ນອກຈາກນີ້ມັນຍັງໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ ຄ່າຄວາມໜ່ວງ (latency) ຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ WAN ລະຫວ່າງລະບົບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The process of syncing may take a considerable amount of time to finish "
"according to the logs in [literal]``/var/log/cobbler/``."
msgstr "ຂະບວນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນຫຼາຍກວ່າຈະສຳເລັດ ຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໃນ ລັອກ (logs) ໃນ [literal]``/var/log/cobbler/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:6
msgid "For example, it started at:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ມັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເມື່ອ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Thu Jun  3 14:47:35 2021 - DEBUG | running python triggers from "
"/var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/pre/*\n"
"Thu Jun  3 14:47:35 2021 - DEBUG | running shell triggers from "
"/var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/pre/*\n"
msgstr ""
"Thu Jun  3 14:47:35 2021 - DEBUG | running python triggers from /var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/pre/*\n"
"Thu Jun  3 14:47:35 2021 - DEBUG | running shell triggers from /var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/pre/*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:8
msgid "and ended at:"
msgstr "ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດເມື່ອ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Thu Jun  3 15:18:49 2021 - DEBUG | running shell triggers from "
"/var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/post/*\n"
"Thu Jun  3 15:18:49 2021 - DEBUG | shell triggers finished successfully\n"
msgstr ""
"Thu Jun  3 15:18:49 2021 - DEBUG | running shell triggers from /var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/post/*\n"
"Thu Jun  3 15:18:49 2021 - DEBUG | shell triggers finished successfully\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The transfer amount was roughly 1.8 GB.  The transfer took almost 30 "
"minutes."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການໂອນຍ້າຍແມ່ນປະມານ 1.8 GB. ການໂອນຍ້າຍໃຊ້ເວລາເກືອບ 30 ນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:11
msgid ""
"By comparison, copying a single big file of the same size as "
"[literal]``/srv/tftboot`` completes within several minutes."
msgstr "ເມື່ອປຽບທຽບແລ້ວ, ການກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ໃຫຍ່ພຽງໄຟລ໌ດຽວທີ່ມີຂະໜາດເທົ່າກັບ [literal]``/srv/tftboot`` ຈະສຳເລັດພາຍໃນເວລາພຽງບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດນາທີ."

#. == Resolution and analysis
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Switching to an [literal]``rsync``-based approach to copy files between "
"{productname} Server and Proxy may help to reduce the transfer and wait "
"times."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນມາໃຊ້ວິທີການທີ່ອີງຕາມ [literal]``rsync`` ເພື່ອກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ລະຫວ່າງ {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy ອາດຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດເວລາການໂອນຍ້າຍ ແລະ ການລໍຖ້າໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:13
msgid ""
"A script to accomplish this task is available for download at "
"https://suse.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/1i000000gLOd/a/1i000000ll5B/B2AmvIJN2_JsAyjTQzCVP_x5ioVgd0bYN9X9NpMugS8."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ (script) ສຳລັບວຽກນີ້ແມ່ນສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ທີ່ https://suse.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/1i000000gLOd/a/1i000000ll5B/B2AmvIJN2_JsAyjTQzCVP_x5ioVgd0bYN9X9NpMugS8."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The script does not accept command line options.  Before running the script, "
"you need to manually edit it and set correctly [literal]``MLMHOSTNAME``, "
"[literal]``MLMIP`` and [literal]``MLMPROXY1`` variables for it to work "
"correctly."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບນີ້ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຕົວເລືອກຜ່ານ command line. ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລັນສະຄຣິບ, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ ແກ້ໄຂມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແປ [literal]``MLMHOSTNAME``, [literal]``MLMIP`` ແລະ [literal]``MLMPROXY1`` ໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:15
msgid ""
"There is no support available for individual adjustments of the script.  The "
"script and the comments inside aim to provide an overview of the process and "
"steps to be taken into consideration.  If further help is required, contact "
"SUSE Consulting."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການສະໜັບສະໜູນສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງສະຄຣິບເປັນລາຍບຸກຄົນ. ສະຄຣິບ ແລະ ຄຳອະທິບາຍ ພາຍໃນນັ້ນ ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນພາບລວມຂອງຂະບວນການ ແລະ ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ຄວນພິຈາລະນາ. ຫາກຕ້ອງການຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕໍ່ SUSE Consulting."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The proposed approach using the script is beneficial in the following "
"environment:"
msgstr "ວິທີການທີ່ນຳສະເໜີໂດຍໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບນີ້ ຈະເປັນປະໂຫຍດໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:17
msgid "{productname} Proxy systems are connected via a WAN connection;"
msgstr "ລະບົບ {productname} Proxy ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ WAN;"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:18
msgid ""
"[literal]``/srv/tftboot`` contains a high number of files for distributions "
"and client PXE boot files, in total several thousand files;"
msgstr "[literal]``/srv/tftboot`` ມີໄຟລ໌ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍສຳລັບການແຈກຢາຍ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ບູດ PXE ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ລວມທັງໝົດຫຼາຍພັນໄຟລ໌;"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Any proxy in [literal]``/etc/cobbler/settings`` has been disabled, otherwise "
"{productname} will continue to sync content to the proxies."
msgstr "Proxy ໃດໆ ໃນ [literal]``/etc/cobbler/settings`` ຕ້ອງຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ {productname} ຈະຍັງຄົງຊິງໂຄຣໄນເນື້ອຫາໄປຫາ proxy ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#proxies:\n"
"# - \"MLMproxy.MLMproxy.test\"\n"
"# - \"MLMproxy2.MLMproxy.test\"\n"
msgstr ""
"#proxies:\n"
"# - \"MLMproxy.MLMproxy.test\"\n"
"# - \"MLMproxy2.MLMproxy.test\"\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Analyzing New Sync Speed"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການວິເຄາະຄວາມໄວການຊິງໂຄຣໄນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Take a dump of the TCP traffic between {productname} and the involved "
"systems."
msgstr "ທຳການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (dump) ການຈະລາຈອນ TCP ລະຫວ່າງ {productname} ແລະ ລະບົບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:23
msgid "On {productname} Server:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "tcpdump -i ethX -s 200 host <ip-address-of-susemanagerproxy> and not ssh\n"
msgstr "tcpdump -i ethX -s 200 host <ip-address-of-susemanagerproxy> and not ssh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:25
msgid "On {productname} Proxy:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "tcpdump -i ethX -s 200 host <ip-address-of-susemanager> and not ssh\n"
msgstr "tcpdump -i ethX -s 200 host <ip-address-of-susemanager> and not ssh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:27
msgid ""
"This will only capture a package size of 200 which is sufficient to run an "
"analysis."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຈັບສະເພາະແພັກເກດທີ່ມີຂະໜາດ 200 ເຊິ່ງພຽງພໍສຳລັບການວິເຄາະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Adjust ethX to the respective network interface {productname} uses to "
"communicate with the proxy."
msgstr "ປັບປ່ຽນ ethX ໃຫ້ກົງກັບອິນເຕີເຟດເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ {productname} ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສື່ສານກັບ proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:29
msgid ""
"At last, ssh communication will not be captured to reduce the number of "
"packages even further."
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍ, ການສື່ສານຜ່ານ ssh ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຈັບເພື່ອຫຼຸດຈຳນວນແພັກເກດລົງຕື່ມອີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:30
msgid "Start a [command]``cobbler sync``."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມລັນ [command]``cobbler sync``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:31
msgid ""
"To force a sync, delete the {cobbler} json cache file first and then issue "
"[command]``cobbler sync``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຫ້ຊິງໂຄຣໄນ, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ {cobbler} json cache ອອກກ່ອນ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``cobbler sync``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /var/lib/cobbler/pxe_cache.json\n"
"cobbler sync\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /var/lib/cobbler/pxe_cache.json\n"
"cobbler sync\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:33
msgid "When {command]``cobbler sync`` is finished, stop the TCPdumps."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ {command]``cobbler sync`` ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຢຸດການເຮັດ TCPdumps."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Open the TCPdumps using Wireshark, go to [guimenu]``Statistics > "
"Conversations`` and wait for the dump to be analyzed."
msgstr "ເປີດໄຟລ໌ TCPdumps ດ້ວຍ Wireshark, ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Statistics > Conversations`` ແລ້ວລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນຖືກວິເຄາະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Switch to the TCP tab.  The number shown on this tab gives the total number "
"of conversations captured between {productname} Server and {productname} "
"Proxy."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນໄປທີ່ແທັບ (tab) TCP. ຕົວເລກທີ່ສະແດງໃນແທັບນີ້ຈະບອກຈຳນວນການສົນທະນາ (conversations) ທັງໝົດທີ່ຈັບໄດ້ລະຫວ່າງ {productname} Server ແລະ {productname} Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:36
msgid "Look for the column [guimenu]``Duration``."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ຄໍລຳ [guimenu]``Duration``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Start by sorting in ascending order to find out the minimal amount of time "
"it took to transfer a file."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການລຽງລຳດັບຈາກໜ້ອຍໄປຫາຫຼາຍ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງເວລາຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການໂອນຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Continue by sorting in descending order to find out the maximum values for "
"the big files, for example kernel and initrd transfers."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນລຽງລຳດັບຈາກຫຼາຍໄປຫາໜ້ອຍ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຄ່າສູງສຸດສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ໃຫຍ່ໆ ເຊັ່ນ ການໂອນຍ້າຍ kernel ແລະ initrd."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:39
msgid "Ignore ports 4505 and 4506 as these are used for Salt communication."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງສົນໃຈພອດ (ports) 4505 ແລະ 4506 ເພາະພວກມັນຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສື່ສານຂອງ Salt."

#. === Conclusion 
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Analysis of the TCPdumps showed the transfer of small files with a size of "
"approx. 1800 bytes from {productname} Server to Proxy took around 0.3 "
"seconds."
msgstr "ການວິເຄາະ TCPdumps ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າການໂອນຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ນ້ອຍໆ ທີ່ມີຂະໜາດປະມານ 1800 bytes ຈາກ {productname} Server ໄປຫາ Proxy ໃຊ້ເວລາປະມານ 0.3 ວິນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:41
msgid ""
"While there were not many big files, the high number of smaller files "
"resulted high number of established connections as new TCP connection is "
"created for every single transferred file."
msgstr "ເຖິງວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີໄຟລ໌ໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ນ້ອຍໆ ທີ່ມີຫຼາຍ ເຮັດໃຫ້ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ເພາະການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບທຸກໆ ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໂອນຍ້າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Therefore, knowing the minimal amount of transfer time and a number of "
"connections needed (approx. 5000 in the example), gives an approximate "
"estimated time for the overall transfer time: 5000 * 0.3 / 60 = 25 minutes."
msgstr "ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເມື່ອຮູ້ເວລາການໂອນຍ້າຍຕ່ຳສຸດ ແລະ ຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ (ປະມານ 5000 ໃນຕົວຢ່າງ), ຈະໄດ້ເວລາໂດຍປະມານສຳລັບການໂອນຍ້າຍທັງໝົດ: 5000 * 0.3 / 60 = 25 ນາທີ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Renaming {productname} Server"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການປ່ຽນຊື່ {productname} Server"

#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Showing my working. --LKB 2020-06-22
#. Cause: Renaming the hostname
#. Consequence: Changes not picked up by db, clients and proxies
#. Fix: Use the [command]``spacewalk-hostname-rename`` script to update the settings in the PostgreSQL database and the internal structures of {productname}.
#. Result: Renaming is successfully propagated
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you change the hostname of the {productname} Server locally, your "
"{productname} installation ceases to work properly.  This is because the "
"changes have not been made in the database, which prevents the changes from "
"propagating out your clients and any proxies."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າປ່ຽນຊື່ໂຮສ (hostname) ຂອງ {productname} Server ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງເຈົ້າຈະຢຸດເຮັດວຽກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນຍ້ອນວ່າ ການປ່ຽນແປງຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກບັນທຶກໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງນັ້ນບໍ່ສາມາດ ສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ proxy ຕ່າງໆ ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rename server"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຊື່ເຊີບເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you need to change the hostname of the {productname} Server, you can do "
"so using the [command]``mgradm server rename`` command.  This command "
"updates the settings in the {postgresql} database and the internal "
"structures of {productname}."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຊື່ໂຮສຂອງ {productname} Server, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm server rename``. ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະອັບເດດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {postgresql} ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງພາຍໃນຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີບເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The command takes no mandatory parameter, but can take the new hostname if "
"it is not the one from the container host."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ບັງຄັບ, ແຕ່ສາມາດໃສ່ຊື່ໂຮສໃໝ່ໄດ້ ຫາກມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນຊື່ດຽວກັບ container host."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In case any SSL certificate needs to be generated to match the new hostname, "
"the SSL CA password needs to be provided.  This is safely achieved using a "
"configuration file"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL (SSL certificate) ໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບຊື່ໂຮສໃໝ່, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະບຸລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງ SSL CA. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພໂດຍການໃຊ້ ໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Prepare the configuration file for the SSL CA password"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ກຽມໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບລະຫັດຜ່ານ SSL CA"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:9
msgid "Write a [path]``config.yaml`` file with content like the following:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ [path]``config.yaml`` ທີ່ມີເນື້ອຫາຄືດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ssl:\n"
"  password: \"<CA PASSWORD>\"\n"
msgstr ""
"ssl:\n"
"  password: \"<CA PASSWORD>\"\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:11
msgid "This file will be used in the next procedure."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Renaming {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນຊື່ {productname} Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Change the network settings of the server on the system level locally and "
"remotely at the DNS server."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງເຊີບເວີໃນລະດັບລະບົບ ທັງພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ ແລະ ທີ່ DNS ເຊີບເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:14
msgid ""
"You also need to provide configuration settings for reverse name "
"resolution.  Changing network settings is done in the same way as with "
"renaming any other system."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບການແປງຊື່ແບບຍ້ອນກັບ (reverse name resolution). ການປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍແມ່ນເຮັດຄືກັນກັບການປ່ຽນຊື່ລະບົບອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Reboot the {productname} Server to use the new network configuration and to "
"ensure the hostname has changed."
msgstr "ຣີບູດ (reboot) {productname} Server ເພື່ອໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຊື່ໂຮສໄດ້ປ່ຽນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:16
msgid ""
"On the container host, from the command line, execute the following "
"command. Add [command]``-c config.yaml`` if you created the file to store "
"the SSL CA password:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ container host, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້. ເພີ່ມ [command]``-c config.yaml`` ຫາກເຈົ້າໄດ້ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອເກັບລະຫັດຜ່ານ SSL CA ໄວ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm server rename\n"
msgstr "mgradm server rename\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:18
msgid "If the new hostname is not resolvable, the command fails."
msgstr "ຫາກຊື່ໂຮສໃໝ່ບໍ່ສາມາດແປງຊື່ (resolve) ໄດ້, ຄຳສັ່ງຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:19
msgid ""
"The renaming procedure also takes place during the restart of the server "
"container.  The logs can be found by running this command:"
msgstr "ຂະບວນການປ່ຽນຊື່ຍັງເກີດຂຶ້ນລະຫວ່າງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄອນເທນເນີຂອງເຊີບເວີໃໝ່. ສາມາດເບິ່ງລັອກໄດ້ໂດຍການລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- journalctl -u uyuni-update-config\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- journalctl -u uyuni-update-config\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Be aware that this command triggers a refresh of the pillar data for all "
"{salt} clients when restarting the server container: the time it takes to "
"run depends on the number of registered clients."
msgstr "ຄວນລະວັງວ່າຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະກະຕຸ້ນການຣີເຟຣຊ (refresh) ຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ທັງໝົດເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄອນເທນເນີເຊີບເວີໃໝ່: ເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ຈະຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Directly managed clients reconfiguration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍກົງໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Skip this procedure if clients are managed via a {productname} proxy.*\n"
msgstr "*ຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ ຫາກລູກຂ່າຍຖືກຈັດການຜ່ານ {productname} proxy.*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:24
msgid ""
"With the following procedure, reconfigure directly managed clients to make "
"them aware of the new hostname and IP address."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍກົງໃໝ່ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກມັນ ຮັບຮູ້ຊື່ໂຮສ ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Reconfiguring directly managed clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍກົງໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:26
msgid ""
"On the every client, in the {salt} client configuration file, specify the "
"name of the new {salt} master ({productname} Server).  The filename is "
"[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/susemanager.conf`` or, if you do not "
"use the {salt} bundle, [path]``/etc/salt-minion/minion.d/susemanager.conf``:"
msgstr "ໃນທຸກໆ ລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ {salt}, ໃຫ້ລະບຸຊື່ຂອງ {salt} master ໃໝ່ ({productname} Server). ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ແມ່ນ [path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/susemanager.conf`` ຫຼື ຫາກເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ {salt} bundle, ແມ່ນ [path]``/etc/salt-minion/minion.d/susemanager.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "master: <new_hostname>\n"
msgstr "master: <new_hostname>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:28
msgid "On every client, restart {salt} service.  Either run:"
msgstr "ໃນທຸກໆ ລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງບໍລິການ {salt} ໃໝ່. ໂດຍລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:30
msgid "Or, if you do not use the {salt} bundle, run:"
msgstr "ຫຼື ຫາກເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ {salt} bundle, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "ClientcConnection with applying high state"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍການໃຊ້ High State"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Finally, to fully propagate the hostname to the {salt} client configuration, "
"apply the high state.  Applying the high state will update the hostname in "
"the repository URLs."
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍ, ເພື່ອສົ່ງຕໍ່ຊື່ໂຮສໄປຫາການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ຢ່າງສົມບູນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ high state. ການໃຊ້ high state ຈະອັບເດດຊື່ໂຮສໃນ URL ຂອງຄັງຊອບແວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconfigure Proxy"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Proxy ໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Every proxy must be reconfigured.  The new server certificate and key must "
"be copied to the proxy.  For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທຸກໆ proxy ຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີບເວີ ແລະ ຄີ (key) ໃໝ່ຕ້ອງຖືກກັອບປີ້ ໄປຫາ proxy. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:36
msgid ""
"If you use PXE boot through a proxy, you must check the configuration "
"settings of the proxy.  If you use PXE boot through non-containerized "
"{productname} Proxy 4.3, [systemitem]``tftpsync`` needs to be reconfigured."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າໃຊ້ການບູດ PXE ຜ່ານ proxy, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ proxy. ຫາກເຈົ້າໃຊ້ການບູດ PXE ຜ່ານ {productname} Proxy 4.3 ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບຄອນເທນເນີ, ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [systemitem]``tftpsync`` ໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:37
msgid "On the container host, execute:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ container host, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- configure-tftpsync.sh\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- configure-tftpsync.sh\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Inactive clients"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ (Inactive)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:2
msgid ""
"A Taskomatic job periodically pings clients to ensure they are connected.  "
"Clients are considered inactive if they have not responded to a Taskomatic "
"check in for 24 hours or more.  To see a list of inactive clients in the "
"{webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List > Inactive]."
msgstr "ງານ Taskomatic ຈະທຳການ ping ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍເປັນໄລຍະເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພວກມັນຍັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່. ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຖືກຖືວ່າບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ ຫາກພວກມັນບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການກວດສອບຂອງ Taskomatic ເປັນເວລາ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ. ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ ເມນູ:Systems[System List > Inactive]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:3
msgid "Clients can become inactive for a number of reasons:"
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດກາຍເປັນສະຖານະບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວໄດ້ຍ້ອນຫຼາຍສາເຫດ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:4
msgid "The client is not entitled to any {productname} service."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍບໍ່ມີສິດນຳໃຊ້ບໍລິການໃດໆ ຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:5
msgid "The client is behind a firewall that does not allow HTTPS connections."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງໄຟວໍທີ່ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTPS."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:6
msgid "The client is behind a proxy that is misconfigured."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ proxy ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The client is communicating with a different {productname} Server, or the "
"connection has been misconfigured."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍກຳລັງສື່ສານກັບ {productname} Server ອື່ນ, ຫຼື ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The client is not in a network that can communicate with the {productname} "
"Server."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ສາມາດສື່ສານກັບ {productname} Server ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:9
msgid ""
"A firewall is blocking traffic between the client and the {productname} "
"Server."
msgstr "ໄຟວໍກຳລັງປິດກັ້ນການຈະລາຈອນລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:10
msgid "Taskomatic is misconfigured."
msgstr "Taskomatic ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about client connections to the server, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍກັບເຊີບເວີ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For more information about configuring ports, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:network-requirements.adoc#ports[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າພອດ (ports), ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:network-requirements.adoc#ports[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For more information about troubleshooting firewalls, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໄຟວໍ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-intro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains some common problems you might encounter with "
"{productname}, and solutions to resolving them."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ລວມມີບັນຫາທົ່ວໄປທີ່ເຈົ້າອາດຈະພົບໃນ {productname}, ແລະ ວິທີການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-intro.adoc:3
msgid "Troubleshooting topics specific to Public Cloud are covered separately."
msgstr "ຫົວຂໍ້ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາສະເພາະສຳລັບ Public Cloud ແມ່ນຈະຖືກແຍກໄວ້ຕ່າງຫາກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-intro.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For Public Cloud troubleshooting, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Public Cloud, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Inter-Server Synchronization"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລະຫວ່າງເຊີບເວີ (ISS)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Cause: Caches on the ISS slave and master can contain old or out-of-date entries.
#. Consequence: Synchronizing fails, with ``ERROR: Encountered IntegrityError``.
#. Fix: Delete the cache on the slave and the master
#. Result: Synchronization completes successfully.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Inter-server synchronization uses caches to manage the ISS Master and "
"Slaves.  These caches can be prone to bugs that create invalid entries.  In "
"this case, bugs can show up even after updating to a version that resolves "
"the bug, because the cache is still using invalid entries.  If you upgrade "
"to a new version of ISS, but are still experiencing problems, clear all the "
"caches to ensure you no longer have old entries creating a problem."
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລະຫວ່າງເຊີບເວີ (ISS) ໃຊ້ແຄຊ (caches) ເພື່ອຈັດການ ISS Master ແລະ Slaves. ແຄຊເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (bugs) ທີ່ສ້າງລາຍການທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດອາດຈະຍັງສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນເຖິງວ່າຈະອັບເດດເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວກໍຕາມ, ຍ້ອນວ່າແຄຊຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ລາຍການທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງນັ້ນຢູ່. ຫາກເຈົ້າອັບເກຣດເປັນ ISS ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ແລ້ວ ແຕ່ຍັງພົບບັນຫາຢູ່, ໃຫ້ລ້າງແຄຊທັງໝົດເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ ບໍ່ມີລາຍການເກົ່າທີ່ສ້າງບັນຫາອີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Cache errors can lead to synchronization failing with a variety of errors, "
"but the error message will usually report something like this:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງແຄຊສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລົ້ມເຫຼວດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ, ແຕ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດມັກຈະລາຍງານປະມານນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"consider removing satellite-sync cache at /var/cache/rhn/satsync/* and "
"re-run satellite-sync with same options.\n"
msgstr "consider removing satellite-sync cache at /var/cache/rhn/satsync/* and re-run satellite-sync with same options.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can resolve this by deleting the cache on the ISS Master and the ISS "
"Slave, so that synchronization completes successfully."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດແກ້ໄຂສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການລຶບແຄຊໃນ ISS Master ແລະ ISS Slave ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving ISS Caching Errors"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດການເຮັດແຄຊຂອງ ISS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On the ISS Master, at the command prompt, as root, delete the cache file for "
"the Master:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ ISS Master, ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ດ້ວຍສິດ root, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ແຄຊຂອງ Master:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/xml-*\n"
msgstr "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/xml-*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:10
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:14
msgid "Restart the service:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍລິການໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:11
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "rcapache2 restart\n"
msgstr "rcapache2 restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:12
msgid ""
"On the ISS Master, at the command prompt, as root, delete the cache file for "
"the Slave:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ ISS Master, ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ດ້ວຍສິດ root, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ແຄຊຂອງ Slave:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/satsync/*\n"
msgstr "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/satsync/*\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-localcert.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Local Issuer Certificates"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຜູ້ອອກໃບຮັບຮອງທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (Local Issuer Certificates)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-localcert.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Some older bootstrap scripts create a link to the local certificate in the "
"wrong place.  This results in zypper returning an ``Unrecognized error`` "
"about the local issuer certificate.  You can ensure that the link to the "
"local issuer certificate has been created correctly by checking the "
"[path]``/etc/ssl/certs/`` directory.  If you come across this problem, you "
"should consider updating your bootstrap scripts to ensure that zypper "
"operates as expected."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ (script) ບູດສະແຕຣັບລຸ້ນເກົ່າບາງຕົວ ຈະສ້າງລິ້ງ (link) ໄປຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ຜິດບ່ອນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ zypper ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ``Unrecognized error`` ກ່ຽວກັບ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຜູ້ອອກໃບຮັບຮອງທ້ອງຖິ່ນ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າລິ້ງນັ້ນຖືກສ້າງຢ່າງ ຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການກວດເບິ່ງໂຟນເດີ [path]``/etc/ssl/certs/``. ຫາກເຈົ້າພົບບັນຫານີ້, ເຈົ້າຄວນພິຈາລະນາອັບເດດສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບຂອງເຈົ້າ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ zypper ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Login Timeouts"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການໝົດເວລາເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:2
msgid ""
"By default, the {productname} {webui} requires users to log in again after "
"30{nbsp}minutes.  Depending on your environment, you might want to adjust "
"the login timeout value."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} {webui} ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄືນໃໝ່ ຫຼັງຈາກ 30{nbsp}ນາທີ. ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງເຈົ້າ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະ ຕ້ອງການປັບຄ່າເວລາການໝົດເວລານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To adjust the value, you need to make the change in both [path]``rhn.conf`` "
"and [path]``web.xml``.  Ensure you set the value in seconds in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, and in minutes in [path]``web.xml``.  The two "
"values must equal the same amount of time."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບຄ່ານີ້, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນແປງທັງໃນ [path]``rhn.conf`` ແລະ [path]``web.xml``. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນວິນາທີໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, ແລະ ເປັນນາທີ ໃນ [path]``web.xml``. ທັງສອງຄ່າຕ້ອງເທົ່າກັບໄລຍະເວລາດຽວກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For example, to change the timeout value to one hour, set the value in "
"[path]``rhn.conf`` to 3600 seconds, and the value in [path]``web.xml`` to 60 "
"minutes."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເພື່ອປ່ຽນເວລາໝົດເວລາເປັນ 1 ຊົ່ວໂມງ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ [path]``rhn.conf`` ເປັນ 3600 ວິນາທີ, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ [path]``web.xml`` ເປັນ 60 ນາທີ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adjusting the {webui} Login Timeout Value"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບຄ່າເວລາການໝົດເວລາເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຂອງ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:6
msgid "On the container host, open a command line inside the server container:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ container host, ໃຫ້ເປີດ command line ພາຍໃນ server container:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Open [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` and add or edit this line to include the "
"new timeout value in seconds:"
msgstr "ເປີດ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລ້ວເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຄ່າໝົດເວລາໃໝ່ເປັນວິນາທີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "web.session_database_lifetime = <Timeout_Value_in_Seconds>\n"
msgstr "web.session_database_lifetime = <Timeout_Value_in_Seconds>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:10
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:13
msgid "Save and close the file."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກ ແລະ ປິດໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Open [path]``/etc/tomcat/web.xml`` and add or edit this line to include the "
"new timeout value in minutes:"
msgstr "ເປີດ [path]``/etc/tomcat/web.xml`` ແລ້ວເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຄ່າໝົດເວລາໃໝ່ເປັນນາທີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "<session-timeout>Timeout_Value_in_Minutes</session-timeout>\n"
msgstr "<session-timeout>Timeout_Value_in_Minutes</session-timeout>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:14
msgid "On the container host, restart the server to enforce the new configuration:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ container host, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຊີບເວີໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ມີຜົນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart uyuni-server.service\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart uyuni-server.service\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Mail Configuration"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຕັ້ງຄ່າອີເມລ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For secure mail communication, you can enable authentication, define "
"username and password, and enable [literal]``SSL`` or [literal]``STARTLS`` "
"in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບການສື່ສານອີເມລທີ່ປອດໄພ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (authentication), ລະບຸຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ [literal]``SSL`` ຫຼື [literal]``STARTLS`` ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.smtp_server = string (default: localhost)\n"
"java.smtp_port = integer (default: 25)\n"
"java.smtp_auth = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_ssl = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_starttls = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_user = string (default: null)\n"
"java.smtp_pass = string (default: null)\n"
msgstr ""
"java.smtp_server = string (default: localhost)\n"
"java.smtp_port = integer (default: 25)\n"
"java.smtp_auth = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_ssl = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_starttls = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_user = string (default: null)\n"
"java.smtp_pass = string (default: null)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To increase the connection timeout for SMTP server communication, the "
"following parameters can be set in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມໄລຍະເວລາໝົດເວລາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (timeout) ສຳລັບການສື່ສານກັບເຊີບເວີ SMTP, ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.smtp_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_connection_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_write_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
msgstr ""
"java.smtp_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_connection_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_write_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mass Machine_id Duplication"
msgstr "ບັນຫາການຊ້ຳກັນຂອງ Machine_id ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:2
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you are using {productname} to manage virtual machines, you might find it "
"useful to create clones of your VMs.  A clone is a VM that uses a primary "
"disk that is an exact copy of an existing disk."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າກຳລັງໃຊ້ {productname} ເພື່ອຈັດການເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (VMs), ເຈົ້າອາດຈະ ພົບວ່າມັນມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການສ້າງຄໂລນ (clones) ຂອງ VM ຂອງເຈົ້າ. ຄໂລນ ແມ່ນ VM ທີ່ໃຊ້ດິດຫຼັກເຊິ່ງເປັນການສຳເນົາທີ່ຄືກັນກັບດິດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວທຸກປະການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:3
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:3
msgid ""
"While cloning VMs can save you a lot of time, the duplicated identifying "
"information on the disk can sometimes cause problems."
msgstr "ເຖິງວ່າການສ້າງຄໂລນ VM ຈະຊ່ວຍປະຢັດເວລາໄດ້ຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນອ້າງອີງທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນ ໃນດິດບາງຄັ້ງກໍອາດສ້າງບັນຫາໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you try to register two machine where one is the clone of the other, you "
"probably want {productname} to register them as two separate clients.  "
"However, if the machine ID in both the original client and the clone is the "
"same, {productname} registers both clients as one system, and the data is "
"overwritten one the second machine is registered."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າພະຍາຍາມລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງສອງເຄື່ອງ ໂດຍທີ່ເຄື່ອງໜຶ່ງເປັນຄໂລນຂອງອີກເຄື່ອງໜຶ່ງ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ {productname} ລົງທະບຽນພວກມັນເປັນລູກຂ່າຍແຍກກັນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຫາກ machine ID ໃນເຄື່ອງຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງຄໂລນແມ່ນອັນດຽວກັນ, {productname} ຈະລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍທັງສອງເປັນລະບົບດຽວກັນ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນ ຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບເມື່ອເຄື່ອງທີສອງຖືກລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This can be resolved by changing the machine ID of the clone, so that "
"{productname} recognizes them as two different clients.  For more "
"information and instructions on how to change machine ID, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ machine ID ຂອງເຄື່ອງຄໂລນ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ຮັບຮູ້ວ່າພວກມັນເປັນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ວິທີການປ່ຽນ machine ID, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:6
msgid ""
"However, in some situations, it is neither feasible nor practical to change "
"the machine ID on all systems, as this could disrupt other applications that "
"depend on the existing machine IDs. In those cases, a option is available "
"where a fake machine ID is generated to be used in the context of "
"{productname}."
msgstr "ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃນບາງສະຖານະການ, ມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ສະດວກ ຫຼື ເປັນໄປບໍ່ໄດ້ທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນ machine ID ໃນທຸກລະບົບ ເພາະອາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນໆ ທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບ machine ID ທີ່ມີຢູ່. ໃນກໍລະນີເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ, ມີຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ສ້າງ machine ID ປອມ ຂຶ້ນມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generating machine ID for {productname} at registration time"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ machine ID ສຳລັບ {productname} ໃນເວລາລົງທະບຽນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Create a Bootstrap script (skip this step if you already have it)  For more "
"information, see xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສ້າງສະຄຣິບ ບູດສະແຕຣັບ (ຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຫາກເຈົ້າມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ). ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:9
msgid "Open the file and change the parameter:"
msgstr "ເປີດໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ປ່ຽນພາຣາມິເຕີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "GENERATE_OWN_MACHINEID=1\n"
msgstr "GENERATE_OWN_MACHINEID=1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:11
msgid "Start using your bootstrap strict, and machine ID will not collide anymore."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບບູດສະແຕຣັບຂອງເຈົ້າ, ແລະ machine ID ຈະບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Mounting /tmp with noexec"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເມົາທ໌ (Mounting) /tmp ດ້ວຍ noexec"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt runs remote commands from [path]``/tmp`` on the client's file system.  "
"Therefore you must not mount [path]``/tmp`` with the [option]``noexec`` "
"option.  The other way to solve this issue is to override temporary "
"directory path with the [literal]``TMPDIR`` environment variable specified "
"for the Salt service to make it pointing to the directory with no "
"[option]``noexec`` option set.  It is recommended to use systemd drop-in "
"configuration file "
"[path]``/etc/systemd/system/venv-salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf`` if "
"Salt Bundle is used, or "
"[path]``/etc/systemd/system/salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf`` if "
"[package]``salt-minion`` is used on the client.  The example of the drop-in "
"configuration file content:"
msgstr "Salt ລັນຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກຈາກ [path]``/tmp`` ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງບໍ່ mount [path]``/tmp`` ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [option]``noexec``. ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງໃນການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ແມ່ນການຂຽນທັບເສັ້ນທາງໂຟນເດີຊົ່ວຄາວດ້ວຍ ຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [literal]``TMPDIR`` ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ສຳລັບບໍລິການ Salt ເພື່ອ ໃຫ້ມັນຊີ້ໄປຫາໂຟນເດີທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [option]``noexec``. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ systemd drop-in [path]``/etc/systemd/system/venv-salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf`` ຫາກໃຊ້ Salt Bundle, ຫຼື [path]``/etc/systemd/system/salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf`` ຫາກໃຊ້ [package]``salt-minion`` ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງເນື້ອຫາຂອງໄຟລ໌ drop-in:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=TMPDIR=/var/tmp\n"
msgstr ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=TMPDIR=/var/tmp\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-vartmp-with-noexec.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Mounting /var/tmp with noexec"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເມົາທ໌ /var/tmp ດ້ວຍ noexec"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-vartmp-with-noexec.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt SSH is using [path]``/var/tmp`` to deploy Salt Bundle to and execute "
"Salt commands on the client with the bundled Python.  Therefore you must not "
"mount [path]``/var/tmp`` with the [option]``noexec`` option.  It is not "
"possible to bootstrap the clients, which have [path]``/var/tmp`` mounted "
"with [option]``noexec`` option, with the {webui} because the bootstrap "
"process is using Salt SSH to reach a client."
msgstr "Salt SSH ໃຊ້ [path]``/var/tmp`` ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ Salt Bundle ແລະ ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ໃນລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ Python ທີ່ມານຳກັນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງບໍ່ mount [path]``/var/tmp`` ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [option]``noexec``. ມັນເປັນໄປບໍ່ໄດ້ ທີ່ຈະບູດສະແຕຣັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ mount [path]``/var/tmp`` ດ້ວຍ [option]``noexec`` ຜ່ານ {webui} ເພາະຂະບວນການບູດສະແຕຣັບໃຊ້ Salt SSH ເພື່ອເຂົ້າຫາລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Not Enough Disk Space"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາພື້ນທີ່ດິດບໍ່ພຽງພໍ"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Check the available disk space before you begin migration.  We recommend "
"locating [path]``/var/spacewalk`` and [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` on separate "
"XFS file systems."
msgstr "ກວດສອບພື້ນທີ່ດິດທີ່ມີຢູ່ກ່ອນເລີ່ມການຍ້າຍ (migration). ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ ແຍກ [path]``/var/spacewalk`` ແລະ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` ໄວ້ໃນ ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ XFS ທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When you are setting up a separate file system, edit [path]``/etc/fstab`` "
"and remove the [path]``/var/lib/pqsql`` subvolume.  Reboot the server to "
"pick up the changes."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບໄຟລ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂ [path]``/etc/fstab`` ແລະ ເອົາ subvolume [path]``/var/lib/pqsql`` ອອກ. ຣີບູດເຊີບເວີເພື່ອໃຫ້ການ ປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To get more information about an upgrade problem, check the migration log "
"file.  The log file is located at [path]``/var/log/rhn/migration.log`` on "
"the system you are upgrading."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບບັນຫາການອັບເກຣດ, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌ ລັອກການຍ້າຍ. ໄຟລ໌ລັອກຕັ້ງຢູ່ທີ່ [path]``/var/log/rhn/migration.log`` ໃນລະບົບທີ່ເຈົ້າກຳລັງອັບເກຣດ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Notifications"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The default lifetime of notification messages is 30 days, after which "
"messages are deleted from the database, regardless of read status.  To "
"change this value, add or edit this line in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນແມ່ນ 30 ວັນ, ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຖືກອ່ານແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.notifications_lifetime = 30\n"
msgstr "java.notifications_lifetime = 30\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To enable or disable a notification type, add or edit a line as follows in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດປະເພດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.notifications_type_disabled = OnboardingFailed,ChannelSyncFailed,\\\n"
"  ChannelSyncFinished,CreateBootstrapRepoFailed,StateApplyFailed,\\\n"
"  PaygAuthenticationUpdateFailed,EndOfLifePeriod,SubscriptionWarning\n"
msgstr ""
"java.notifications_type_disabled = OnboardingFailed,ChannelSyncFailed,\\\n"
"  ChannelSyncFinished,CreateBootstrapRepoFailed,StateApplyFailed,\\\n"
"  PaygAuthenticationUpdateFailed,EndOfLifePeriod,SubscriptionWarning\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For default settings and configuration options, see the "
"[path]``usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf`` template file."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌ແບບຢ່າງ (template) [path]``usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf``."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting OES repositories enablement"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄັງຊອບແວ OES"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To enable Open Enterprise Server (OES) on {productname} Server, follow the "
"procedure described."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ Open Enterprise Server (OES) ເທິງ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling OES repositories"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄັງຊອບແວ OES"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:4
msgid "Ensure you have mirror credentials from Microfocus with access to OES."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນການຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນຂອງມິເຣີ (mirror credentials) ຈາກ Microfocus ທີ່ມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງ OES."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:5
msgid "Log in to {productname} Server."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບເຊີເວີ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:6
msgid "Go to [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:7
msgid "Make sure you already have SUSE credentials for {productname}."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນການຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນຂອງ SUSE ສຳລັບ {productname} ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:8
msgid "Select option for adding new and type in Microfocus credentials."
msgstr "ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກເພື່ອເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ ແລະ ພິມຂໍ້ມູນການຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນຂອງ Microfocus ເຂົ້າໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Go to [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials`` and wait "
"for the refresh operation to complete."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials`` ແລະ ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ການດຳເນີນການຣີເຟຣຊສຳເລັດສິ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:10
msgid ""
"OES should be visible on the refreshed product list.  You can now enable it "
"like any other products."
msgstr "OES ຄວນຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຣີເຟຣຊແລ້ວ. ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານມັນໄດ້ຄືກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about OES, see "
"https://www.microfocus.com/documentation/open-enterprise-server/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ OES, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ https://www.microfocus.com/documentation/open-enterprise-server/."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Package Inconsistencies"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຄວາມບໍ່ສອດຄ່ອງກັນຂອງແພັກເກັດ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When packages on a client are locked, {productname} Server may not be able "
"to correctly determine the set of applicable patches.  When this occurs, "
"package updates are available in the {webui}, but do not appear on the "
"client, and attempts to update the client fail.  Check package locks and "
"exclude lists to determine if packages are locked or excluded on the client."
msgstr "ເມື່ອແພັກເກັດໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຖືກລັອກ, ເຊີເວີ {productname} ອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດກວດສອບຊຸດຂອງແພັດ (patches) ທີ່ເໝາະສົມໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ເມື່ອເຫດການນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ການອັບເດດແພັກເກັດຈະມີໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນ {webui}, ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ປາກົດຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ການພະຍາຍາມອັບເດດລູກຂ່າຍຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ. ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງການລັອກແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ລາຍຊື່ການຍົກເວັ້ນ (exclude lists) ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າແພັກເກັດຖືກລັອກ ຫຼື ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:3
msgid ""
"On the client, check package locks and exclude lists to determine if "
"packages are locked or excluded:"
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງການລັອກແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ລາຍຊື່ການຍົກເວັ້ນ ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າແພັກເກັດຖືກລັອກ ຫຼື ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຫຼືບໍ່:"

#.  SUSE Liberty Linux not available at Uyuni for now
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On an Expanded Support Platform, check [path]``/etc/yum.conf`` and search "
"for ``exclude=``."
msgstr "ໃນແພລັດຟອມ Expanded Support, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງ [path]``/etc/yum.conf`` ແລະ ຄົ້ນຫາ ``exclude=``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:5
msgid "On {sle} and {opensuse}, use the [command]``zypper locks`` command."
msgstr "ໃນ {sle} ແລະ {opensuse}, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``zypper locks``."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Passing Grains to a Start Event"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການສົ່ງ Grains ໄປຫາ Start Event"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Every time a Salt client starts, it passes the ``machine_id`` grain to "
"{productname}. {productname} uses this grain to determine if the client is "
"registered.  This process requires a synchronous Salt call. Synchronous Salt "
"calls block other processes, so if you have a lot of clients start at the "
"same time, the process could create significant delays."
msgstr "ທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງ grain ``machine_id`` ໃຫ້ກັບ {productname}. {productname} ໃຊ້ grain ນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່. ຂະບວນການນີ້ຕ້ອງການການເອີ້ນ Salt ແບບ synchronous. ການເອີ້ນແບບ synchronous ຈະບລັອກຂະບວນການອື່ນໆ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ຖ້າທ່ານມີລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກພ້ອມກັນ, ຂະບວນການນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຫຼ້າຊ້າຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To overcome this problem, a new feature has been introduced in Salt to avoid "
"making a separate synchronous Salt call."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ຟີເຈີໃໝ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າມາໃນ Salt ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການເອີ້ນ Salt ແບບ synchronous ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To use this feature, you can add a configuration parameter to the client "
"configuration, on clients that support it."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຟີເຈີນີ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມພະລາມິເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຂົ້າໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ, ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To make this process easier, you can use the ``mgr_start_event_grains.sls`` "
"helper Salt state."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂະບວນການນີ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Salt state ຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ ``mgr_start_event_grains.sls``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:6
msgid ""
"This only applies to already registered clients.  If you registered your "
"Salt client recently, this config parameter is added by default."
msgstr "ອັນນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານຫາກໍ່ລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຂອງທ່ານເມື່ອບໍ່ດົນມານີ້, ພະລາມິເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:7
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, use this command to "
"enable the ``start_event_grains`` configuration helper:"
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານຕົວຊ່ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``start_event_grains``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_start_event_grains\n"
msgstr "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_start_event_grains\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This command adds the required configuration into the client's configuration "
"file, and applies it when the client is restarted.  If you have a large "
"number of clients, you can execute the command in batch mode instead:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຈຳເປັນເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຈະມີຜົນເມື່ອລູກຂ່າຍຖືກເລີ່ມໃໝ່. ຖ້າທ່ານມີລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດປະຕິບັດຄຳສັ່ງໃນໂໝດ batch ແທນໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls mgr_start_event_grains\n"
msgstr "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls mgr_start_event_grains\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Proxy Connections and FQDN"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ Proxy ແລະ FQDN"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Sometimes clients connected through a proxy appear in the {webui}, but do "
"not show that they are connected through a proxy.  This can occur if you are "
"not using the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) to connect, and the proxy "
"is not known to {productname}."
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ proxy ຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນ {webui}, ແຕ່ບໍ່ສະແດງວ່າພວກເຂົາເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ proxy. ເຫດການນີ້ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ fully qualified domain name (FQDN) ໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ {productname} ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ proxy ດັ່ງກ່າວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To correct this behavior, specify additional FQDNs as grains in the client "
"configuration file on the proxy:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ລະບຸ FQDN ເພີ່ມເຕີມເປັນ grains ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍໃນ proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grains:\n"
"  susemanager:\n"
"    custom_fqdns:\n"
"      - name.one\n"
"      - name.two\n"
msgstr ""
"grains:\n"
"  susemanager:\n"
"    custom_fqdns:\n"
"      - name.one\n"
"      - name.two\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registration from {webui} fails and does not show any errors"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການລົງທະບຽນຈາກ {webui} ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ບໍ່ສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃດໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For the initial registration from the {webui}, all Salt clients are using "
"Salt SSH."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນຈາກ {webui}, ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທັງໝົດແມ່ນກຳລັງໃຊ້ Salt SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Because of its nature, Salt SSH clients do not report errors back to the "
"server."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກທຳມະຊາດຂອງມັນ, ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt SSH ຈະບໍ່ລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດກັບຄືນໄປຫາເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:4
msgid ""
"However, the Salt SSH clients store a log locally at "
"[path]``/var/log/salt-ssh.log`` that can be inspected for errors."
msgstr "ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt SSH ຈະເກັບ log ໄວ້ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ [path]``/var/log/salt-ssh.log`` ເຊິ່ງສາມາດກວດກາເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໄດ້."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registering Cloned Clients"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກໂຄນນິ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you have a client that is already registered, you create a clone of that "
"client, and then try and register the clone, you probably want {productname} "
"to register them as two separate clients.  However, if the machine ID in "
"both the original client and the clone is the same, {productname} registers "
"both clients as one system, and the existing client data is overwritten with "
"that of the clone."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານມີລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສ້າງລູກຂ່າຍໂຄນນິ່ງຈາກເຄື່ອງນັ້ນ, ແລະ ພະຍາຍາມລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງໂຄນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ {productname} ລົງທະບຽນພວກມັນເປັນສອງລູກຂ່າຍແຍກກັນ. ແຕ່ຖ້າ machine ID ທັງໃນເຄື່ອງຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງໂຄນຄືກັນ, {productname} ຈະລົງທະບຽນທັງສອງລູກຂ່າຍເປັນລະບົບດຽວກັນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນຂອງເຄື່ອງໂຄນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This can be resolved by changing the machine ID of the clone, so that "
"{productname} recognizes them as two different clients."
msgstr "ບັນຫານີ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ machine ID ຂອງເຄື່ອງໂຄນ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ຮັບຮູ້ວ່າພວກມັນເປັນສອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Each step of this procedure is performed on the cloned client.  This "
"procedure does not manipulate the original client, which remains registered "
"to {productname}."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງຂະບວນການນີ້ແມ່ນປະຕິບັດໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ. ຂະບວນການນີ້ຈະບໍ່ໄປຍຸ່ງກ່ຽວກັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ເຊິ່ງຍັງຄົງລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ຢູ່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Duplicate Machine IDs in Cloned Salt Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂ machine ID ຊ້ຳກັນໃນລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Initial System Configuration*\n"
msgstr "*ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ*\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:9
msgid "On the cloned machine, change the hostname and IP addresses."
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ hostname ແລະ IP addresses."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Make sure [path]``/etc/hosts`` contains the changes you made and the correct "
"host entries."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ [path]``/etc/hosts`` ມີການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ເຮັດ ແລະ ມີ host entries ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Resolving Duplicate Machine IDs*\n"
msgstr "*ການແກ້ໄຂ machine ID ຊ້ຳກັນ*\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:12
msgid "_For distributions that support systemd:_"
msgstr "_ສຳລັບຊຸດຕິດຕັ້ງ (distributions) ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ systemd:_"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:13
msgid ""
"If your machines have the same machine ID, as root, delete the files on each "
"duplicated client and re-create it:"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານມີ machine ID ຄືກັນ, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ໃນແຕ່ລະລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນ ແລະ ສ້າງມັນຂຶ້ນໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
"systemd-machine-id-setup\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
"systemd-machine-id-setup\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:15
msgid ""
"If the cloned machine also has a folder in [path]``/var/log/journal/`` it "
"needs to be renamed accordingly to the new machine ID. If names do not "
"match, [command]``journalctl`` could not retrieve any log and "
"[command]``podman logs`` would not show anything."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຄື່ອງທີ່ຖືກໂຄນມີໂຟນເດີໃນ [path]``/var/log/journal/`` ມັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ປ່ຽນຊື່ຕາມ machine ID ໃໝ່. ຖ້າຊື່ບໍ່ກົງກັນ, [command]``journalctl`` ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດດຶງ log ໃດໆໄດ້ ແລະ [command]``podman logs`` ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຫຍັງເລີຍ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "mv /var/log/journal/* /var/log/journal/$(cat /etc/machine-id)\n"
msgstr "mv /var/log/journal/* /var/log/journal/$(cat /etc/machine-id)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:17
msgid "_For distributions that do not support systemd:_"
msgstr "_ສຳລັບຊຸດຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ systemd:_"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:18
msgid "As root, generate a machine ID from dbus:"
msgstr "ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ machine ID ຈາກ dbus:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:20
msgid ""
"If you are cloning a {rhel} 8.10 server that will later be liberated to "
"{sll}, you must perform extra steps to fix the kernel configuration files."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໂຄນເຊີເວີ {rhel} 8.10 ທີ່ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນ (liberated) ເປັນ {sll} ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດຂັ້ນຕອນເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄີເນີນ (kernel)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:21
msgid ""
"{rhel} uses the machine ID to generate kernel entries in "
"[path]``/boot/loader/entries``.  Not performing these steps will result in a "
"mix of old and new kernel entries after the liberation, as {sll} kernels "
"will create new entries instead of replacing the old ones."
msgstr "{rhel} ໃຊ້ machine ID ເພື່ອສ້າງລາຍການເຄີເນີນໃນ [path]``/boot/loader/entries``. ການບໍ່ປະຕິບັດຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີລາຍການເຄີເນີນເກົ່າ ແລະ ໃໝ່ປົນກັນຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນລະບົບ, ເນື່ອງຈາກເຄີເນີນ {sll} ຈະສ້າງລາຍການໃໝ່ແທນທີ່ຈະໄປປ່ຽນແທນອັນເກົ່າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:22
msgid "After changing the machine ID and before liberating, run:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນ machine ID ແລະ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະທຳການ liberate, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo rm -rf /boot/loader/entries/\n"
"sudo for ver in $(rpm -q kernel --qf '%{VERSION}-%{RELEASE}.%{ARCH}\\n'); do "
"echo \"Reinstalling kernel $ver...\"; sudo kernel-install add $ver "
"/lib/modules/$ver; done\n"
"sudo grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/efi/EFI/redhat/grub.cfg\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo rm -rf /boot/loader/entries/\n"
"sudo for ver in $(rpm -q kernel --qf '%{VERSION}-%{RELEASE}.%{ARCH}\\n'); do echo \"Reinstalling kernel $ver...\"; sudo kernel-install add $ver /lib/modules/$ver; done\n"
"sudo grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/efi/EFI/redhat/grub.cfg\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:24
msgid ""
"For more information and example on liberating {rhel} 8.10 server, see "
"xref:common-workflows:workflow-liberate-rhel-with-secureboot.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ຕົວຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບການ liberate ເຊີເວີ {rhel} 8.10, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:common-workflows:workflow-liberate-rhel-with-secureboot.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Reconfiguring {salt} Clients*\n"
msgstr "*ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ໃໝ່*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:26
msgid ""
"If your clients still have the same Salt client ID, delete the "
"[path]``minion_id`` file on each client (FQDN is used when it is regenerated "
"on client restart)."
msgstr "ຖ້າລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານຍັງມີ Salt client ID ຄືກັນ, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ [path]``minion_id`` ໃນແຕ່ລະລູກຂ່າຍ (FQDN ຈະຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ເມື່ອມັນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ໃນຕອນທີ່ເລີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:27
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:32
msgid "For Salt Minion clients:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ Salt Minion:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/salt/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/salt/pki\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/salt/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/salt/pki\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:29
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:34
msgid "For Salt Bundle clients:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ Salt Bundle:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/venv-salt-minion/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/venv-salt-minion/pki\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/venv-salt-minion/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/venv-salt-minion/pki\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Delete accepted keys from the onboarding page and the system profile from "
"{productname}, and restart the client with."
msgstr "ລຶບ keys ທີ່ຖືກຕອບຮັບແລ້ວອອກຈາກໜ້າ onboarding ແລະ system profile ຈາກ {productname}, ແລ້ວເລີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "service salt-minion restart\n"
msgstr "service salt-minion restart\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "service venv-salt-minion restart\n"
msgstr "service venv-salt-minion restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Re-register the clients.  Each client now has a different "
"[path]``/etc/machine-id`` and should be correctly displayed on the "
"[guimenu]``System Overview`` page."
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່. ຕອນນີ້ແຕ່ລະລູກຂ່າຍຈະມີ [path]``/etc/machine-id`` ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ແລະ ຄວນຈະສະແດງຜົນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``System Overview``."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote root login on {sl-micro}"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ root ຈາກໄລຍະໄກໃນ {sl-micro}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For enhanced security, new installations of {sl-micro} 6.2 and later do not "
"allow password-based remote root login anymore, which affects server and "
"proxy container hosts running on {sl-micro} and managed {sl-micro} clients.  "
"Also, {sle-micro} 5.5 clients with password-based remote root login which "
"will when be migrated to 6.1/6.2 will suddenly lose this access and must be "
"newly configured.  For more information, see SL Micro Release Notes 6.2 "
"(https://documentation.suse.com/releasenotes/sle-micro/html/releasenotes_sle-micro_6.2/)."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ຂອງ {sl-micro} 6.2 ແລະ ລຸ້ນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ root ຈາກໄລຍະໄກດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ເຊິ່ງມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ server ແລະ proxy container hosts ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນ {sl-micro} ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ {sl-micro} ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ລູກຂ່າຍ {sle-micro} 5.5 ທີ່ໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ root ດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ ເມື່ອຖືກຍ້າຍລະບົບ (migrated) ໄປຫາ 6.1/6.2 ຈະເສຍສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງນີ້ທັນທີ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ SL Micro Release Notes 6.2 (https://documentation.suse.com/releasenotes/sle-micro/html/releasenotes_sle-micro_6.2/)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"While deploying components of {productname} such as a {productname} Proxy, "
"by default, password-based remote root login is required.  You can enable "
"password-based remote root login with the following steps."
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ {productname} ເຊັ່ນ {productname} Proxy, ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ root ຈາກໄລຍະໄກດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານມັນໄດ້ຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enable SSH root login with a password on {sl-micro}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ SSH root ດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານໃນ {sl-micro}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can enable SSH root login in two different ways.  Either of them will "
"work; choose the one that best fits your setup."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ SSH root ໄດ້ສອງວິທີ. ວິທີໃດກໍໄດ້ແມ່ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ຜົນ; ໃຫ້ເລືອກວິທີທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານທີ່ສຸດ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option A: Use the preconfigured package"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ A: ໃຊ້ແພັກເກັດທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Install the package [package]``openssh-server-config-rootlogin`` from the "
"UI/API on the client."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ [package]``openssh-server-config-rootlogin`` ຈາກ UI/API ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Reboot the container host to activate the new configuration either from UI "
"or from terminal"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບ container host ໃໝ່ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຜ່ານ UI ຫຼື terminal"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option B: Edit the SSH configuration manually"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ B: ແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSH ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Add a drop-in config [path]``/etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/permit_root.conf`` file, "
"with the following content:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [path]``/etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/permit_root.conf`` ດ້ວຍເນື້ອຫາຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "PermitRootLogin yes\n"
msgstr "PermitRootLogin yes\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:12
msgid "Reload the SSH server configuration"
msgstr "ໂຫຼດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSH server ໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl reload sshd\n"
msgstr "systemctl reload sshd\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If connected using SSH, before disconnecting from the server, validate the "
"SSH server is working correctly by opening a new SSH connection."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດ້ວຍ SSH ຢູ່, ກ່ອນຈະຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກເຊີເວີ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າ SSH server ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍການລອງເປີດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For more information about [command]``transactional-update``, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/6.2/html/Micro-transactional-updates/index.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ [command]``transactional-update``, ເບິ່ງ https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/6.2/html/Micro-transactional-updates/index.html."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resizing BTRFS"
msgstr "ການປັບຂະໜາດ BTRFS"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resizing a BTRFS LVM partition on {sles}"
msgstr "ການປັບຂະໜາດພາທິຊັນ BTRFS LVM ໃນ {sles}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When managing a {sles} installation, the BTRFS root file system can become "
"full due to files, caches, or snapshots.  Because removing snapshots "
"manually is not recommended, the best approach is to resize the partition."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຈັດການການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles}, ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ root ແບບ BTRFS ອາດຈະເຕັມຍ້ອນໄຟລ໌, caches, ຫຼື snapshots. ເນື່ອງຈາກບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ລຶບ snapshots ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນການປັບຂະໜາດພາທິຊັນ (partition)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To resize a BTRFS partition, the partition must remain mounted during this "
"procedure."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບຂະໜາດພາທິຊັນ BTRFS, ພາທິຊັນນັ້ນຕ້ອງຍັງຄົງຖືກ mount ໄວ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The following steps illustrate how to resize a BTRFS LVM partition by adding "
"a new disk (for example, [path]``/dev/sdb``) to the volume group."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວິທີປັບຂະໜາດພາທິຊັນ BTRFS LVM ໂດຍການເພີ່ມດິສກ໌ໃໝ່ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [path]``/dev/sdb``) ເຂົ້າໃນ volume group."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resizing a BTRFS LVM Partition*"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບຂະໜາດພາທິຊັນ BTRFS LVM*"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Check the disk information to identify the root file system device and the "
"new disk using the `lsblk` command:"
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນດິສກ໌ເພື່ອລະບຸອຸປະກອນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ root ແລະ ດິສກ໌ໃໝ່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `lsblk`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:8
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "lsblk\n"
msgstr "lsblk\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:9
msgid "Create a physical volume on the newly added disk:"
msgstr "ສ້າງ physical volume ໃນດິສກ໌ທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "pvcreate /dev/sdb\n"
msgstr "pvcreate /dev/sdb\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:11
msgid "Scan for the current volume group that the root file system is using:"
msgstr "ສະແກນຫາ volume group ປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ root ກຳລັງໃຊ້ຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "vgscan\n"
msgstr "vgscan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:13
msgid "Extend the volume group with the newly created physical volume:"
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍ volume group ດ້ວຍ physical volume ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "vgextend system /dev/sdb\n"
msgstr "vgextend system /dev/sdb\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:15
msgid "Extend the logical volume using the extended volume group:"
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍ logical volume ໂດຍໃຊ້ volume group ທີ່ຖືກຂະຫຍາຍແລ້ວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "lvextend -l +100%FREE /dev/system/root\n"
msgstr "lvextend -l +100%FREE /dev/system/root\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:17
msgid "Resize the BTRFS root file system:"
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດລະບົບໄຟລ໌ BTRFS root:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "btrfs filesystem resize max /\n"
msgstr "btrfs filesystem resize max /\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Check the result to verify that the system's root file system has been "
"successfully resized to the new capacity:"
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງຜົນເພື່ອຢືນຢັນວ່າລະບົບໄຟລ໌ root ຂອງລະບົບໄດ້ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໄປຫາຄວາມຈຸໃໝ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resizing a BTRFS root volume on {sl-micro}"
msgstr "ການປັບຂະໜາດ BTRFS root volume ໃນ {sl-micro}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:22
msgid ""
"When managing a {sle-micro} 5.5 or {sl-micro} 6 installation, the BTRFS root "
"volume may run out of disk space and require resizing."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຈັດການການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle-micro} 5.5 ຫຼື {sl-micro} 6, BTRFS root volume ອາດຈະໝົດພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ ແລະ ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ປັບຂະໜາດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Attempting to resize the root volume using the standard command "
"[command]``btrfs fi resize max /`` will result in the following error:"
msgstr "ການພະຍາຍາມປັບຂະໜາດ root volume ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງມາດຕະຖານ [command]``btrfs fi resize max /`` ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "ERROR: unable to resize '/': Read-only file system\n"
msgstr "ERROR: unable to resize '/': Read-only file system\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:25
msgid ""
"This occurs because the root volume is mounted read-only on {sle-micro} "
"systems.  To successfully complete the operation online, you must target the "
"[path]``/.snapshots`` mount point instead, which is mounted read-write."
msgstr "ເຫດການນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນຍ້ອນວ່າ root volume ຖືກ mount ແບບອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ (read-only) ໃນລະບົບ {sle-micro}. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການດຳເນີນການອອນລາຍສຳເລັດ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ mount point [path]``/.snapshots`` ແທນ, ເຊິ່ງຖືກ mount ແບບອ່ານ-ຂຽນ (read-write)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:26
msgid "Changes to the partition table can cause damage to the system."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແປງຕາຕະລາງພາທິຊັນ (partition table) ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມເສຍຫາຍຕໍ່ລະບົບໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Always make sure to have a complete backup before making changes to the "
"partition table."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ທຳການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ (backup) ໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນສະເໝີ ກ່ອນຈະທຳການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆກັບຕາຕະລາງພາທິຊັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The following procedure illustrates how to resize a single disk where the "
"root partition is the last partition on the device (for example, "
"[path]``/dev/sda3``).  If your layout contains further partitions, the "
"operation may become more complex and you may need to reach out to "
"{scclongform} for support."
msgstr "ຂະບວນການຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວິທີການປັບຂະໜາດດິສກ໌ດ່ຽວ ໂດຍທີ່ root partition ເປັນພາທິຊັນສຸດທ້າຍຂອງອຸປະກອນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [path]``/dev/sda3``). ຖ້າໂຄງສ້າງຂອງທ່ານມີພາທິຊັນອື່ນໆຕໍ່ຈາກນັ້ນ, ການດຳເນີນການອາດຈະສັບສົນຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕິດຕໍ່ຫາ {scclongform} ເພື່ອຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resizing the BTRFS root volume"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບຂະໜາດ BTRFS root volume"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Resize the existing disk to the new size using the appropriate hypervisor or "
"storage tools for your environment."
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດດິສກ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃຫ້ເປັນຂະໜາດໃໝ່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ hypervisor ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງມືຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Rescan the device to be resized.  For example, to rescan [path]``/dev/sda``, "
"run the following command as root:"
msgstr "ທຳການສະແກນອຸປະກອນທີ່ຈະປັບຂະໜາດໃໝ່. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອສະແກນ [path]``/dev/sda`` ໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ໃນນາມ root:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "echo 1 > /sys/block/sda/device/rescan\n"
msgstr "echo 1 > /sys/block/sda/device/rescan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Resize the root partition using the comamnd [command]``growpart``.  In this "
"example, we resize partition 3 on [path]``/dev/sda``:"
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດ root partition ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``growpart``. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະປັບຂະໜາດພາທິຊັນ 3 ໃນ [path]``/dev/sda``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "growpart /dev/sda 3\n"
msgstr "growpart /dev/sda 3\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Resize the BTRFS filesystem.  Be sure to use [path]``/.snapshots`` instead "
"of [path]``/`` to avoid the read-only error:"
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດລະບົບໄຟລ໌ BTRFS. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໃຊ້ [path]``/.snapshots`` ແທນທີ່ [path]``/`` ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ read-only:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "btrfs fi resize max /.snapshots\n"
msgstr "btrfs fi resize max /.snapshots\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Check the filesystem to verify that the new size has been applied "
"successfully:"
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນວ່າຂະໜາດໃໝ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "btrfs fi show /\n"
msgstr "btrfs fi show /\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Red Hat CDN Channel and Multiple Certificates"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຊ່ອງທາງ Red Hat CDN ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຫຼາຍອັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The {redhat} content delivery network (CDN) channels sometimes provide "
"multiple certificates, but the {productname} {webui} can only import a "
"single certificate.  If CDN presents a certificate that is different to the "
"one the {productname} {webui} knows about, validation fails and permission "
"to access the repository is denied, even though the certificate is "
"accurate.  The error message received is:"
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງຊ່ອງທາງ Red Hat Content Delivery Network (CDN) ຈະໃຫ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (certificates) ຫຼາຍອັນ, ແຕ່ {productname} {webui} ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໄດ້ພຽງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າ CDN ສະເໜີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກໃບທີ່ {productname} {webui} ຮູ້ຈັກ, ການກວດສອບຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັງຊອບແວ (repository) ຈະຖືກປະຕິເສດ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນນັ້ນຈະຖືກຕ້ອງກໍຕາມ. ຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[error]\n"
"Repository '<repo_name>' is invalid.\n"
"<repo.pem> Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"
"History:\n"
" - [|] Error trying to read from '<repo.pem>'\n"
" - Permission to access '<repo.pem>' denied.\n"
"Please check if the URIs defined for this repository are pointing to a valid "
"repository.\n"
"Skipping repository '<repo_nam' because of the above error.\n"
"Could not refresh the repositories because of errors.\n"
"HH:MM:SS RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys "
"are not imported\n"
msgstr ""
"[error]\n"
"Repository '<repo_name>' is invalid.\n"
"<repo.pem> Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"
"History:\n"
" - [|] Error trying to read from '<repo.pem>'\n"
" - Permission to access '<repo.pem>' denied.\n"
"Please check if the URIs defined for this repository are pointing to a valid repository.\n"
"Skipping repository '<repo_nam' because of the above error.\n"
"Could not refresh the repositories because of errors.\n"
"HH:MM:SS RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys are not imported\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To resolve this issue, merge all valid certificates into a single ``.pem`` "
"file, and rebuild the certificates for use by {productname}:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ລວມໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງທັງໝົດເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ ``.pem`` ດຽວ, ແລະ ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບ {productname}:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Multiple {redhat} CDN Certificates"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ Red Hat CDN ຫຼາຍອັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the {redhat} client, at the command prompt, as root, gather all current "
"certificates from ``/etc/pki/entitlement/`` in a single ``rh-cert.pem`` "
"file:"
msgstr "ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ Red Hat, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ລວບລວມໃບຢັ້ງຢືນປັດຈຸບັນທັງໝົດຈາກ ``/etc/pki/entitlement/`` ເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ ``rh-cert.pem`` ດຽວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat 866705146090697087.pem 3539668047766796506.pem "
"redhat-entitlement-authority.pem > rh-cert.pem\n"
msgstr "cat 866705146090697087.pem 3539668047766796506.pem redhat-entitlement-authority.pem > rh-cert.pem\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Gather all current keys from ``/etc/pki/entitlement/`` in a single "
"``rh-key.pem`` file:"
msgstr "ລວບລວມ keys ປັດຈຸບັນທັງໝົດຈາກ ``/etc/pki/entitlement/`` ເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ ``rh-key.pem`` ດຽວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "cat 866705146090697087-key.pem 3539668047766796506-key.pem > rh-key.pem\n"
msgstr "cat 866705146090697087-key.pem 3539668047766796506-key.pem > rh-key.pem\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can now import the new certificates to the {productname} Server, using "
"the instructions in xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່ໄປຍັງເຊີເວີ {productname} ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳແນະນຳໃນ xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting RPC Connection Timeouts"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການໝົດເວລາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ RPC (RPC Timeouts)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:2
msgid ""
"RPC connections can sometimes time out due to slow networks or a network "
"link going down.  This results in package downloads or batch jobs hanging or "
"taking longer than expected.  You can adjust the maximum time that an RPC "
"connection can take by editing the configuration file.  While this does not "
"resolve networking problems, it does cause a process to fail rather than "
"hang."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ RPC ບາງຄັ້ງອາດໝົດເວລາ (timeout) ເນື່ອງຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍຊ້າ ຫຼື ສາຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍຂາດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ການດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກັດ ຫຼື ວຽກແບບ batch ຄ້າງ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເວລາດົນກວ່າທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບເວລາສູງສຸດທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ RPC ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າວິທີນີ້ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເຄືອຂ່າຍໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະບວນການນັ້ນລາຍງານວ່າຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວແທນທີ່ຈະຄ້າງຢູ່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving RPC connection timeouts"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການໝົດເວລາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ RPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, open the [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` file "
"and set a maximum timeout value (in seconds):"
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາໝົດເວລາສູງສຸດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.timeout =`number`\n"
msgstr "server.timeout =`number`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Proxy, open the "
"[filename]``/etc/uyuni/proxy/config.yaml`` file and set a maximum timeout "
"value (in seconds).  The proxy containers need to be restarted for the "
"change to be effective:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Proxy, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [filename]``/etc/uyuni/proxy/config.yaml`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາໝົດເວລາສູງສຸດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ). ຕົວບັນຈຸ (containers) ຂອງ proxy ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ເລີ່ມໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "timeout: `number`\n"
msgstr "timeout: `number`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On a {sles} client that uses zypper, open the "
"[filename]``/etc/zypp/zypp.conf`` file and set a maximum timeout value (in "
"seconds):"
msgstr "ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ {sles} ທີ່ໃຊ້ zypper, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [filename]``/etc/zypp/zypp.conf`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາໝົດເວລາສູງສຸດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"## Valid values:  [0,3600]\n"
"## Default value: 180\n"
"download.transfer_timeout = 180\n"
msgstr ""
"## Valid values:  [0,3600]\n"
"## Default value: 180\n"
"download.transfer_timeout = 180\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:10
msgid ""
"On a {rhel} client that uses yum, open the [filename]``/etc/yum.conf`` file "
"and set a maximum timeout value (in seconds):"
msgstr "ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ {rhel} ທີ່ໃຊ້ yum, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [filename]``/etc/yum.conf`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາໝົດເວລາສູງສຸດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "timeout =`number`\n"
msgstr "timeout =`number`\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you limit RPC timeouts to less than `180` seconds, you risk aborting "
"perfectly normal operations."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳນົດເວລາໝົດເວລາ RPC ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ `180` ວິນາທີ, ທ່ານອາດຈະສ່ຽງຕໍ່ການຍົກເລີກການດຳເນີນງານທີ່ເປັນປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Salt clients shown as down and DNS settings"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ສະແດງສະຖານະ down ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DNS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Even if the Salt client is running, actions such as package refresh or apply "
"states can be marked as failed with the message:"
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຈະເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ແຕ່ການດຳເນີນການຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ ການຣີເຟຣຊແພັກເກັດ ຫຼື ການນຳໃຊ້ states ອາດຈະຖືກໝາຍວ່າຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຄວາມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minion is down or could not be contacted.\n"
msgstr "Minion is down or could not be contacted.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In this case try rescheduling the action.  If rescheduling succeeds, the "
"cause of the problem can be a wrong DNS configuration."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ ໃຫ້ລອງຕັ້ງກຳນົດເວລາການດຳເນີນການໃໝ່. ຖ້າການຕັ້ງກຳນົດເວລາໃໝ່ສຳເລັດ, ສາເຫດຂອງບັນຫາອາດຈະມາຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DNS ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:6
msgid ""
"When the Salt client is restarted, or in case the grains are refreshed, the "
"client calculates its FQDN grains, and it is unresponsive until the grains "
"are proceeded.  When a scheduled action on {productname} Server is going to "
"be executed, {productname} Server performs a ``test.ping`` to the client "
"before the actual action to ensure the client is actually running and the "
"action can be triggered."
msgstr "ເມື່ອລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຖືກເລີ່ມໃໝ່, ຫຼື ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ grains ຖືກຣີເຟຣຊ, ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຄິດໄລ່ grains FQDN ຂອງມັນ, ແລະ ມັນຈະບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງຈົນກວ່າ grains ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນ. ເມື່ອກຳນົດເວລາການດຳເນີນການໃນເຊີເວີ {productname} ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດ, ເຊີເວີ {productname} ຈະທຳການ ``test.ping`` ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍກ່ອນການດຳເນີນການຕົວຈິງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າລູກຂ່າຍກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ແລະ ສາມາດເລີ່ມການດຳເນີນການໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:7
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} Server waits for 5 seconds to get the response "
"from ``test.ping`` command.  If the response is not received within 5 "
"seconds, then the action is set to fail with the message that the client is "
"down or could not be contacted."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ເຊີເວີ {productname} ຈະລໍຖ້າ 5 ວິນາທີເພື່ອຮັບການຕອບສະໜອງຈາກຄຳສັ່ງ ``test.ping``. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຕອບສະໜອງພາຍໃນ 5 ວິນາທີ, ການດຳເນີນການຈະຖືກຕັ້ງວ່າຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າລູກຂ່າຍ down ຫຼື ບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To correct this, fix the DNS resolution on the client, so the client does "
"not get stuck for 5 seconds while solving its FQDN."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂການແປຊື່ DNS (DNS resolution) ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍຄ້າງເປັນເວລາ 5 ວິນາທີໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງຫາ FQDN ຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If this is not possible, try to increase the value for "
"``java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`` in the ``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` file on the "
"{productname} Server to a value higher than 4."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນໄປບໍ່ໄດ້, ໃຫ້ລອງເພີ່ມຄ່າຂອງ ``java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`` ໃນໄຟລ໌ ``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname} ໃຫ້ສູງກວ່າ 4."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl term\n"
"vim /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"java.salt_presence_ping_timeout = 6\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl term\n"
"vim /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"java.salt_presence_ping_timeout = 6\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:12
msgid "After that, run:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Increasing this value will cause {productname} Server to take longer to "
"check if a minion is unreachable or unresponsive, causing the {productname} "
"Server to be slower or less responsive overall."
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຊີເວີ {productname} ໃຊ້ເວລາດົນຂຶ້ນໃນການກວດສອບວ່າ minion ບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ໄດ້ ຫຼື ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຊີເວີ {productname} ຊ້າລົງ ຫຼື ຕອບສະໜອງໄດ້ໜ້ອຍລົງໃນພາບລວມ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Schema Upgrade Fails"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການອັບເກຣດ Schema ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If the schema upgrade fails, the database version check and all the other "
"spacewalk services do not start.  Run [command]``mgradm start`` on the "
"container host for more information and hints how to proceed."
msgstr "ຖ້າການອັບເກຣດ schema ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ການກວດສອບເວີຊັນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ບໍລິການ spacewalk ອື່ນໆທັງໝົດຈະບໍ່ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm start`` ໃນ container host ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ຄຳແນະນຳໃນການດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:4
msgid "You can also run the version check directly in the container:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລັນການກວດສອບເວີຊັນໄດ້ໂດຍກົງພາຍໃນ container:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl status uyuni-check-database.service\n"
msgstr "systemctl status uyuni-check-database.service\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "journalctl -u uyuni-check-database.service\n"
msgstr "journalctl -u uyuni-check-database.service\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:8
msgid ""
"These commands print debug information if you do not want to run the more "
"general [command]``mgradm`` command."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນ debug ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm`` ທີ່ເປັນຄຳສັ່ງທົ່ວໄປກວ່າ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Synchronization"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ (Synchronization)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Synchronization can fail for a number of reasons.  To get more information "
"about a connection problem, run this command:"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ອາດຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໄດ້ຍ້ອນຫຼາຍສາເຫດ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export URLGRABBER_DEBUG=DEBUG\n"
"spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channelname> <options> > "
"/var/log/spacewalk-repo-sync-$(date +%F-%R).log 2>&1\n"
msgstr ""
"export URLGRABBER_DEBUG=DEBUG\n"
"spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channelname> <options> > /var/log/spacewalk-repo-sync-$(date +%F-%R).log 2>&1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:4
msgid "You can also check logs created by Zypper at [path]``/var/log/zypper.log``"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກວດເບິ່ງ log ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ Zypper ໄດ້ທີ່ [path]``/var/log/zypper.log``"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Key Mismatch"
msgstr "GPG Key ບໍ່ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} does not automatically trust third party GPG keys.  If package "
"synchronization fails, it could be because of an untrusted GPG key.  You can "
"find out if this is the case by opening [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync`` and "
"looking for an error like this:"
msgstr "{productname} ຈະບໍ່ເຊື່ອຖື GPG keys ຈາກບຸກຄົນທີສາມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ແພັກເກັດຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ມັນອາດຈະເປັນຍ້ອນ GPG key ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ໂດຍການເປີດ [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync`` ແລະ ຊອກຫາຂໍ້ຜິດພາດແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"['/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync', '--channel', 'sle-12-sp1-ga-desktop-\n"
"nvidia-driver-x86_64', '--type', 'yum', '--non-interactive']\n"
"RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys are not "
"imported\n"
msgstr ""
"['/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync', '--channel', 'sle-12-sp1-ga-desktop-\n"
"nvidia-driver-x86_64', '--type', 'yum', '--non-interactive']\n"
"RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys are not imported\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To resolve the problem, you need to import the GPG key to {productname}.  "
"For more on importing GPG keys, see "
"xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າ GPG key ໄປຍັງ {productname}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການນຳເຂົ້າ GPG keys, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Key Removal from [literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync``"
msgstr "ການລຶບ GPG Key ອອກຈາກ [literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:10
msgid ""
"When a GPG key for repository has been manually imported using "
"[literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync``, and this key is no longer needed (for "
"example if the key was compromised, or was used for testing purposes only), "
"it can be removed from the zypper RPM database used by "
"[literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` with the following command:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອ GPG key ສຳລັບຄັງຊອບແວໄດ້ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ [literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync``, ແລະ key ນີ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າ key ຖືກລະເມີດຄວາມປອດໄພ ຫຼື ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງການທົດສອບເທົ່ານັ້ນ), ມັນສາມາດຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ zypper RPM ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "rpm --dbpath=/var/lib/spacewalk/reposync/root/var/lib/rpm/ -e gpg-pubkey-*\n"
msgstr "rpm --dbpath=/var/lib/spacewalk/reposync/root/var/lib/rpm/ -e gpg-pubkey-*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:12
msgid "where [literal]``gpg-pubkey-*`` is the name of the GPG key to be removed."
msgstr "ໂດຍທີ່ [literal]``gpg-pubkey-*`` ແມ່ນຊື່ຂອງ GPG key ທີ່ຈະລຶບອອກ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Renewing GPG Key"
msgstr "ການຕໍ່ອາຍຸ GPG Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If you want to renew a GPG key, first remove the old key, and then generate "
"and import a new one."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕໍ່ອາຍຸ GPG key, ໃຫ້ລຶບ key ເກົ່າອອກກ່ອນ, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງສ້າງ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າ key ໃໝ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checksum Mismatch"
msgstr "ຄ່າ Checksum ບໍ່ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:16
msgid ""
"If a checksum has failed, you might see an error like this in the "
"[path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync/*.log`` log file:"
msgstr "ຖ້າ checksum ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ທ່ານອາດຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດແບບນີ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ log [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync/*.log``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Repo Sync Errors: (50, u'checksums did not match\n"
"326a904c2fbd7a0e20033c87fc84ebba6b24d937 vs\n"
"afd8c60d7908b2b0e2d95ad0b333920aea9892eb', 'Invalid information uploaded\n"
"to the server')\n"
"The package microcode_ctl-1.17-102.57.62.1.x86_64 which is referenced by\n"
"patch microcode_ctl-8413 was not found in the database. This patch has\n"
"been skipped.\n"
msgstr ""
"Repo Sync Errors: (50, u'checksums did not match\n"
"326a904c2fbd7a0e20033c87fc84ebba6b24d937 vs\n"
"afd8c60d7908b2b0e2d95ad0b333920aea9892eb', 'Invalid information uploaded\n"
"to the server')\n"
"The package microcode_ctl-1.17-102.57.62.1.x86_64 which is referenced by\n"
"patch microcode_ctl-8413 was not found in the database. This patch has\n"
"been skipped.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:18
msgid ""
"You can resolve this error by running the synchronization from the command "
"prompt with the [command]``-Y`` option:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການລັນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [command]``-Y``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-repo-sync --channel <channelname> -Y\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-repo-sync --channel <channelname> -Y\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:20
msgid ""
"This option verifies the repository data before the synchronization, rather "
"than relying on locally cached checksums."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນຄັງຊອບແວກ່ອນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌, ແທນທີ່ຈະອີງໃສ່ checksum ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນ cache ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connection Timeout"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໝົດເວລາ (Connection Timeout)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:22
msgid "If the download times out with the following error:"
msgstr "ຖ້າການດາວໂຫຼດໝົດເວລາດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"28, 'Operation too slow. Less than 1000 bytes/sec transferred the last 300 "
"seconds\n"
msgstr "28, 'Operation too slow. Less than 1000 bytes/sec transferred the last 300 seconds\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:24
msgid ""
"You can resolve this error by specifying [literal]``reposync_timeout`` and "
"[literal]``reposync_minrate`` configuration values in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``.  By default, when less than 1000 bytes per "
"second are transferred in 300 secs, the download is aborted.  You can adjust "
"the number of bytes per second with [literal]``reposync_minrate``, and the "
"number of seconds to wait with [literal]``reposync_timeout``."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການລະບຸຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [literal]``reposync_timeout`` ແລະ [literal]``reposync_minrate`` ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ເມື່ອມີການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໜ້ອຍກວ່າ 1000 ໄບຕ໌ຕໍ່ວິນາທີ ເປັນເວລາ 300 ວິນາທີ, ການດາວໂຫຼດຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ຕໍ່ວິນາທີດ້ວຍ [literal]``reposync_minrate``, ແລະ ຈຳນວນວິນາທີທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າດ້ວຍ [literal]``reposync_timeout``."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manually Trusting the Key During reposync"
msgstr "ການຕອບຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື Key ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນລະຫວ່າງ reposync"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:26
msgid ""
"It is possible that in some cases when [command]``reposync`` is run, you may "
"need to accept the GPG key manually.  For example:"
msgstr "ເປັນໄປໄດ້ວ່າໃນບາງກໍລະນີເມື່ອລັນ [command]``reposync``, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຍອມຮັບ GPG key ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# spacewalk-repo-sync -c nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
