#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Taskomatic"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Taskomatic"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Repository metadata regeneration is a relatively intensive process, so "
"Taskomatic can take several minutes to complete.  Additionally, if "
"Taskomatic crashes, repository metadata regeneration can be interrupted."
msgstr "ການສ້າງ metadata ຂອງຄັງຊອບແວຄືນໃໝ່ເປັນຂະບວນການທີ່ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຂ້ອນຂ້າງຫຼາຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ Taskomatic ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍນາທີເພື່ອໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຖ້າ Taskomatic ຄ້າງ ຫຼື ລົ້ມ (crashes), ການສ້າງ metadata ຂອງຄັງຊອບແວຄືນໃໝ່ອາດຈະຖືກຂັດຈັງຫວະໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If Taskomatic is still running, or if the process has crashed, package "
"updates can seem available in the {webui}, but do not appear on the client, "
"and attempts to update the client fail.  In this case, the [command]``zypper "
"ref`` command shows an error like this:"
msgstr "ຖ້າ Taskomatic ຍັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ຫຼື ຖ້າຂະບວນການຄ້າງ, ການອັບເດດແພັກເກັດອາດຈະປາກົດວ່າພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານໃນ {webui}, ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ປາກົດຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ການພະຍາຍາມອັບເດດລູກຂ່າຍຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``zypper ref`` ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"
msgstr "Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:6
msgid ""
"To correct this, determine if Taskomatic is still in the process of "
"generating repository metadata, or if a crash could have occurred.  Wait for "
"metadata regeneration to complete or restart Taskomatic after a crash in "
"order for client updates to be carried out correctly."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າ Taskomatic ຍັງຢູ່ໃນຂະບວນການສ້າງ metadata ຂອງຄັງຊອບແວຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່, ຫຼື ອາດຈະເກີດການຄ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ໃຫ້ລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າການສ້າງ metadata ສຳເລັດ ຫຼື ເລີ່ມ Taskomatic ໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກການຄ້າງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການອັບເດດລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດດຳເນີນການໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Taskomatic Problems"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Taskomatic"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, check the "
"[path]``/var/log/rhn/rhn_taskomatic_daemon.log`` file to determine if any "
"metadata regeneration processes are still running, or if a crash occurred."
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌ [path]``/var/log/rhn/rhn_taskomatic_daemon.log`` ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າຂະບວນການສ້າງ metadata ຍັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່, ຫຼື ວ່າມັນຄ້າງໄປແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:9
msgid "Restart taskomatic:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ taskomatic ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "service taskomatic restart\n"
msgstr "service taskomatic restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the Taskomatic log files, you can identify the section related to "
"metadata regeneration by looking for opening and closing lines that look "
"like this:"
msgstr "ໃນໄຟລ໌ log ຂອງ Taskomatic, ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸສ່ວນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການສ້າງ metadata ໄດ້ໂດຍການຊອກຫາແຖວເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ແຖວປິດທີ່ມີລັກສະນະແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<YYYY-DD-MM> <HH:MM:SS>,174 [Thread-584] INFO  "
"com.redhat.rhn.taskomatic.task.repomd.RepositoryWriter - Generating new "
"repository metadata for channel "
"'cloned-2018-q1-sles12-sp3-updates-x86_64'(sha256) 550 packages, 140 "
"errata\n"
msgstr "<YYYY-DD-MM> <HH:MM:SS>,174 [Thread-584] INFO  com.redhat.rhn.taskomatic.task.repomd.RepositoryWriter - Generating new repository metadata for channel 'cloned-2018-q1-sles12-sp3-updates-x86_64'(sha256) 550 packages, 140 errata\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "...\n"
msgstr "...\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<YYYY-DD-MM> <HH:MM:SS>,704 [Thread-584] INFO  "
"com.redhat.rhn.taskomatic.task.repomd.RepositoryWriter - Repository metadata "
"generation for 'cloned-2018-q1-sles12-sp3-updates-x86_64' finished in 4 "
"seconds\n"
msgstr "<YYYY-DD-MM> <HH:MM:SS>,704 [Thread-584] INFO  com.redhat.rhn.taskomatic.task.repomd.RepositoryWriter - Repository metadata generation for 'cloned-2018-q1-sles12-sp3-updates-x86_64' finished in 4 seconds\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-webui-fails-load.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting {webui} Fails to Load"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ {webui} ໂຫຼດບໍ່ສຳເລັດ"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-webui-fails-load.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the {webui} will not load after migration.  This is usually "
"caused by browser caching, if the new system has the same hostname and IP "
"address as the old system.  This duplication can confuse some browsers."
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງ, {webui} ຈະບໍ່ໂຫຼດຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍລະບົບ (migration). ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກຈະເກີດຈາກການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ cache ຂອງບຣາວເຊີ, ຖ້າລະບົບໃໝ່ມີ hostname ແລະ IP address ຄືກັນກັບລະບົບເກົ່າ. ຄວາມຊ້ຳຊ້ອນນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ບາງບຣາວເຊີເກີດຄວາມສັບສົນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-webui-fails-load.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This issue is resolved by clearing the cache and reloading the page.  In "
"most browsers, you can do this quickly by pressing kbd:[Ctrl+F5]."
msgstr "ບັນຫານີ້ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການລຶບ cache ແລະ ໂຫຼດໜ້າເວັບໃໝ່. ໃນບຣາວເຊີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໄວໆໂດຍການກົດ kbd:[Ctrl+F5]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tuning Changelogs"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງ Changelogs"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Some packages have a long list of changelog entries.  This data is "
"downloaded by default, but it is not always useful information to keep.  In "
"order to limit the amount of changelog metadata which is downloaded and to "
"save disk space, you can put a limit on how many entries to keep on disk."
msgstr "ບາງແພັກເກັດມີລາຍການ changelog ທີ່ຍາວຫຼາຍ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈະຖືກດາວໂຫຼດມາ, ແຕ່ມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດສະເໝີໄປທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້. ເພື່ອຈຳກັດຈຳນວນ changelog metadata ທີ່ຈະດາວໂຫຼດ ແລະ ເພື່ອປະຢັດພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌, ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຈຳນວນລາຍການທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້ໃນດິສກ໌ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This configuration option is in the [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"configuration file.  The parameter defaults to [systemitem]``20``.  Changing "
"this value to [systemitem]``0`` will provide an unlimited number of entries."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [systemitem]``20``. ການປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ [systemitem]``0`` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດເກັບລາຍການໄດ້ແບບບໍ່ຈຳກັດ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.max_changelog_entries = 20\n"
msgstr "java.max_changelog_entries = 20\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If you set this parameter, it comes into effect only for new packages when "
"they are synchronized."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕັ້ງພະລາມິເຕີນີ້, ມັນຈະມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບແພັກເກັດໃໝ່ເມື່ອມີການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:7
msgid "After changing this parameter, restart services with ``mgradm restart``."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນພະລາມິເຕີນີ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມບໍລິການໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ ``mgradm restart``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You might like to delete and regenerate the cached data to remove older "
"data."
msgstr "ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການລຶບ ແລະ ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ cache ຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອລຶບຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າອອກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Deleting and regenerating cached data can take a long time.  Depending on "
"the number of channels you have and the amount of data to be deleted, it can "
"potentially take several hours.  The task is run in the background by "
"Taskomatic, so you can continue to use {productname} while the operation "
"completes, however you should expect some performance loss."
msgstr "ການລຶບ ແລະ ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ cache ຄືນໃໝ່ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ. ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຈຳນວນຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ທີ່ທ່ານມີ ແລະ ຈຳນວນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈະລຶບ, ມັນອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ. ວຽກນີ້ຈະຖືກລັນຢູ່ໃນເບື້ອງຫຼັງໂດຍ Taskomatic, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຈຶ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ງານ {productname} ຕໍ່ໄປໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການດຳເນີນການກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ແຕ່ທ່ານຄວນຄາດໄວ້ວ່າປະສິດທິພາບຂອງລະບົບອາດຈະຫຼຸດລົງບາງສ່ວນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can delete and request a regeneration of cached data from the command "
"line:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບ ແລະ ຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ cache ຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-sql -i\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-sql -i\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:12
msgid "Then on the SQL database prompt, enter:"
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ SQL, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"DELETE FROM rhnPackageRepodata;\n"
"INSERT INTO rhnRepoRegenQueue (id, CHANNEL_LABEL, REASON, FORCE)\n"
"(SELECT sequence_nextval('rhn_repo_regen_queue_id_seq'),\n"
"        C.label,\n"
"        'cached data regeneration',\n"
"        'Y'\n"
"        FROM rhnChannel C);\n"
"\\q\n"
msgstr ""
"DELETE FROM rhnPackageRepodata;\n"
"INSERT INTO rhnRepoRegenQueue (id, CHANNEL_LABEL, REASON, FORCE)\n"
"(SELECT sequence_nextval('rhn_repo_regen_queue_id_seq'),\n"
"        C.label,\n"
"        'cached data regeneration',\n"
"        'Y'\n"
"        FROM rhnChannel C);\n"
"\\q\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} Administrators can add new users, grant permissions, and "
"deactivate or delete users.  If you are managing a large number of users, "
"you can assign users to system groups to manage permissions at a group "
"level.  You can also change the system defaults for the {webui}, including "
"language and theme defaults."
msgstr "ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ສາມາດເພີ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່, ມອບສິດການໃຊ້ງານ, ແລະ ປິດໃຊ້ງານ ຫຼື ລຶບຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້. ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງຈັດການຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດມອບໝາຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມລະບົບເພື່ອຈັດການສິດໃນລະດັບກຸ່ມ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປ່ຽນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລະບົບສຳລັບ {webui}, ລວມທັງພາສາ ແລະ ຮູບແບບ (theme) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Users`` menu is only available if you are logged in with the "
"{productname} administrator account."
msgstr "ເມນູ [guimenu]``Users`` ຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ (administrator) ຂອງ {productname} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To manage {productname} users, navigate to menu:Users[User List > All] to "
"see all users in your {productname} Server.  Each user in the list shows the "
"username, real name, assigned roles, the date the user last signed in, and "
"the current status of the user.  Click btn:[Create User] to create a new "
"user account.  Click the username to go to the [guimenu]``User Details`` "
"page."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຈັດການຜູ້ໃຊ້ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Users[User List > All] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທັງໝົດໃນເຊີເວີ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແຕ່ລະຄົນໃນລາຍຊື່ຈະສະແດງຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ຊື່ແທ້, ບົດບາດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບມອບໝາຍ, ວັນທີທີ່ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຄັ້ງສຸດທ້າຍ, ແລະ ສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ຄລິກ btn:[Create User] ເພື່ອສ້າງບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່. ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໄປທີ່ໜ້າ [guimenu]``User Details``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To add new users to your organization, click btn:[Create User], complete the "
"details for the new user, and click btn:[Create Login]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Create User], ກອກຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Create Login]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Password requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງລະຫັດຜ່ານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:7
msgid "{productname} is shipped with a selection of default values."
msgstr "{productname} ມາພ້ອມກັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To ensure that all new user passwords adhere to the organization's security "
"standards, {productname} administrator has the option to enforce the "
"password creation rules."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ທັງໝົດເປັນໄປຕາມມາດຕະຖານຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງອົງກອນ, ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ມີຕົວເລືອກໃນການບັງຄັບໃຊ້ກົດລະບຽບການສ້າງລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Password "
"Policy] to define the password requirements.  Use a combination of the "
"following fields:"
msgstr "ໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Password Policy] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ໂດຍໃຊ້ການປະສົມປະສານຂອງຟິວ (fields) ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Min Password Length"
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວລະຫັດຜ່ານຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:11
msgid "Use this field to define the minimal length of password."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີ້ນເພື່ອມກຳນົດຄວາມຍາວຂັ້ນຕ່ຳຂອງລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Max Password Length"
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວລະຫັດຜ່ານສູງສຸດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:13
msgid "Use this field to define the maximum length of password."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີ້ນເພື່ອມກຳນົດຄວາມຍາວສູງສຸດຂອງລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Require Digits"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງມີຕົວເລກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Use this field to specify whether the password must include the digits "
"(0-9)."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີ້ນເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານຕ້ອງມີຕົວເລກ (0-9) ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Require Lowercase Characters"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງມີຕົວອັກສອນພິມນ້ອຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Use this field to specify whether the password must include the lowercase "
"characters (a-z)."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີ້ນເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານຕ້ອງມີຕົວອັກສອນພິມນ້ອຍ (a-z) ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Require Uppercase Characters"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງມີຕົວອັກສອນພິມໃຫຍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Use this field to specify whether the password must include the uppercase "
"characters (A-Z)."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີ້ນເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານຕ້ອງມີຕົວອັກສອນພິມໃຫຍ່ (A-Z) ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restrict Consecutive Characters"
msgstr "ຈຳກັດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ລຽງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:21
msgid "Use this field to specify whether the restricted consecutive characters."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີ້ນເພື່ອລະບຸການຈຳກັດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ລຽງກັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Require Special Characters"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງມີຕົວອັກສອນພິເສດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Use this field to specify whether the password must include special "
"characters."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີ້ນເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານຕ້ອງມີຕົວອັກສອນພິເສດ ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Allowed Special Characters"
msgstr "ຕົວອັກສອນພິເສດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:25
msgid ""
"This field is enable only of the [literal]``Require Special Characters`` is "
"selected.  Use it to specify which special characters are allowed, for "
"example [literal]``!@#$%&*``, and others."
msgstr "ຟິວນີ້ນຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເລືອກ [literal]``Require Special Characters`` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າອະນຸຍາດຕົວອັກສອນພິເສດໃດແດ່, ຕົວຢ່າງ: [literal]``!@#$%&*``, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restrict Character Occurences"
msgstr "ຈຳກັດການເກີດຊ້ຳຂອງຕົວອັກສອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:27
msgid "Use this field to specify restricted character occurences."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີ້ນເພື່ອລະບຸການຈຳກັດການເກີດຊ້ຳຂອງຕົວອັກສອນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Max Character Occurences"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການເກີດຊ້ຳສູງສຸດຂອງຕົວອັກສອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:29
msgid "Use this field to specify maximum character occurences."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີ້ນເພື່ອລະບຸຈຳນວນສູງສຸດທີ່ຕົວອັກສອນສາມາດເກີດຊ້ຳໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:30
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to save any of the changed password settings."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:31
msgid "Use btn:[Reset] to change any settings to the default ones."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ btn:[Reset] ເພື່ອປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່າງໆກັບຄືນໄປເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:32
msgid "{productname} is shipped with the following default values:"
msgstr "{productname} ມາພ້ອມກັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:33
msgid "Min Password Length: 4"
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວລະຫັດຜ່ານຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ: 4"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:34
msgid "Max Password Length: 32"
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວລະຫັດຜ່ານສູງສຸດ: 32"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:35
msgid "Require Uppercase Characters: checked"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງມີຕົວອັກສອນພິມໃຫຍ່: ເລືອກໄວ້"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deactivate and Delete Accounts"
msgstr "ການປິດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ການລຶບບັນຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:37
msgid ""
"You can deactivate or delete user accounts if they are no longer required.  "
"Deactivated user accounts can be reactivated at any time.  Deleted user "
"accounts are not visible, and cannot be retrieved."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປິດໃຊ້ງານ ຫຼື ລຶບບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫາກບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ງານອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ. ສ່ວນບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຖືກລຶບຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Users can deactivate their own accounts.  However, if users have an "
"administrator role, the role must be removed before the account can be "
"deactivated."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດປິດໃຊ້ງານບັນຊີຂອງຕົນເອງໄດ້. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າຜູ້ໃຊ້ມີບົດບາດເປັນຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ (administrator), ບົດບາດນັ້ນຕ້ອງຖືກຖອນອອກກ່ອນຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດປິດໃຊ້ງານບັນຊີໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Deactivated users cannot log in to the {productname} {webui} or schedule any "
"actions.  Actions scheduled by a user prior to their deactivation remain in "
"the action queue.  Deactivated users can be reactivated by {productname} "
"administrators."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {productname} {webui} ຫຼື ຕັ້ງກຳນົດເວລາການດຳເນີນການໃດໆໄດ້. ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຕັ້ງກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ກ່ອນການປິດໃຊ້ງານຈະຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນຄິວການດຳເນີນການ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານສາມາດຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ໂດຍຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Roles"
msgstr "ບົດບາດຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Users can be assigned multiple roles, and there can be more than one user "
"holding any role at any time.  There must always be at least one active "
"{productname} Administrator."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ມີຫຼາຍບົດບາດໄດ້, ແລະ ສາມາດມີຜູ້ໃຊ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງຄົນທີ່ຖືບົດບາດໃດໜຶ່ງໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຕ້ອງມີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຄົນສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:42
msgid ""
"To change a user's roles, except for the {productname} Administrator role, "
"navigate to menu:Users[User List > All], select the user to change, and "
"check or uncheck the administrator roles as required."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນບົດບາດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້, ຍົກເວັ້ນບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Users[User List > All], ເລືອກຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:43
msgid ""
"To change a user's {productname} Administrator role, navigate to "
"menu:Admin[Users] and check or uncheck [guimenu]``{productname} Admin?`` as "
"required."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Admin[Users] ແລ້ວເລືອກ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກ [guimenu]``{productname} Admin?`` ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Role Permissions"
msgstr "ສິດການໃຊ້ງານຕາມບົດບາດຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Role Name | Description\n"
"| {productname} Administrator | Can perform all functions, including "
"changing privileges of other users.\n"
"| Organization Administrator | Manages activation keys, configurations, "
"channels, and system groups.\n"
"| Activation Key Administrator | Manages activation keys.\n"
"| Image Administrator | Manages image profiles, builds, and stores.\n"
"| Configuration Administrator | Manages system configuration.\n"
"| Channel Administrator | Manages software channels, including making "
"channels globally subscribable, and creating new channels.\n"
"| System Group Administrator | Manages systems groups, including creating "
"and deleting system groups, adding clients to existing groups, and managing "
"user access to groups.\n"
"| Regular User | Provides standard level of access. Newly created users are "
"automatically assigned to this role.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຊື່ບົດບາດ | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
"| ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} | ສາມາດປະຕິບັດໄດ້ທຸກຟັງຊັນ, ລວມທັງການປ່ຽນສິດທິຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"| ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບອົງກອນ | ຈັດການ activation keys, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ຊ່ອງທາງ (channels), ແລະ ກຸ່ມລະບົບ.\n"
"| ຜູ້ດູແລ Activation Key | ຈັດການ activation keys.\n"
"| ຜູ້ດູແລ Image | ຈັດການໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ (image), ການບິວດ໌ (builds), ແລະ ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"
"| ຜູ້ດູແລການຕັ້ງຄ່າ | ຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງລະບົບ.\n"
"| ຜູ້ດູແລຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel) | ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ, ລວມທັງການເຮັດໃຫ້ຊ່ອງທາງສາມາດສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄດ້ທົ່ວໂລກ, ແລະ ການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງໃໝ່.\n"
"| ຜູ້ດູແລກຸ່ມລະບົບ | ຈັດການກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ລວມທັງການສ້າງ ແລະ ລຶບກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ການເພີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມທີ່ມີຢູ່, ແລະ ການຈັດການການເຂົ້າເຖິງກຸ່ມຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້.\n"
"| ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປ | ໃຫ້ລະດັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງມາດຕະຖານ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ສ້າງໃໝ່ຈະຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ບົດບາດນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating Additional Roles"
msgstr "ການສ້າງບົດບາດເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:47
msgid ""
"With Role-Based Access Control in {productname}, you can create additional "
"roles to fine-tune user permissions.  Refer to "
"xref:administration:role-based-access-control.adoc[] for more detailed "
"information about these roles."
msgstr "ດ້ວຍການຄວບຄຸມການເຂົ້າເຖິງຕາມບົດບາດ (Role-Based Access Control) ໃນ {productname}, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງບົດບາດເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອປັບຈູນສິດການໃຊ້ງານຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃຫ້ລະອຽດຂຶ້ນ. ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:administration:role-based-access-control.adoc[] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບບົດບາດເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Permissions and Systems"
msgstr "ສິດການໃຊ້ງານຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:49
msgid ""
"If you have created system groups to manage your clients, you can assign "
"groups to users for them to manage."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໄດ້ສ້າງກຸ່ມລະບົບເພື່ອຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດມອບໝາຍກຸ່ມເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາຈັດການໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:50
msgid ""
"To assign a user to a system group, navigate to menu:Users[User List], click "
"the username to edit, and go to the [guimenu]``System Groups`` tab.  Check "
"the groups to assign, and click btn:[Update Defaults]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອມອບໝາຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Users[User List], ຄລິກຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``System Groups``. ເລືອກກຸ່ມທີ່ຕ້ອງການມອບໝາຍ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Update Defaults]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:51
msgid ""
"You can also select one or more default system groups for a user.  When the "
"user registers a new client, it is assigned to the chosen system group by "
"default.  This allows the user to immediately access the newly registered "
"client."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເລືອກກຸ່ມລະບົບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໜຶ່ງກຸ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້. ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່, ມັນຈະຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຫາກໍ່ລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ໄດ້ທັນທີ."

#.  I really don't understand what this is. Need a sentence or two to explain it.  --LKB 2020-04-29
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:52
msgid ""
"To manage external groups, navigate to menu:Users[System Group "
"Configuration], and go to the [guimenu]``External Authentication`` tab.  "
"Click btn:[Create External Group] to create a new external group.  Give the "
"group a name, and assign it to the appropriate system group."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຈັດການກຸ່ມພາຍນອກ (external groups), ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Users[System Group Configuration], ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``External Authentication``. ຄລິກ btn:[Create External Group] ເພື່ອສ້າງກຸ່ມພາຍນອກໃໝ່. ຕັ້ງຊື່ກຸ່ມ, ແລະ ມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:53
msgid ""
"For more information about system groups, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:54
msgid ""
"To see the individual clients a user can administer, navigate to "
"menu:Users[User List], click the username to edit, and go to the "
"[guimenu]``Systems`` tab.  To carry out bulk tasks, you can select clients "
"from the list to add them to the system set manager."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດດູແລໄດ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Users[User List], ຄລິກຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Systems``. ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດວຽກງານແບບກຸ່ມ (bulk tasks), ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍຈາກລາຍຊື່ເພື່ອເພີ່ມພວກເຂົາເຂົ້າໃນ system set manager ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:55
msgid ""
"For more information about the system set manager, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ system set manager, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users and Channel Permissions"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ສິດການໃຊ້ງານຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:57
msgid ""
"You can assign users to software channels within your organization either as "
"a subscriber that consumes content from channels, or as an administrator, "
"who can manage the channels themselves."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດມອບໝາຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວພາຍໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ ບໍ່ວ່າຈະໃນຖານະຜູ້ສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscriber) ທີ່ຊົມໃຊ້ເນື້ອຫາຈາກຊ່ອງທາງ, ຫຼື ໃນຖານະຜູ້ດູແລ (administrator) ທີ່ສາມາດຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:58
msgid ""
"To subscribe a user to a channel, navigate to menu:Users[User List], click "
"the username to edit, and go to the menu:Channel Permissions[Subscription] "
"tab.  Check the channels to assign, and click btn:[Update Permissions]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Users[User List], ຄລິກຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Channel Permissions[Subscription]. ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການມອບໝາຍ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Update Permissions]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:59
msgid ""
"To grant a user channel management permissions, navigate to menu:Users[User "
"List], click the username to edit, and go to the menu:Channel "
"Permissions[Management] tab.  Check the channels to assign, and click "
"btn:[Update Permissions]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອມອບສິດການຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Users[User List], ຄລິກຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Channel Permissions[Management]. ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການມອບໝາຍ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Update Permissions]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Some channels in the list might not be subscribable.  This is usually "
"because of the users administrator status, or the channels global settings."
msgstr "ບາງຊ່ອງທາງໃນລາຍຊື່ອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກຈະເກີດຈາກສະຖານະຜູ້ດູແລຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້, ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໂລກຂອງຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Default Language"
msgstr "ພາສາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:62
msgid ""
"When you create a new user, you can choose which language to use for the "
"{webui}.  After a user has been created, you can change the language by "
"navigating to menu:Home[My Preferences]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກພາສາທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ {webui}. ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນພາສາໄດ້ໂດຍການໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Home[My Preferences]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:63
msgid ""
"The default language is set in the ``rhn.conf`` configuration file.  To "
"change the default language, open the [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` file and "
"add or edit this line:"
msgstr "ພາສາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``rhn.conf``. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນພາສາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລ້ວເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "web.locale = <LANGCODE>\n"
msgstr "web.locale = <LANGCODE>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:65
msgid "If the parameter is not set, the default language is ``en_US``."
msgstr "ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີນີ້ໄວ້, ພາສາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະແມ່ນ ``en_US``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:66
msgid "These languages are available in {productname}:"
msgstr "ພາສາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໃນ {productname}:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:67
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Available Language Codes"
msgstr "ລະຫັດພາສາທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ"

