#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:71
msgid ""
"Translations in {uyuni} are provided by the community, and could be "
"incorrect or incomplete.  Where a translation is not available, the {webui} "
"defaults to English (``en_US``)."
msgstr "ການແປໃນ {uyuni} ແມ່ນໄດ້ມາຈາກຊຸມຊົນ, ແລະ ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື ບໍ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ. ໃນສ່ວນທີ່ບໍ່ມີຄຳແປ, {webui} ຈະສະແດງຜົນເປັນພາສາອັງກິດ (``en_US``) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Default Interface Theme"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ (Theme) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:73
msgid ""
"By default, the {productname} {webui} uses the theme appropriate to the "
"product you have installed.  You can change the theme to reflect the {uyuni} "
"or {susemgr} colors.  The {susemgr} theme also has a dark option available."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, {productname} {webui} ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຮູບແບບໃຫ້ເປັນສີຂອງ {uyuni} ຫຼື {susemgr} ໄດ້. ຮູບແບບ {susemgr} ຍັງມີຕົວເລືອກໂໝດມືດ (dark option) ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານນຳອີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:74
msgid ""
"You can change the default theme in the ``rhn.conf`` configuration file.  To "
"change the default theme, open the [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` file and add "
"or edit this line:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``rhn.conf``. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລ້ວເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "web.theme_default = <THEME>\n"
msgstr "web.theme_default = <THEME>\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "Available WebUI Themes"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ WebUI ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Theme Name     | Colors    | Style\n"
"| ``suse-light`` | {susemgr} | Light\n"
"| ``suse-dark``  | {susemgr} | Dark\n"
"| ``uyuni``      | {uyuni}   | Light\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຊື່ຮູບແບບ | ສີ | ແບບ\n"
"| ``suse-light`` | {susemgr} | ສະຫວ່າງ\n"
"| ``suse-dark`` | {susemgr} | ມືດ\n"
"| ``uyuni`` | {uyuni} | ສະຫວ່າງ\n"

